 successful completions."eThe Monument is best reached by sea. Should you wish to visit, I will see you there immediately."AThat is all. I will distract you no further, young champion."+She must really want to talk with you."Hello to you, young one."It is I, Dr. Hekata."TDo not worry about how I learned of your cellphone number. I simply divined it."2I have a topic to discuss of some importance."PI beseech you—<imp>visit my abode in Grouz</imp>. There we shall discuss.",They must really want to talk with you."DApologies for the interruption to your adventure, young master."wHowever, given that you've sent a number of Pokemon to Storage, I thought it best that I inform you of my project."GTo make it short: Your family owns an unused Estate here in Makya."pSince you're taking on the Makyan Gym Challenge, I took the initiative to renovate the grounds for our use."dI've set up a system that sends the Pokemon you store in your PC to this <imp>PokÉstate</imp>."GI'll take care of them there while you are busy with your journey."pI love Pokemon variety, so I've prepared lots of <imp>EXP Candy</imp> to give you as your collection grows."COnce you've earned some, I'll send them to you through the PC."nI'll continue to wait for you on the boat. If you want to visit the PokÉstate, send me a ping at any PC."%I'll take you there immediately."?That is all. I will distract you no further, young master."A\i[TAROTAMULET]The Tarot Amulet spasms like something dying."uYou feel your pupils dilate and somewhere bleak and broken almost comes into view at the corners of your vision."SA woman’s voice whispers from that place – almost familiar, but not quite."8You shouldn’t have reversed that amulet, dearest."<The woman who gave it to you was trying to protect you."QNow, though, charms for safe beginnings turn to invitations of dire endings."gMaybe there’s something to learn from interlacing your journey with the path of ordeals, though."zEnjoy this brief, bitter taste of the end, darling, and I’ll try and pull some strings should you prove victorious."3\i[TAROTAMULET]Once again the amulet twitches."UOnce again, you can almost make something out, just past your peripheral vision."Once again, she speaks."(Oh? You’re back, dearest. Lovely."UThese people are tied inextricably to this region’s secrets; its conspiracies."oLet me implant a bit of my demesne into theirs, and I might be able to tease them open like a faulty lock."@You want to know more, don’t you? Want them to trust you?")Then prepare to enjoy another trial.",\i[TAROTAMULET]It’s the amulet again."^It isn’t the thing itself that’s in pain. No, something else is – something larger."'Something is wrong in this region.",Another challenge, another opportunity."yI never put much stock into mysticism until my hand was forced. I’m so glad to see my investment paying dividends."MThese people don’t even know I’m threading their fate through yours!"cI paint an impressed expression on their malleable faces – so long as you can walk the walk."/Go on, dearest. You know the rules by now."R\i[TAROTAMULET]The reversed amulet spasms and the other place impends on you."-That voice… it’s painfully familiar."*Oh, you already know who I am, child."nI’m the one that’s waiting for you at the end of the line. The end of your line… and of every line."&Makya is a place rich in history."VThat’s why you endure these tastes of my demesne, isn’t it? To learn history?"=Well, even history ends. You’ll understand eventually."6Go on. Show me what a conqueror you are, darling."Z\i[TAROTAMULET]At this point, you can almost hear fate whimpering through the amulet."3Her voice shushes it, but does not comfort it."�Where did Imogene get this thing? I doubt she realized the significance of the sliver of stone she implanted within this amulet."QIt was uplifted from a forbidden place where history is tortuous and frayed."�Its latent power, the witch’s arcana, and, of course, my… expertise… all aligned to make my little bits of influence possible."-I hope you feel lucky, darling: you are."Always."\i[TAROTAMULET]....."MThere’s something calming about the hellscape you can almost perceive."*It’s a calm hell; quiet and somber." Her voice is much the same."�If only I could twist these gym leaders’ roles without having to suffuse their arenas with my demesne and all its… antipathy."*History ends quietly, but not kindly."OHere, our day-to-day lives are much like what you endure in these battles."Oh, don’t pity me. My only point is that I would gladly spare you the intensity of fate’s dying gasps if I could, trust me."Trust me, darling."v\i[TAROTAMULET]As the amulet twists and writhes, you can feel the tension of invisible threads being pulled taut."8They are wrapped around the amulet, and around you."sSomewhere behind you they frayed into thousands of strands, and ahead of you they extend to somewhere distant."There they all end.":You understand by now, don’t you? Makya is history.">You, darling, are a history to me – a singular history."3And I am a singular history projected forward."�You have the benefit of what we’ll call a privileged reference frame, and I thank you dearly for letting me glimpse through your eyes at it."0Not to mention making a few… alterations."+Don’t think too hard on it, dearest.".\i[TAROTAMULET]The amulet has gone still."^Something is changing – the threads are being woven back together, or severed, or both."4Someone is taking matters into their own hands."No, that isn’t me."0We both know who it is, though, don’t we?"dYou should probably stop her from doing that, or one of us could end up in the other’s place."IYou were not made for the terminus, and I was not made for a utopia."=And no human was made for the paradise she’s planning.",…\PN, you know who I am, don’t you?"]We won’t be speaking for a little while, but know that I’m watching over you, child."My child."…Agonizingly familiar."[But, still, she is a stranger to you, this woman who almost has your mother’s voice."	\PN."$I’m swallowing my pride here."EI need your help with something... more important than my pride."You like that, don't you?"5Helping people? Earning some coin along the way?"iI know things are dire everywhere right now, but… that’s why I need someone of your skill level."?Someone with experience cleaning up Team Chasm's mistakes."TMeet me in the <imp>Circuit Cave</imp>. It's under the <imp>Canal Desert</imp>."…He hung up."?The last of the genies whooshed past me a few moments ago.">I poked my head out to check where they're flying off to.".East, across the ocean. I've no idea why."WShit! The Drillers spotted them too. I can see them sending out some Flying-types."DMeet me in the Sandstone Estuary, on that sandbar full of junk."Quickly!"No."Why are you down here?"Who are you?"Whose Pokémon are those?"How do you know?"I doubt it."You want it gone?"What are they good for?"I'm busy."	Why?"On my way."A few badges."Not really."Why would I tell you?"Just beat Helena."	One."Shut up."Making headway."Couldn't be better."There's been trouble."More work?"	Yep!"Not this again.[�"即时新闻！"s最近在马凯亚附近的海域，发现了一座新的岛屿，我现在就在这座<imp>三相岛</imp>。"e因为这里发现了极其罕见的精灵，目前世界各地都有训练师向此地进发。"z由于目前没有任何一个地区，对此岛屿宣称了主权，因此很多派别都于岛上建立了营地。"{我们目前唯一可以确定的是，这里的训练师们会为了争夺领地，进入这片新世界而展开战斗。";这次的报道到此结束，谢谢大家的收看。",啊...那个，你想问我什么吗？"V那你...能不能...不要这样...一直盯着我看？我...不喜欢这样。"�我只是喜欢...我...是个流浪者。或者说...不是流浪...只是...我没有家...我...抱歉，大部分时间...我都待在山洞里。"�我不知道...不是，我是说...我知道...但是我不确定...不对，这是个什么问题？我是个精灵训练师。"S或者说以前是...并且我...擅长这个。并且...其他方面不行。"n一个朋友的，只是朋友...我...擅长...所以他们...委托我帮忙训练...我...有成绩。"P我是说，这...不是我的想法...我...我...我...继续前进吧。"#喂，\PN，听说你很忙。"Y你不会徽章都能堆成小山了吧？哈，梅维斯肯定会为你骄傲的。",这不是恭维，陈述事实而已。"w但现在的情况是，你得来见我，不然你哪儿也去不了，至于原因，让我气得解释不了。".我会给你带一份<imp>礼物</imp>。"�我跟其中2个...或者说一个道馆馆主是朋友关系，刚想到的另一个朋友，是拉斐尔身边的护林员队长。" 所以消息来得很快。"^而且我清楚，如果没有我的帮助，你没有可以<imp>过河</imp>的方法。"啊。"/也对，梅维斯...是那个梅维斯。"D你知道你...啊，算了，总之你应该想要奖品吧。"=你现在是不是在为<imp>过河</imp>的事发愁？"/或许你可以试试完成我的安排..."2不过...我得先说清楚需要做什么。"q这算是交换条件？我知道你已经帮我把几个化身，从我的“追杀名单”上划掉了。"J这让我不得不说一句：你比大部分护林员