lace glowing last night."3I thought this place was supposed to be scary."Just seems peaceful to me."$Eek! You're the scary one here!"(I'm afraid of bugs, but not ghosts."4To be honest, this town hasn't been that scary.";I'm having a good time, so I'll hang out here for now.",Got some rare things on sale, stranger!"Come back anytime."East: Repora Forest"South: Barren Crater",No earthlings allowed: that's the rule."7By the power of the Moon Stone, I will punish you!"%What? Friendship wasn't enough!?"<You're really gonna invade our special space like this?">I haven't been a real sailor since they scuttled my ship."I just like the clothes."	Shh."You want the stuff?"Forget you saw me."XFighting me's better than fighting any of those Avatars, I'd wager. Prove me right?"Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."	Boo!"%I bow to thee, oh masterful one."'Eh, that was pretty good, I guess."(Heal up your party, get back to me."2Some rangers set up a rest spot to the south."TYou unlocked Rafael's front door?! That sure saves me the time and frustration."0Much appreciated, fellow trainer! Off I go!"|Rafael may have a layer of earth protecting him from the surface, but it doesn't protect him from my astral projection."bI've been watching his battles with some fervor. I wish to grasp the essence of his strategy."'It is, at its core, about dancing."WHis Oricorio and Alolan Marowak both gain power from dancing done by their allies."JIf one was feeling particularly devilish, one could aquire a Hattrem."UThat witch has a special ability which can prevent Pokemon from utilizing dance."^There's supposed to be a gym leader around here, but he's not keen on taking challengers."6He lives <imp>underground</imp> like some hermit."8Even locked himself up to make it harder to get in."NApparently the <imp>lock combination code</imp> is somewhere in the town."JThis is all a bit too mental for me right now, so I'm taking a break."PA small handmade sign. It lists an eight-digit co