. I’ve been, uh, yeah, through the wringer, y’know?"*But you just gotta keep your head up."&Anyways, how about a quick match?"MPhione here hasn’t been slacking, and I want to show it a proper duel."You down?"cOh, yeah, take your time. I think I might need a few minutes to get Phione psyched up anyways."'Thanks. Don’t go easy on me, OK?"Whoa. We actually did it."GNot without some scrapes here and there – wait, let me heal you.".Figure I might as well pay you back, huh?"^Uh, kinda? I’ve trained worse, but, uh, this little fella isn’t exactly a juggernaut.">I wouldn’t be quaking in my boots if I had to face one."7OK, I think Phione’s good to go. Ready to fight?"3Good fight, good fight! Phione, you did great."OI mean, \PN, you obviously did way better, but, hey, that’s how it goes."wI used to do a lot better than this. Was pretty good, if I do say so myself, but, eh, it wasn’t really worth it."pYou ever run into someone yelling at his Pokémon after he loses and just think, like, who raised this guy?"DLike, yeah, you get results, but it’s not really sustainable."UThey have to feel like living, feeling beings first, and tools of battle second."Or, like, fifth."&You get what I’m saying, right?"fFigured as much. Look at me talking at you as if you aren’t obviously a better trainer than me."rI’m OK, but I make a lot of sloppy mistakes. Still trying to learn that whole positive reinforcement thing."LYou just gotta make them feel loved, and then they’ll try their best."RPushing them hard wrings potential out of them faster, but it burns them out."CEventually they’ll snap back, or just give up. Or leave you."iWell, sure, but they’re more than tools. They’re alive, and they have their own wants and needs."XAnd if you kinda lean into that, it works so much better than ordering them around."\Or… maybe not. Obviously you know what you’re doing. I’m not gonna preach to you."RI’ve talked enough. Probably should be listening more, but, uh, I gotta go."LMakya’s a big place, and Phione and I are gonna tour the whole thing."FAnd the rest of us, of course. So, uh, see you. And thanks again."!I totally lost my surfboard!"At least I can swim."xLi'l bit of havoc going down around here, just like the good ol' days! I'll show ya why we used to be the top dogs!"OBeaten by another freakishly-talented kid? Deja vu, that's what that is..."TAh, you ain't nothing. I could beat you any day of the week. Just not... today."%Prizca Sewers Auxiliary Entrance"hA line which might have read "Authorized Personnel Only" has been crisscrossed with crude graffiti."Prizca Bridge"North: Prizca West"South: County Park"West: Frostflow Farms"East: Eleig Stretch"YI was thinking of bringing my toddlers to see the bridge. Guess that plan is ruined."Field trip's cancelled!";I'll look on my phone for anything interesting nearby."(Maybe I schedule a trip to the Gym?"YWhy'd they send a waitress to keep watch when an avatar's on the prowl? This is why!"}So, uh, when I said "this is why!" I was supposed to then beat you, and that, uh, didn't happen. So... I'm just gonna go now."dWell, uh... I guess you're gonna have to cover my shift, 'cause I gotta go hit the Pokécenter."aNow that the bridge is gone, I can swim in peace. Or I could if it wasn't for kids like you!"7Wow, you're just as annoying as the cars. I'm out."ECool surfing kid, but don't put me in the splash zone next time."DNo one else comes here, so I guess we're just a little strange."Great."
Fine."Could be better."Let me prep."Sure, let's go."Aren't Phione strong?"Of course."I guess?"They make good tools.[P"\由于埃利格河位于马凯亚的中心，因此成为了训练师们的聚集地。"5东部河道上的训练师相对随和一些。"5朝那个方向可以直接到沙漠研究站。"P而西边河道的训练师就严肃多了，尤其是启明之窟附近。"树果还在生长中。"嘿，你还记得我吗?"E我是艾维恩，带着霏欧纳的那位。你最近怎么样?")太好了，你是在挑战道馆？"5我在说什么啊...这不是肯定的事吗..."M没人会为了好玩带着这么强力的队伍。祝你挑战顺利。"M啊，我不是想打听什么。只是很高兴看到你过得不错。"J啊，大概能理解。呃，我也曾经历过...类似的状况。"8但你微笑着面对一切，挺过难关就好。"0不管怎样，来一场速战速决如何?"J霏欧纳可不是吃素的，我要好好展现一下它的实力。"你准备好了吗？"V哦，没问题，慢慢来。我也得花一些时间让霏欧纳准备准备。"&谢谢，请不要手下留情。"#哇，我们真的做到了。"M有些磕碰也是在所难免的...稍等，让我帮你治疗一下。",我一直觉得，该报答你一下。"q呃，还好吧？我见过更难对付的精灵，而且...呃...这个小家伙也不是啥凶猛巨兽。"P我之前对上的要是这小家伙，也不会被吓得瑟瑟发抖了。"J好了，我感觉霏欧纳准备好了，可以开始战斗了吗？"8打得好，打得好！霏欧纳，干得漂亮。"G虽然\PN，你的表现更好，但嘿嘿，事实就是事实。"]要我来说的话，我以前那会儿更强呢，但是....呃，过去就不提了。"�你有没有遇到过那种输掉比赛后对自身的精灵大发雷霆的人？你会不会觉得那些家伙...很没教养？"J或许那样能让他们多赢一场，但并不利于长久发展。"k培育精灵就要让它们意识到自身存在的重要，其次才是把它们当作对战工具。"#呃...感觉还要往后排..."&你能明白我什么意思吧？"P我觉得也是，这么跟你说话，搞得好像我比你优秀一样。"q我的水平也就...那样吧，经常犯一些粗心大意的错误，最近才开始学习心理强化。">只要让它们感受到爱，它们就会全力以赴。"_对它们过度施压虽然能更快地榨取出潜力，但也会让它们身心交瘁。"P最终只会反噬到自身，要么干脆摆烂，要么永远离开你。"q好吧，当然，但它们不仅仅是工具。它们也是生命，它们也有自身的欲望和需求。"P如果你能稍微顺应这点，那比直接命令它们效果好得多。"\或许...也不一定。显然你知道自身在干什么，我就不对你说教了。"V我说得已经够多了，也许你并不介意，但是...呃，我得走了。"V马凯亚地区面积不小，我和霏欧纳要游遍这里的每一处角落。"V当然，还有我的其他精灵，那么，呃，再见，再次谢谢你啦。"我的冲浪板丢了！"好在我会游泳。"~最近这里有一些小骚动，就像我所怀念的以前一样！我会向你展示我们曾是顶尖训练师的原因！"J又被另一个天赋异禀的小鬼打败了？怎么总是这样..."S啊，你什么都不是。我哪天都能赢你。只不过不是...今天。" 宏礼下水道辅助出口"M下面大概写着“仅限工作人员”，但被粗暴地划掉了。"宏礼大桥"北：西宏礼市"南：国立公园"西：风霜农场"东：埃利格中游"S我本来想带孩子们来大桥这边玩的，现在看来计划泡汤了。"活动取消！"D我该去网上查查，周围有什么其他有趣的地方。" 或许...道馆一日游？"Y为什么在化身四处游荡时派一名女服务员来看守？这就是原因！"}所以，嗯，当我说“这就是原因！”的时候，本该揍你一顿，但是...好吧...我现在得走了。"G呃，嗯...你得替我值班了，因为我要去精灵中心。"\现在桥没了，如果不是因为你这样的小孩，我早就能安心游泳了！"8哇，你跟那些车一样讨厌，我得走了。";小子，冲浪很酷，但下次别溅我一身水。"5居然没有人来这里，这也太奇怪了。"很好"还行"不太好"稍等一会儿"好，来吧"霏欧纳很强吗？"没错"大概吧"工具，好用;[P"oSince the Eleig River is in the halfway point of Makya, it's become quite the gathering spot for Trainers."QThe trainers on the long stretch of river to the East are relatively casual.":That is, until you reach the desert research station."hThe trainers to the west are a bit more serious, espe