g to take notes this time."bI’ll admit it: I’m curious. What do you bring to the table that no other challenger does?"`No matter what praise Tamarind or the others heap upon you, don’t let it go to your head."/I’m rather more rigorous in my analyses."Let’s begin."?All of that work to get here and now you test my patience?"-Ugh. Go. I can work while you’re gone."*I reared Team Chasm from its infancy."<I turned this place from wilderness to a modern region."%I am the beating heart of Makya."HFine! One of us needs to be humbled. Show me which one of us it is."QDon’t expect this to be easy simply because I work from behind the scenes.")I made this region what it is today."]Show me what you can do – or are you just what you’ve inherited from Mavis? Show me!"SNo! I can’t – how? Eight years and I still can’t beat an arrogant child!">No, no, you and your Pokémon deserve the Patience Badge."8No, no, you and your Pokémon deserve that victory."sJust do me a favor and beat Tamarind just as badly someday. You’re not the only one with a childish rivalry."^Although – and you may know where I’m going with this – there is one other thing..."@My decision to not employ gym trainers is paying dividends."2Now there’s no one to watch me keep losing."5Your victory was unexpected, but not undeserved."/You’re not the child I thought you were."(I’m happy to give you this badge."dOh, and I would be very interested in another duel – there’s more for me to learn from you."MI’ll make the time, whenever you want to give me yours. Good day, \PN."FA screensaver image of a Luxray bounces lazily around the screen."Yo, champ in the making!"*Helena runs a tight ship around here."=Even I can't get away with just standing around all day!"oHelena understands that efficiency comes from information, and information from the flow of communication."RThat's why she's focused her gym around Electric-type and Water-type Pokemon!"=They're a strong pair in battles, sharing no weaknesses."Firstly, Grass-type Pokemon are your best bet against her, since they're strong against Water- types, and resist Electric."JSecondarily, Dragon-type Pokemon will resist both Water and Electric."UFinally, mirroring her with Electric-type Pokemon of your own can work well too."=They're strong against Water-types, and resist Electric."Hope that helps!"5You out-maneuvered Team Chasm's best strategist!":Congratulations, I hope you feel good about that one!"gWe were initially hesitant to partake in constructing gyms, but we chose to do so for two reasons."%Firstly, it provided legitimacy."KSecondly, it allowed us to find exceptional trainers such as yourself."~I would like you to take this key, with the understanding that through the door it unlocks is a particularly dangerous avatar."4Obliterate it. Show me that our search is over."QYou'll find the problem at the north wall of Team Chasm HQ. Well, former HQ."uThe avatar still exists. I’m patient, but I would be lying if I said I didn’t yearn for the day it was gone."+It is my most-despised responsibility.",Search the north wall of Team Chasm HQ."It’s gone?"~I never thought I’d share Andris’s joy in seeing a problem -- how would he put it? -- deep-sixed, but this does feel good."[Thank you. That’s a weight off of my shoulders, not to mention proof my idea worked."Good day, \PN."And thank you."Oh... good. You."6I’m going to be honest: I’m not really a fan."GOh, don’t take it personally. I don’t like anyone around here."OAs soon as I’ve got my fortune, I’m leaving this damned region behind."yI’m going to live on a megayacht in the warm Alolan waters, writing semi-autobiographical erotica under a penname.";And I never have to think about any of you ever again."\Well, maybe I’ll invite Tamarind. Just to rub it in her face, of course. Of course..."Not yet."Let's.[D"2稍等...好了，这次我会做笔记的。"S我承认，我很好奇。你身上有哪些其他挑战者所没有的点？"_无论塔玛琳或者其他人对你的评价有多高，也不要被赞誉冲昏头脑。",我会更严谨地分析你的能力。"现在开始吧。"2事已至此，你却来考验我的耐心？"/呃...行吧，我要继续做工作了。")我把裂隙队从襁褓中养大。"D在这个地区的荒郊野岭里，建立了一座座城镇。")我就是马凯亚跳动的心脏。"Y看来今天我们之间，得有个人被搓搓锐气了，你觉得会是谁呢？"2别以为我在幕后工作就好对付了。"5是我让这个地区变成了今天的样子。"w你到底是有真材实料，还是仅靠梅维斯的名声被吹捧出来的？就让我好好见识一下吧！"_不！不可能！怎么会...八年了，我竟然还是打不过一个狂妄的小鬼！"A算了，算了，你和你的精灵配得上耐心徽章。"A算了，算了，你和你的精灵配得上这场胜利。"�另外，答应我一件事，回头找个时间，像今天打败我一样，狠狠地教训一顿塔玛琳，不是只有你才有所谓的劲敌。"S另外...你可能已经知道我要说什么了，没错，还有一件事...">看来不雇佣道馆训练师，的确有很多好处。"#起码没人会看到我输。"8你的胜利出乎意料，但又在情理之中。"/与我之前的想法多少有些不同。"&我很乐意给你这枚徽章。"M我很愿意与你再来一场决斗，这对我来说也很有帮助。"D只要你想，我随时能抽出时间，祝你好运，\PN。"2伦琴猫的屏保在屏幕上跳来跳去。" 你好，未来的冠军！"/海伦娜对这里的管理非常严格。"2就算是我也不能整天站着做招待！"S她的理念是“效率来源于情报，情报来源于沟通与流动。”"V因此，作为她的道馆，这里专精的也是电属性和水属性精灵！"P这是两种配合起来很强力的属性，它们没有共同的弱点。"Y草属性精灵一定是最优选，既能克制水属性，也能抵抗电属性。"J再就是龙属性，可以同时抵抗水属性和电属性攻击。"M再有，如果你也使用电属性，或许也能很好地反制她。"P在某些情况下，电属性也能起到与草属性差不多的作用。" 希望这些对你有用！";你靠着策略打倒了裂隙队最强的战术家！";恭喜啊，希望你能好好享受此刻的心情！"e我们一开始对是否建造这座道馆有些犹豫，但考虑到两点还是这样做了。"!第1，是为了合法性。"K第2，是为了能够遇到一些，像你这样优秀的训练师。"w我希望你能拿上这把钥匙，同时你也要清楚地意识到，门后面是一个格外危险的化身。";只要将它消灭掉，这里的危机就解除了。"h你可以在裂隙队前总部的北墙上找到一扇那种特殊的门，记住，是前总部。"S这个化身不会脱困的，虽然我有耐心，但也想尽快消灭它。" 我很讨厌这种责任。"2记得去查看裂隙队前总部的北墙。"把它消灭了？"�没想到我会跟安德里斯一样，在问题解决时感到这么兴奋...用他的话怎么说来着？啊，终于搞定了，舒畅！"V谢谢你让我卸掉了身上的负担，同时证明了我想法的可行性。"祝你好运，\PN。"谢谢。"哦！哦...是你。"2实话实说，我并不是很想看到你。";别想太多，我只是讨厌这里的一切罢了。"D等我攒了足够的钱，就会离开这个该死的地方。"}我打算隐居在温暖的阿罗拉，在附近买一艘游艇做住所，取个笔名写写半自传体的小黄书。"J这样我就不用想起包括你在内的，这里的所有人了。"M呃...或许我会写塔玛琳？当然，她必然是丑角，必然..."稍等"来吧;[D"EOne moment – there we go. I’m going to take notes this time."bI’ll admit it: I’m curious. What do you bring to the table that no other challenger does?"`No matter what praise Tamarind or the others heap upon you, don’t let it go to your head."/I’m rather more rigorous in my analyses."Let’s begin."?All of that work to get here and now you test my patience?"-Ugh. Go. I can work while you’re gone."*I reared Team Chasm from its infancy."<I turned this place from wilderness to a modern region."%I am the beating heart of Makya."HFine! One of us needs to be humbled. Show me which one of us it is."QDon’t expect this to be easy simply because I work from behind the scenes.")I made this region what it is today."]Show me what you can do – or are you just what you’ve inherited