 entirely frozen now."-This little pond stays unfrozen however."_What could have caused such an abnormal change in temperature in such a concentrated area?"There you are.">I’ve had a chance to look more at the data on that USB."ZThe people you got this from really didn’t bother to scrub anything off of it, huh?"DI feel a little silly for spending all that time in the stacks."\All these findings and life's work worth of knowledge makes you feel very, very, small."TAre they satisfied to just, never act on the knowledge that they’ve obtained?"/Hey. This might be an odd question, but…"WCould you come and talk to me again when you have 4 or less Pokemon in your party?"[I think it’d be best if you come back when you have 4 or less Pokemon in your party."Great. Sorry."�Most trainers I’ve seen around the region only use parties of 4, so I felt a bit… Intimidated by your overwhelming strength."2I have another possibly odd question for you."5Have you ever caught a Legendary Pokemon before?"I was dreading that."UI don’t think I have it in me to let you become a hoarder like Team Chasm was."]These are forces of nature you’re messing with. And they need to be respected as such."&You need to know where you stand."!You need to know your place."Oh, good. Right, yeah!"HThat’d be ridiculous if you did. It’d be like owning an Avatar."eBut… The Seekers were able to work with The Crafter to attain some sort of harmony with those."^Even if I can find beauty in the primalness… Somehow, humanity managed to take control."T…If anyone should be worthy of inheriting the legacy of the Seekers, it's me."EI’m the one who put in all the time reading the research here."0I’m the one who picked their bones clean."QIf anyone should be worthy of inheriting the legacy of the Seekers, it's me."`Even when I pull out all the stops, when I try my best to defang you, you bite down anyway."|You’re not human… You know, for a moment, it really flashed in my mind that maybe I could do something with all of