dges."*They've gathered quite a bit of dust."A clean gas range stove."*A cheerful painting in a dusty frame."4Empty, save for a single container in the back."KYou highly doubt that whatever food was in it was the color it is now."A little dry."This clock has stopped.Iu;␀c[[8"vMy friend invited me to Makya. She failed to mention how untamed the region is. I presume you're another ruffian."cThe college is to the east, you say? Thank you! I'll make sure to mention your help to Lainie."@If it isn't one thing it's another! I'll be even later now.",Ya shouldn't be able to do that, kiddo."2Move on along now. We'll be back soon enough."XThe nature of Makya is so enduring! It's so charming how undeveloped everything is!"XWhat a lovely encounter with a local! Novo was so quaint, but I must go see Prizca!"TAnd Maykan battling is so fierce! It must be in such a rough and tumble region."hYou know, I heard that this region doesn't even have a proper GTS network! How do trainers manage?!"nDoes that girl over there have a Johtoan Furret? I've never seen one myself, only the ones here in Makya."..."@I should steal that Furret. I used to do that all the time."4I wonder if Johtoan Furrets are sought after..."JI bet Johtoan Furrets are worth quite a pretty penny here in Makya..."East: Novo Town"North-West: Repora Forest"South-West: Barren Crater"aI'm here to report on Trainer readiness for the Avatar Crisis. Care to show a demonstration?"�Off the record, there might be a party happening soon at the old research station in the Barren Crater. Maybe I'll see you there?"XI think I've some nice stuff from that. A sound bite might have been nice though..."JReporting on battles is a lot more interesting than my assigned task."bDeforestation concerns due to some dirt path? The road's almost a decade old at this point..."5Velenz is still dealing with its avatar problem."2I even had to leave because of all the chaos."DApparently, the Rangers are still struggling to reclaim Velenz."II heard they finally vanquished the avatar of Dusknoir in that area."=Won't bring back my house, but you know...it's progress."Dang, you sunk my team..."5...just like how my house sunk into the swamp..."EI love my little Linoone. I hope nothing bad ever happens to it."�Oh well, a loss in a battle is nothing new. Thankfully no life-altering trauma is headed my way! Let's go travel down some dark alleys Linoone!",Something bad happened to my Linoone..."6Oh Linoone, what would I ever do if I lost you..."�I'd probably snap, haha! I'd probably use my skills to inflict some horrible things, haha! Someone would become REAL scared of parasols, haha!"TA young challenger, hmm? The more things change, the more they stay the same..."VHah! I haven't fought a challenger like you since the Chasm days. G'luck, friend."nI figure if I stand right here, I can see most of the challengers heading for Rafael. Works like a charm." The berry plant is growing."0CAUTION: The route is considered dangerous!".Turn back if you have less than 3 badges."AA'right, sit still for the nice lady and let 'er do 'er job."fWe need live-fire data on the apparent surplus of experienced trainers in this quadrant of Makya."3So stand up straight and prepare for the exam!"iExceptional! Results in the third quartile, which, yes, I calculated mid-fight, thank you very much."{The best thing to do when these kindsa folks get like this is just to ignore them. They'll share what they want either way."jIndeed... perhaps a return to the College is warranted. This might even be statistically significant."�Results within one standard deviation of the mean... which is, incidentally, exactly the word I'd use to describe most of these trainers."=Ya did good, kiddo. We'll be back to conduct more tests."8Y'know how them folks get about their sample sizes."ITalking to me like this does demonstrate rather unusual abilities..."TWill you cease bothering me? I'm trying to massage this data into significance.[8"w我的朋友邀请我来马凯亚，但她完全没说这里如此荒凉落后，你不会也是个小流氓吧？"M你说大学在东边？谢谢，我会告诉兰妮你对我的帮助。")糟糕了！我现在要迟到了。"#你不该那么做，孩子。";现在继续前进吧，我们很快就会回来的。">马凯亚的自然风光经久不衰，是如此迷人！"q我喜欢与这里人们的邂逅！喜欢望新镇的古色古香，接下来一定要去宏礼市看看！"Y在马凯亚这样一个地形复杂的地方，连战斗都变得更加激烈了。"k你知道吗，这个地区，连GTS那种网络系统都没有，他们是怎么管理训练师的？"k那边那个女孩是不是有一只成都地区的大尾立？我之前只见过马凯亚的那种。"..."A我应该偷走她的大尾立...就像以前做的那样。"5不知道成都的大尾立是不是抢手货..."A我敢打赌，成都大尾立在马凯亚肯定很值钱..."东：望新镇"西北：枯槁森林"西南：荒莽火山"z我是一名记者，前来报道训练师们应对化身危机的准备情况。你能不能给我们演示一下？"t顺便说一句，荒莽火山的旧研究站很快会举办一场聚会，说不定我们能在那里见面？"P我在这里收集了不少信息，如果能剪出一个片子就好了..."/报道战斗比我的任务有趣多了。"S这条路已经有十年历史了...更之前，这里还是一整片森林。",夜幽市的化身问题依旧严重。",我不得不离开那混乱的地方。"2现在，护林员正努力收回夜幽市。";我听说他们消灭了那边的黑夜魔灵化身。">虽然我家估计已经废了...但这也算是大捷。"&啊，我的队伍被打败了..."/...就像我那沉入沼泽的家一样..."D我喜欢我的直冲熊，我希望我们能永远在一起。"z好吧，输一场也没什么大不了的。幸好这次的伤势并不重，我们去暗处养伤吧，直冲熊。"&我的直冲熊有点不对劲..."5直冲熊...如果没有你，我该怎么办..."}我可能会崩溃，哈哈！我会用我的技能做些什么，哈哈！我会让某些人害怕遮阳伞，哈哈！"D一个年轻的挑战者？嗯，变化越大，变化越小..."h哈，自裂隙时代结束后，我还没遇到过你这样的对手呢，祝你好运，朋友。"S我觉得只要站在这里，就能看到很多去找拉斐尔的挑战者。"树果还在生长中。"&警告：这个区域很危险！">如果你没有三枚或更多徽章，请原路返回。"J好吧，能不能给这位女士，提供一点她需要的数据。"S我需要一些实际的数据，来分析马凯亚训练师过剩的情况。"#所以，请接收测试吧！"{很不错，可以排在第3象限，没错，我已经在战斗中，将数据计算出来了，感谢你的协助。"V现在最好不要打扰她，这类人在研究中都会进入另一个世界。"S看起来...该回学校一趟了，这些可以试着做一下传统统计。"\结果在平均值的正常误差内...我对大部分训练师的评价都是如此。"D做的很好，孩子，我们之后会来做更多测试的。",你也想知道最后的结论对吧。";像这样跟我说话确实展示了你的不一般..."8你能不能别烦我了？我正在整理数据！;[8"vMy friend invited me to Makya. She failed to mention how untamed the region is. I presume you're another ruffian."cThe college is to the east, you say? Thank you! I'll make sure to mention your help to Lainie."@If it isn't one thing it's another! I'll be even later now.",Ya shouldn't be able to do that, kiddo."2Move on along now. We'll be back soon enough."XThe nature of Makya is so enduring! It's so charming how undeveloped everything is!"XWhat a lovely encounter with a local! Novo was so quaint, but I must go see Prizca!"TAnd Maykan battling is so fierce! It must be in such a rough and tumble region."hYou know, I heard that this region doesn't even have a proper GTS network! How do trainers manage?!"nDoes that girl over there have a Johtoan Furret? I've never seen one myself, only the ones 