e under Prizca.Iu;␀\[["\Everyone makes a fuss about how unreasonably cold it is in this little corner of Makya."eBut I don't hear anyone talking about that crater to the south. There's something evil about it."tOh, don't give me that look! If you live in Makya long enough, you'll start to believe some strange things too!"SI wanted to go spelunking in the Ice Cave, but the security here won't let me."sApparently the Cave got more dangerous recently, so they've restricted access to highly skilled trainers only.",I already paid for a night's stay here."What a waste of cash...."Welcome to Svait Lodge!"(We have no vacancies at the moment."'I apologize for the inconvenience."Wheeeewie!"It is cold out there!"UI thought my regular gear would be enough to keep me warm, but I sure was wrong."3The next time I'm in a Mart, I am stocking up.">Man, I am freezing. Where's a campfire when you need one?"JYou've already won the Eevee raffle, so you can't enter again. Sorry!"+I love to take walks around this town."CThere's something about the cold air here that helps me focus."_I've always found that contact with nature is the best way to clear your mind of troubles.["D人们都因为这个小镇子离奇的温度而大惊小怪。"M那南边散发着邪恶气息的火山口呢？怎么没人说那里！"n喂，别用那种眼神看我！你要是在马凯亚多呆一阵子，你就明白我什么意思了！">我想去冰之洞窟探险，但这里的保安不让。"b看来最近山洞变得更危险了，所以他们只允许实力强劲的训练师进入。"&我都已经把房间订好了。"真是浪费钱..." 欢迎来到霜皑旅馆！"#我们目前没有空房了。"/给您带来的不便，我深表歉意。"嘶...哈！"外面真冷!"2本以为普通的保暖装备就够用了。"5下次去超市的时，必须得多备些货。"M伙计，我都快冻死了，越是需要的时候越找不到篝火。"J你已经兑换过奖品伊布，所以不能再参加了，抱歉！"&我喜欢在这个镇上散步。"5这里的冷空气有助于我集中注意力。"G我一直觉得与大自然接触是放松心情的最佳途径。;["\Everyone makes a fuss about how unreasonably cold it is in this little corner of Makya."eBut I don't hear anyone talking about that crater to the south. There's something evil about it."tOh, don't give me that look! If you live in Makya long enough, you'll start to believe some strange things too!"SI wanted to go spelunking in the Ice Cave, but the security here won't let me."sApparently the Cave got more dangerous recently, so they've restricted access to highly skilled trainers only.",I already paid for a night's stay here."What a waste of cash...."Welcome to Svait Lodge!"(We have no vacancies at the moment."'I apologize for the inconvenience."Wheeeewie!"It is cold out there!"UI thought my regular gear would be enough to keep me warm, but I sure was wrong."3The next time I'm in a Mart, I am stocking up.">Man, I am freezing. Where's a campfire when you need one?"JYou've already won the Eevee raffle, so you can't enter again. Sorry!"+I love to take walks around this town."CThere's something about the cold air here that helps me focus."_I've always found that contact with nature is the best way to clear your mind of troubles.Iu;␀U[["JI thought it would be cool to work at the ice rink for my summer job."1Escape the heat! Make some cash! Great idea!"AAnd it would have been, had none of the customers showed up."BI hate it here. Can't wait for school to start so I can quit."MThis job is rough. We're working nine hours a shift, five shifts a week."SGot an offer from an insurance company in Prizca. Cushy job. Way lower stress."ABut I'd feel bad taking my Seel with me to some city office.":I've always loved Bug-types. Trade me a Bug for Seel?"FI guess I can work here a little longer. Just for my little Seel."%Why'd you fake me out like that?"%Give her a good home, won't you?"-And now to put in my two weeks notice...""I love my bugs. Big or small."<Hopefully they'll love Aegis Insurance as much as I do!"No"Yes["D我之前以为在溜冰场打暑假工多是一件美事啊。"#既能避暑，又能赚钱！"D如果没有客人的话，那就是我想象中的样子了。"D我讨厌这里，赶快开学吧，这样我就能辞职了。"O这份工作太累了，我们每班工作9个小时，每周值班5天。"S收到宏礼市一家保险公司的工作。工作轻松，压力小得多。"G但我觉得把我的小海狮带到城市办公室会很糟糕。"J我一直很喜欢虫属性精灵。拿虫属性换我的小海狮？"M我想我可以在这里多工作一会儿。就为了我的小海狮。"#你为什么要那样骗我？"&请给她一个好家，好吗？"5现在我要提交我的两周辞职通知了..."2我爱我的虫子。大的小的都喜欢。"8希望它们会像我一样喜欢宙斯盾公司！"不换"换;["JI thought it would be cool to work at the ice rink for my summer job."1Escape the heat! Make some cash! Great idea!"AAnd it would have been, had none of the customers showed up."BI hate it here. Can't wait for school to start so I can quit."MThis job is rough. We're working nine hours a shift, five shifts a week."SGot an offer from an insurance company in Prizca. Cushy job. Way lower stress."ABut I'd feel bad taking my Seel with me to some city office.":I've always loved Bug-types. Trade me a Bug for Seel?"FI guess I can work here a little longer. Just for my little Seel."%Why'd you fake me out like that?"%Give her a good home, won't you?"-And now to put in my two weeks notice...""I love my bugs. Big or small."<Hopefully they'll love Aegis Insurance as much as I do!"No"YesIu;␀�[["8Snow is fun, but too much snow and you'll get cold."(My Pokemon is helping me stay warm."He's really nice!["M下雪是很有趣，但要一直下大雪的话，就会觉得冷了。")还好我的精灵能帮我取暖。"他真是太棒了！;["8Snow is fun, but too much snow and you'll get cold."(My Pokemon is helping me stay warm."He's really nice!Iu;␀�[[
"Ahh, I've done it now..."UI was so excited for this vacation, I blew my whole paycheck on camera supplies."vI spent so much I didn't have enough to buy a camera... I can't even afford a ticket for the raffle downstairs..."=Take this away from me. I can't even look at it anymore."lI was going to take so many pictures of Patrat... at least it's having fun playing with all the lenses.[
"啊，这下完了..."V我太期待这次度假了，结果把整个月薪都花在了相机装备上。"_钱花得太多，连买相机的钱都不够了...连楼下的抽奖门票都买不起..."D把这个从我这儿拿走吧。我再也受不了看它了。"S我本来想拍好多探探鼠的照片...至少它玩镜头玩得很开心。;[
"Ahh, I've done it now..."UI was so excited for this vacation, I blew my whole paycheck on camera supplies."vI spent so much I didn't have enough to buy a camera... I can't even afford a ticket for the raffle downstairs..."=Take this away from me. I can't even look at it anymore."lI was going to take so many pictures of Patrat... at least it's having fun playing with all the lenses.Iu;␀#&[[N"[In order to fight the climate, you have to keep you and your Pokemon in tip-top shape."WBoth physically and mentally. Out there, your body and your mind are under attack."CHaving one crack will lead to the other cracking just as fast."Take this."aUse it if it helps, but the most important part is that a perfect body needs a perfect mind."hIf you ever get tired of battling and want a change of pace, we're always looking for new recruits."dWe're doing operations all over the region, so you'll get to see everything Makya has to offer."II help coordinate rescue operations with some of the Makyan rangers."�We used to just work around the Ice Cave area, but now we've been funded by LuxTech to start holding operations for the entire region."It's been tough."8Strange Pokemon have been appearing out of nowhere."AA lot of Mayka's caverns have been deemed unsafe for travel."WWe manage, but if people would stop being so reckless, that would also help a ton."&The mountains here are dangerous."dWinding tunnels, dead ends, and circular paths make it a labyrinth even for experienced hikers."^Now all of a sudden with avatar Pokemon on the loose, it's made the situation even worse."rPeople are getting attacked left and right, and the number of Trainers capable of killing one are pretty low."JHopefully we can train some more capable battlers in the near future."XThe computer glows faintly. A list of documents are organized into various folders."9The documents seem to be related to various avatars."UGym Leader Lambert reported an avatar he spotted in a grotto by Bluepoint Beach."HAccording to his follow-up, a Trainer managed to defeat the avatar."KRangers who investigated the scene confirmed that the avatar was gone."This place sucks."God, this place sucks."BI swear every fifteen seconds a new avatar is reported there."VThose kids living there are so lucky that, like, two capable Trainers live there."JI don't know what's with that spot. It has to be cursed or something."_Daily patrols are required. Nothing too bad has happened yet, but it could get much worse."tI swear I've been there like four times in three days. I don't even have the patience to write a proper report."5Well, peace or something. Dunno how to end this."7Multiple avatars have been reported in the sewers."While in other situations we might send some Rangers in, it's actually much easier to simply leave them to their business."vThere are only a few exits, which are staffed by sewer treatment personnel. Each of them are registered trainers."\The walls down there are hard to dig through, and Trainers rarely travel through there."^It's more efficient to leave the avatars down there until we have more Rangers available."cWitnesses observed multiple avatars destroy the bridge that connects Prizca to southern Makya."FThis has caused a large disturbance for intra- regional shipping."oThe situation isn't dire, but shipping to Novo Town and the LuxTech Campus has been limited to air travel."OThe avatar of Terrakion remains on the Prizca side of the bridge crossing."<Gigalith's Guts has been a hot spot of avatar activity."VParticularly strong avatars have been spotted both on the mountain and within it."[Rangers approaching the situation are advised to be in parties of no smaller than two.">Inexperienced Trainers are recommended to avoid the area."sTrainers looking to acquire the Patience and Perseverance Badges are recommended to travel via Grouz or Svait."WVelenz has been rendered unsafe for long term habitation due to the avatar crisis."zOperating Rangers have been able to keep the area at acceptable levels, enough for Rafael's Gym services to continue."9Non-Trainers are advised to avoid the area entirely."nPersonal Note: The situation is such a mess. We really need more staff on hand. Or funding. Or free food."GCan we get something other than camping rations over here? Please?"9Van has been complaining non-stop since we got here."- Connor"`Rangers patrolling Grouz have observed strange sightings of a potential four-legged avatar."~While previous patrols have confirmed the existence of avatar activity in the area, this particular sighting is rather unique."�Every avatar sighted in the area has been confirmed as Steel-type, and all known four-legged Steel-type Pokemon are too slow to match observed movement."`A local living in the area has reported multiple strange sightings in the surrounding area."�The proximity of his home to Gigalith's Guts makes his case plausible, but his reports don't seem to match the avatars known to be in the area."�Notably, he has also reported sighting two different Pokemon. The sighting locations and timings from other reports corroborate his story."^The destruction left at the sites of each sighting suggest an incredibly powerful avatar."bRangers looking to confirm these reports are advised to be in parties of no smaller than two."Closed Incidents"Known Incidents"Undefined Incidents"Log Off"Bluepoint Grotto"Novo Apartments"Sewers"Go Back"Eleig Bridge"Gigalith's Guts"Velenz"Grouz Sightings"County Park Sightings[N"M为了抵御恶劣的天气，你得让精灵时刻处于最佳状态。"M在外面，无论是身体，还是心灵都会受到挑战和压力。"J一旦出现了一个问题，那么其他问题也会接踵而至。"拿上它吧。"_或许你能用得上，但最重要的是，要靠健康的思想保护我们的身体。"_如果你厌倦了战斗，想换一种生活节奏，那我们随时欢迎你的加入。"_我们在这个地区四处执行任务，所以能见识到马凯亚每一处的风光。"S我和马凯亚的护林员一起工作，负责组织和协调救援任务。"�我们以前只活跃在冰之洞窟附近，但自从得到光华的资助，我们的业务便逐步扩展到了整个地区。"太难了！"5最近突然冒出来了好多奇怪的精灵。"G现在马凯亚的很多洞穴都不再适合旅行和探险了。"w目前我们还能勉强应付，但如果人们不再那么冒失行事，我们的工作压力就会小很多。"#这边的山里非常危险。"�净是些蜿蜒曲折的隧道、和走到尽头才能发现的死胡同，就算是经验丰富的徒步旅行者，也是十分棘手的挑战。"D现在突然出现的化身精灵，更是让其难度倍增。"S人们四处遭遇袭击，而有实力除掉化身的训练师寥寥无几。"D希望在不久的将来能培养出更多更强的训练师。"V电脑散发出微弱的光芒，各种文件被组织后放在了文件夹里。"/这些文件似乎与各种化身有关。"\道馆馆主兰伯特报告称，他在蓝莹海滩的洞穴中发现了一个化身。"J根据对他的后续访谈，最后是一位训练师打倒了它。"J调查现场的护林员成员证实，那只化身已经不见了。"这地方烂透了。"这是什么破地方！">我感觉每过十五秒都会出现一只新的化身。"N住在那里的孩子们运气真好，身边有2位强大的训练师。"M真搞不懂那个地方到底咋回事，是被诅咒了还是什么？"}我们每天每时每刻都得巡逻，虽然目前还没发生什么严重的事情，但情况可能会变得更糟。"N我这三天已经去巡逻了4次，连正式报告都没心情写了。")好吧，只能祝愿和平啥的...")下水道里出现了多个化身。"}在正常情况下，我们或许会派护林员过去处理，但现在最好的办法是让它们彼此互相解决。"t毕竟下水道只有几个出口，都由污水处理人员看守，而且每个工作人员都是训练师。"M地下的墙壁很难挖掘，再者说能力足够的训练师太少。"S目前护林员仍然人手短缺，所以打算等有空了再一并处理。"V有目击者看到几个化身破坏了连接宏礼市和南马凯亚的桥梁。"8这对那片区域的通行造成了很大影响。"e虽然情况还不算很糟，但运往望新镇和光华市的货物只能靠航空运输了。"A代拉基翁的化身还留在宏礼市方向的桥头上。"5怪岩肠道一直是化身活跃的重灾区。"P无论是在山上还是洞里，都出现了一些实力强大的家伙。"M当地的护林员至少得保证两人一组，绝不能单独行动。"8经验不足的训练师最好远离那片区域。"n想要获得“耐心徽章”和“毅力徽章”的训练师们，建议改走古治镇或霜皑镇。"D由于化身的影响，夜幽市已经不在适宜居住了。"V目前护林员暂时接管此处，确保拉斐尔的道馆得以继续运作。"2建议非训练师彻底远离这个区域。"n个人备注：现在情况烂到极限了。我们需要更多的人手、钞票或者免费的补给。"h除了那种硬邦邦干粮以外，咱们能不能弄点靠谱的玩意儿来？拟人一点吧！";从来到这里之后，阿凡的抱怨就没停过。"- 康纳"K在古治镇巡逻的护林员发现了一个4条腿的奇怪化身。"e的确当地的确早就有其他化身活动的痕迹，但这次发现的化身格外不同。"z此次出现的化身不仅速度极快，与之前的其他四足化身不同，也并非当地常见的钢属性。"J当地的居民报告称，曾多次在周围看到奇怪的景象。"z目击位置与怪岩肠道很近，使得此次报告的可信度增加，但他对化身的描述却并不寻常。"T根据 现场的破坏迹象，可以推出是由一只强大的化身所为。"G但目击者却声称看到了两只种类完全不同的精灵。"D建议前去调查的护林员，务必保证成编制出动！"已解决事件"已探明事件"未确定事件"关闭"蓝莹洞窟"望新公寓"下水道"返回"埃利格大桥"怪岩肠道"夜幽市"古治镇目击事件"国立公园目击事件;[N"[In order to fight the climate, you have to keep you and your Pokemon in tip-top shape."WBoth physically and mentally. Out there, your body and your mind are under attack."CHaving one crack will lead to the other cracking just as fast."Take this."aUse it if it helps, but the most important part is that a perfect body needs a perfect mind."hIf you ever get tired of battling and want a change of pace, we're always looking for new recruits."dWe're doing operations all over the region, so you'll get to see everything Makya has to offer."II help coordinate rescue operations with some of the Makyan rangers."�We used to just work around the Ice Cave area, but now we've been funded by LuxTech to start holding operations for the entire region."It's been tough."8Strange Pokemon have been appearing out of nowhere."AA lot of Mayka's caverns have been deemed unsafe for travel."WWe manage, but if people would stop being so reckless, that would also help a ton."&The mountains here are dangerous."dWinding tunnels, dead ends, and circular paths make it a labyrinth even for experienced hikers."^Now all of a sudden with avatar Pokemon on the loose, it's made the situation even worse."rPeople are getting attacked left and right, and the number of Trainers capable of killing one are pretty low."JHopefully we can train some more capable battlers in the near future."XThe computer glows faintly. A list of documents are organized into various folders."9The documents seem to be related to various avatars."UGym Leader Lambert reported an avatar he spotted in a grotto by Bluepoint Beach."HAccording to his follow-up, a Trainer managed to defeat the avatar."KRangers who investigated the scene confirmed that the avatar was gone."This place sucks."God, this place sucks."BI swear every fifteen seconds a new avatar is reported there."VThose kids living there are so lucky that, like, two capable Trainers live there."JI don't know what's with that spot. It has to be cursed or something."_Daily patrols are required. Nothing too bad has happened yet, but it could get much worse."tI swear I've been there like four times in three days. I don't even have the patience to write a proper report."5Well, peace or something. Dunno how to end this."7Multiple avatars have been reported in the sewers."While in other situations we might send some Rangers in, it's actually much easier to simply leave them to their business."vThere are only a few exits, which are staffed by sewer treatment personnel. Each of them are registered trainers."\The walls down there are hard to dig through, and Trainers rarely travel through there."^It's more efficient to leave the avatars down there until we have more Rangers available."cWitnesses observed multiple avatars destroy the bridge that connects Prizca to southern Makya."FThis has caused a large disturbance for intra- regional shipping."oThe situation isn't dire, but shipping to Novo Town and the LuxTech Campus has been limited to air travel."OThe avatar of Terrakion remains on the Prizca side of the bridge crossing."<Gigalith's Guts has been a hot spot of avatar activity."VParticularly strong avatars have been spotted both on the mountain and within it."[Rangers approaching the situation are advised to be in parties of no smaller than two.">Inexperienced Trainers are recommended to avoid the area."sTrainers looking to acquire the Patience and Perseverance Badges are recommended to travel via Grouz or Svait."WVelenz has been rendered unsafe for long term habitation due to the avatar crisis."zOperating Rangers have been able to keep the area at acceptable levels, enough for Rafael's Gym services to continue."9Non-Trainers are advised to avoid the area entirely."nPersonal Note: The situation is such a mess. We really need more staff on hand. Or funding. Or free food."GCan we get something other than camping rations over here? Please?"9Van has been complaining non-stop since we got here."- Connor"`Rangers patrolling Grouz have observed strange sightings of a potential four-legged avatar."~While previous patrols have confirmed the existence of avatar activity in the area, this particular sighting is rather unique."�Every avatar sighted in the area has been confirmed as Steel-type, and all known four-legged Steel-type Pokemon are too slow to match observed movement."`A local living in the area has reported multiple strange sightings in the surrounding area."�The proximity of his home to Gigalith's Guts makes his case plausible, but his reports don't seem to match the avatars known to be in the area."�Notably, he has also reported sighting two different Pokemon. The sighting locations and timings from other reports corroborate his story."^The destruction left at the sites of each sighting suggest an incredibly powerful avatar."bRangers looking to confirm the