r challenger? How inhospitable does this place have to get before you lunatics give up?"ODo I look like I have the time to duel you? That isn’t my job, you know."cMy job is to guard this door until I can find someone strong enough to defeat what’s inside."jAnd for some insane reason they thought sending a parade of children at me was a good way to do that."But fine. We’ll fight."9I run doubles, and doubles only. You ready for that?"4Great. Maybe I can get some soil samples today."*I used to be a scientist, you know..."9You’ve got the aura of someone with real audacity."}The only reason I’m here is to find a true Pokémon master, and you’ve at least got the ferocity fighting your way to me."5Fine. You’re here for more than an easy badge."Show me what you got."mSure thing. The sooner I lose to you, the sooner you get out of here and back somewhere safe, I suppose."Do it."HFinally. How many years and I finally – it’s done! It’s done!"AYou. Take the Reverence Badge. You’ve more than earned it.",Now, this door. My true responsibility."&This damn burden... let’s talk."%Yep. You’re still pretty good."&I can’t give you another badge."Please leave me alone."I hope you’re happy."_Suicidal dive into dangerous territory, hunt me down, force me to waste time fighting you.""And for what, a big old game?"Take your badge."vAnd, yeah, I’m not angry with you, got it? I’m angry with Helena and Andris and everyone for setting this up." Now get outta here, ‘kay?")Please, let's not do this right now."wWhen the tournament is on, it's the only time of the year I can take a break from handling crazy trainers all day."2I'm gonna make the most of it, by relaxing..."Give me a sec."Of course.[-"2安德里斯给了馆主们各一把钥匙。"/都是这些门...这些监牢的钥匙。"w在接受挑战、颁发徽章等表象背后，但这才是我们真正的使命。也是事情本来的样貌。"/看起来只有我是最认真的那个。"P所以请拿着这把钥匙，通过那扇门，把那个东西消灭掉。"D你要去找化身吗？只有它消失了，我才能离开..."务必小心。"\真的假的？你回来了？我的意思是，随便了，但还是就此打住吧。"b又来个挑战者？这个地方究竟要变成什么样，你们这些疯子才会放弃？"V我看起来像有时间和你战斗吗？你也知道，这不是我的职责。"b我的职责就是守护这扇门，直至寻到足够强大的人来打倒里面的东西。"\但是我不知道他们是怎么想的，竟然觉得派来一群孩子就能搞定。")行行行，那我们就打一场。"D我这边是双打比赛，而且只有双打，准备好了？">行吧。也许我今天可以采集一些土壤样本。"2你知道吗，我以前是一名科学家..."/你身上有一种敢作敢为的气质。"�我来这里的唯一原因是找到一位真正的精灵大师，而你在与我对战的过程中所展现出的激烈攻势，也算符合了我的要求。"J很好，我明白了。你来这里可不仅仅是为了枚徽章。"&让我看看你有什么本事。"A当然，你输的越快，就可以越早地离开这里。"来吧。"A终于，多少年了！我终于...等到了！等到了！">你，收下这枚崇敬徽章吧。这是你应得的。">现在，这道门背后，是我真正应负的责任。"8也是该死的负担...让我们好好谈谈吧。"#没错，你还是很厉害。")但我没法再给你一枚徽章。"请别烦我了。"&我希望你会为此而高兴。"S冒着生命危险到这种地方来找我，逼我浪费时间和你战斗。"A这一切都是为了什么，一场老掉牙的游戏吗？"拿走你的徽章吧。"b我没有生你的气。我是在生海伦娜、安德里斯，以及所有决策层的气。"现在可以走了吗？"拜托，别再来了。"S锦标赛举办期间，那是我一年中唯一能够好好休息的日子。")我要好好利用，放松一下..."稍等"来吧;[-"CAndris gave each of us -- us gym leaders -- one of these keys.".They’re for these doors, these prisons."{Behind all that bluster about Champions and badges and all that, this is our real purpose. At least, it’s supposed to be."9Seems like I’m the only one taking this seriously."PSo, please, take this key, go through that door, and get rid of that thing."WYou gonna go after the avatar? Until it’s gone, I can’t leave... just in case."Just. In. Case.":You’re back? Really? I mean, fine, but please stop."bAnother challenger? How inhospitable does this place have to get before you lunatics give up?"ODo I look like I have the time to duel you? That isn’t my job, you know."cMy job is to guard this door until I can find someone strong enough to defeat what’s inside."jAnd for some insane reason they thought sending a parade of children at me was a good way to do that."But fine. We’ll fight."9I run doubles, and doubles only. You ready for that?"4Great. Maybe I can get some soil samples today."*I used to be a scientist, you know..."9You’ve got the aura of someone with real audacity."}The only reason I’m here is to find a true Pokémon master, and you’ve at least got the ferocity fighting your way to me."5Fine. You’re here for more than an easy badge."Show me what you got."mSure thing. The sooner I lose to you, the sooner you get out of here and back somewhere safe, I suppose."Do it."HFinally. How many years and I finally – it’s done! It’s done!"AYou. Tak