WHOA!"&WHAT KIND'A UGLY POKEMON ARE YA?!"FRafael told me to battle any avatar that might come through here."_I forgot my glasses at home today so I can't see anything more than a foot in front of me."BSorry for confusing you with a Pokemon, you can pass through."ARafael is up ahead. Though, the door to the front is locked."vIf you want in, you'll need the combo code. I wrote the digits on some slips of paper, but lost 'em a while back."PSorry, but if you want in to fight Rafael, you'll have to find those slips."RThe lock is really old, so you only need half of the eight digits, I'd wager."bRafael's Pokemon League Representative quit years ago, so I'll have to brief you on his team."7Rafael uses a mix of Grass and Ghost-type Pokemon."DThis means that Fire, Flying, Ice, and Dark types do well here."{He's not just his types, however. He wouldn't have been able to guard this place for so long without a trick up his sleeve."1His team is built around the Dancer ability."EWhen you see him send out his Bellossom or his Alolan Marowak...")Well, all I'm saying is be prepared."Best of luck, friend."'You managed to win against Rafael?"(Great work, you got some real grit."mIf the avatar problem here ever gets sorted out, I'll try to go watch your next high profile match live."Well I'll be damned."EAfter all this time, I finally got to see Rafael leave his post."9He had the biggest damn smile I've ever seen on him."You did good."?You've probably saved me and Rafael a lot of cash as well."aWe're down here most of the time, so we've lost a lot of money getting food delivered to us."\Helena would probably kill us if she found out how much we've spent on delivery fees...[-"#这里有个挺新的路牌。"J上面写着“拉斐尔走了，新馆主为康纳？？？？？”"#后面跟着一长串问号。"8一把老式的密码锁将门紧紧地锁住了。";你看着找到的纸条，输入着上面的密码。"/轻轻地晃动一下，锁就打开了！"o需要输入8位数字，但是只要耍点小聪明，只要有<imp>4</imp>位数字就可以穷举了。"哦，你好。">所以...我就是道馆馆主...现在...大概...吧..."P没想到再见到拉斐尔后，他只是轻轻地拍了拍我的肩膀...">说所有的文件都办好了...然后...呃...我就..."/总之，我现在是道馆馆主康纳。"8现在得试着组建一支适合双打的队伍..."哇！" 你 是 什 么 东 西 ？"A拉斐尔告诉我要跟所有通过这里的化身战斗。">今天又忘了带眼镜，所以看什么都很模糊。";抱歉把你和精灵搞混了，你可以过去了。";拉斐尔就在前面，不过，前门被锁住了。"n如果你想进去，就需要输入密码。我把密码写在一些纸条上，但前阵子弄丢了。"M抱歉，如果你想和拉斐尔较量，就得先找到那些纸条。"M当然如果你愿意动动脑，或许并不需要找到所有密码。"b拉斐尔已经不做联盟代表好多年了，所以我得向你介绍一下他的队伍。"5他喜欢用的是草和幽灵属性的精灵。"Q这就说明火、飞行、冰和恶4种属性可以在这里大展身手。"w不过他对属性并没有那么依赖，能在这里担任这么久的馆主，多少都是有一些绝招的。"/据说他的队伍核心是舞者特性。"D等你看到他派出美丽花或者阿罗拉嘎啦嘎啦时...",嗯，我只能说，好好准备吧。"祝你好运，朋友。"你战胜了拉斐尔？"&干得漂亮，你真有实力。"S等这里的化身问题都搞定了，我就去现场观看你下场比赛。"我这是见鬼了么。"G这么长时间了，第一次看到拉斐尔离开他的岗位。"D他脸上露出了迄今为止我见过的最灿烂的笑容。"你做得很好。"/这或许能帮我们节省一些资金。"V由于我们大部分时间都在这里，所以花了很多钱来运送食物。"_如果让海莲娜发现我们在送餐费上花了多少钱，她可能会杀了我们...;[-")There’s a newly-painted sign here.":It reads “Rafael gone. Connor is gym leader now?”")There are many, many question marks."7An old combination lock keeps the door shut tight."QReading off the slips of paper you found, you enter the code onto the locks."-After a bit of jostling, the lock opens!"iIt takes eight digits, but with enough finagling you'd be able to open it with just <imp>four</imp>."Oh, heya.")So... I'm a gym leader now. I guess."wDidn't even really expect to see Rafeal again. He just kinda climbed down, patted me on the shoulder, and told me."ASaid all the paperwork or whatever was done. So, uh... yeah."&Gym Leader Connor is coming soon!"7Just need to get a proper doubles team together..."
