Nope."Thanks."Help me."I like you too."Take Heatran."Refuse Heatran forever."Pick up."Don't pick up."I'm not coming home."That sounds nice."What are you doing here?"Not now."OK."It's reliable."It's lackluster."It's my favorite."I'm just training it."I don't know."Illusions."Myths made real."I don't care."Tell her."Don't tell her.Iu;␀�P[[�"wMy mom told me not to come up here, but I really wanted to see what it was like to pee off the side of a mountain.";I uh... don't need to pee anymore. For no real reason."{I felt like peeing off Makya's highest point would be great, but I'm not feeling as liberated as I thought I would be."WI'm scared of heights, but I'm more scared of growing old without making memories."4That's why I choose where I pee very carefully."^\PN! My beloved! The mountains frame your beauty in a way I can only describe as sublime."TYou look as if you could tear them down around you and build yourself a throne."-You don’t need to. All you need is me."oOf course. I always have time to talk with you. Listening to your dulcet voice makes my worries dissipate."1We can talk about anything. Anything at all."GWhy would you come here if not for me? You could’ve stayed away."sWhat draws you to me? You know what it is, I think. We both know. I’d love to show you what you really feel."oYou’re perfect. I see all my love reflected in your eyes. It’s beautiful. I want to hold you so badly."1Oh, you’re adorable. Such a pure creature."zYes, my love. Always gifts. I’ll get you anything you desire, always. You’re worth more than any material object."!...But that must come later."P\PN. I had planned to propose to you here. But then I was gifted a miracle."pMy undying, fervent wish was made real before my eyes. Our love was consecrated in the eyes of the heavens."{I knew this gift to us was to be used only one way. You are like Yezera: there’s one language you speak above all others."xI’ve been so selfish, using my words to express how wonderful you are. I should’ve been speaking your language."�Let me show you my love. Let me show you the sign I have received. Let our love be made immortal by this glorious omen, shining in the passions of combat."-Of course, my love. Make yourself ready."4I love you. Allow me to show you just how much."8...I won’t let you slip away. You’re mine, \PN."|You don’t understand what I mean yet. Let me show it to you. Let me open your eyes to the love you’ve been missing."BThis is meant to be. Witness the message the heavens gave me."�You’re making me wait. My heart is pounding. I can’t wait any longer. Will you now bear witness to this sign of our eternal love?"�Do you see it? The wish-bringer, come to grant me my wish! The light of our love shining through it! And you, like a star, like an avatar!"mI wanted Yezera, and I sought the avatars, all to lead me here. To woo a god, and make you mine forever."1Can’t you see? I will do anything for you."�I will move heaven and earth. I will love you eternally. I will smother you in compassion and affection. I will fill your life with comfort and pleasure."~I will steal for you. Kill for you. End this world for you, or remake it to be more pleasant for you. So long as you are mine."]So long as I can hold you, and love you, and know that you are mine and no one else’s."1I need help? That’s all you can say to me?"zI love you more than anyone has loved anything! Do you expect me to keep it inside, wear masks, be... civil about it?"It drives me to madness and back not embracing you here and now! As it should! Everyone else is blind not seeing your radiance!"pYou are gorgeous and brilliant and divine. What higher accomplishment could there be than to make you mine?">No one could aspire to anything better, except to be you."2I would for you. Don’t you understand that?"=Why would you reject me? I could make your life perfect!"�I would do anything for you, and you want to throw that away? Simply because I ask for your love in return? Am I not worthy of that, after everything?"RI am kind, and loving, and caring, and humble, and I can see your real worth!"VShouldn’t I be more worthy of love than anyone else? Do you think I’m insane?"You’re the mad one here if you think you’ll be better off without me. A beautiful mad god that refuses to be helped..."QNo! I will have you alone. I couldn’t stand to share you with anyone else!"cPlease, you won’t even notice. I will fill your days with joy. You won’t need anyone else."�If they ask for you, if they want you, I’ll take care of them. They can serve you – us – or they can leave. Our perfect days need no one else."~After all, I’m the only one that feels this raging love. I’m the only one that knows what you really are. Radiant. Divine."8Yes. Of course. Hah! Everything is as it should be."LThe entire world is falling into place, my love. You are mine. Forever."�Love, I’ve been working with Yezera to reset the world. I planned to rule with her, and then later I planned to make it a paradise for us two."�But now? You’re fighting Yezera, and I’ll gladly choose you over her. She’s nothing to me now. You’re the only one that matters."zHow about this? You go take care of her and make sure she never bothers us. Meanwhile, I’ll be making preparations."�I’ll make your life a dream. A beautiful, idyllic, paradisiacal dream from which you’ll never wake up. Go do what you do best."Oh, the plans I have. My love, just you wait. Please. Don’t hurry yourself. Although... you must have work to attend to."VOh, please, continue then. I wouldn’t dare take you away from what you do best."{I need time to prepare, and you need to wrap up these loose ends. Cut these threads away. You don’t need anyone else now."Y\PN, I’m going to make your life a dream. You’re a god... and now you’re mine."VWe’ll be together forever. Forever’s just beginning, and I’m a patient man."fSo go ahead. Get rid of Yezera. Get rid of everyone! And then come back to me, so I can hold you."QHere. Take Jirachi with you. A sign of my undying love, and our divine bond."OI love you, \PN. My gift to you is a god, because what else could suffice?"CTake it, and know you’re loved. Loved more than anyone else."7No? Oh, \PN, you don’t have to leave it with me."�If it isn’t good enough for you, I’ll make it up to you. Anything you desire, you’ll have. Just let me work out the details, alright?"SYou’re gorgeous. You’re perfect beyond words. And you’re mine. All mine."mSo go on. We can be apart for a little while more. I’ll be thinking of you every second you’re away."`I’ve got preparations to make. Time to set aside, items to procure, people to... obviate."[We’ll meet again. And then we’ll never meet again, because we’ll never be apart.">Goodbye, \PN. I love you more than anything in the world."The stone hums with power."TEtched into its side are two images, a pair of glowing spheres in red and blue.".You present the Red Orb and the Blue Orb."'The stone activates at your touch."9Are you also here to dance at the top of a mountain?"1I regret coming up here dressed like this..."0I wish Lainie were here to dance with me..."HYou won't dance with me? Well, I'm sure you're very fun at parties."=Go on, back to your climbing or whatever you like to do."Do you even have hobbies?"You’re leaving me? Why?"EI was going to create a perfect world for you. Do you know that?"�Yezera wants a new world. I don’t care why. It gave me the perfect canvas. An ancient, divine land. A golden age! And this time it’d never end!" I would have her... or you."�I served her whims here, helping her, fighting you, stealing the titans. And I would serve her in the reborn world, love her forever."�But now that you have shone upon me, I couldn’t ever go back to her. She pales in comparison. So now no one will receive this endless love."]I will never build a new world for my beloved. And I will never have a god to call mine."2...Fine. You’ll regret this. They all will."JThey’ll all die cold and alone, withering unloved and unremembered."dYou could’ve been happy. And now the fire smolders to embers and ash. I hope you choke on it."You – no!"QWhy would you give me hope just to rip it away? Why would you do this to me?"EI have worshiped you! I have loved you! I have always loved you!"iGods come to earth, turning their backs on me! Do I deserve this? Have I failed you in a single way?"0No! I am pure, and holy! My love is divine!"~Fine then! If you want to cast me into darkness, do so. If my love burns too brightly even for the heavens, cast me down."fYou can’t stop me. You can’t snuff me out. You’ll be mine eventually. One of the gods will."pAll I need is one to love forever. One to be mine, and mine alone. I won’t stop until I have one to keep."OI love you. I love you more than anything. And I’ll never see you again."�Maybe we’ll meet in another eternity, when I have a god of my own to love and care for. And then we’ll see if you regret this."OJirachi seems perturbed. It seems to have gravely misjudged the situation."WIt also seems apologetic. Perhaps it wants to make it up to you, or keep you safe."BMaybe it’s even attracted by your adamant hopes and wishes."7In any case, it seems willing to be caught by you."QHow Skyler was blessed by a mythical granter of wishes, you’ll never know."�Jirachi seems highly embarrassed and gladly lets itself be caught. Honestly, it seems like it just wants to forget this ever happened."nJirachi seems disappointed. You suspect it wanted to be caught and battle some more as a palate cleanser."ZAs an immortal being, though, it’s got plenty of time to forget this ever happened."\It leaves with the mountain wind. Perhaps you’ll see it again on these snowy peaks..."JThe true power of the Dragon-type is only unlocked during an Eclipse!"?The only problem here is my own. I have failed my Pokemon."FI shall return to my thoughts, and I will come back more focused."BDragon-type Pokemon often roost on the peak of this mountain."JHearing the songs of Hymnus is a true once-in-a- lifetime experience."Down: Gigalith's Guts"I want to talk."Not why I'm here."All I need is you."More gifts?"Let me prepare."Very well."...No?"You need help."Go to hell."Last bit's a dealbreaker."Yes. Let me be yours."Take Jirachi."Refuse Jirachi forever."Catch Jirachi."Release Jirachi forever.[�"k我妈妈不让我来这里，但我真想体验一下站在悬崖边，往下撒尿是什么感觉。";我...再也不尿尿了...我是说在这种地方。"t我觉得从马凯亚的最高峰往下尿尿的体验一定很棒，但并没有那种想象中的解放感。"J我有点恐高，但我更怕老去后没有值得回忆的东西。"8因此，我会非常谨慎地选择撒尿地点。"b\PN！我的爱人！这山脉将你的美丽框在了一种我无法形容的崇高之中。"A仿佛它要将自身拆解掉，形成属于你的王座。"5当然你不需要这样它，你只需要我。"k当然可以，我有很多可以和你闲聊的时间，你悦耳的声音能让我的烦恼消散。">你想谈论些什么都可以，任何事情都可以。"P如果不是为了我，你为什么会来这里？你本可以远离我。"{是什么吸引你来找我的？我想你知道这个原因，我们都很清楚，向你自身展示真正的感受吧。"}你是那么的完美，我看到你的爱意从眼神中毫无保留的映射出来，太美了，我多想抱着你！"D啊！你真是太可爱了！竟然有如此纯洁的生命。"�放心吧，我的爱人，我永远都有东西给你，无论你想要什么，我都会给你，这就是我对你爱的重量。"&...不过那必须稍后再说。"Y\PN，我本想在这里向你求婚，但一个奇迹打破了我原本的计划。"t我那不朽与热烈的愿望，就这样在眼前变成了现实，是我们的爱得到了天堂的祝福。"z不过这份礼物的包装，只有一种拆解方式，那就是你和叶泽拉一样，最擅长的那种语言。"}我一直都那么自私，自顾自地用干瘪的语言表达你的美好，我应该换一种你能听懂的方式。"�让我展示我的爱吧，让我展示我所接收到的征兆，让我们的爱因这个光荣的征兆而不朽，在战斗的激情中闪耀。"A当然，我的爱人，我也不希望你是仓促应战。";我爱你。让我向你展示这份爱的浓郁吧。"8...我不会让你溜走的，你是我的，\PN。"}你还不明白我的意思吗？让我毫不保留地展示给你看吧，让我揭开你一直缺失的爱的眼帘。"D这是命中注定的，是所见证的上天给我的信息。"}在等待的过程中，我的心一直怦怦跳动，我再也等不了了，来见证我们永恒爱情的征召吧！"�你看到了吗？愿望的化身来实现我的期盼了！我们的爱之光因为它闪耀！而你，像一颗星星，一个化身般闪耀！"�无论是叶泽拉，还是化身，我追求他们，都是为了今天，让命运把我带到这里的一刻。追寻神的步伐，让你永远属于我。"A你应该能看得出来吧？我会为你做任何事情。"�我会永远爱你，我会为你移山填海，披荆斩棘，我会用关怀和爱意淹没你，让你的生活只剩舒适和愉悦。"�我会为了你成为窃贼，为你杀戮，为你毁灭世界，又或者重塑世界，使其更美好，只要你能属于我..."Y只要我能拥抱你，爱你，并确保你是我的，不是其他什么人的...";我需要治疗？这就是你要对我说的全部？"}我爱你胜过任何人，胜过任何事物！你希望我把它藏在心里，戴上面具，表现得...文明些？"w无法现在拥抱你会让我疯掉！这才是最该有的结果！其他人都瞎了，看不到你的光辉！"b你那么美丽、聪明、神圣，让你成为我的，就是此世间最珍贵的成就！"A除了成为你之外，没有人能找到更好的追求。"A为了你，我愿意下地狱，你难道还不明白吗？"G你为什么要拒绝我？我可以让你的生活变得完美！"�我愿意为你做任何事情，而你却想要抛弃我？仅仅因为我要求你回报我的爱？在经历了这一切之后，我难道不值得被爱吗？"_我善良、谦虚、有爱心，也懂得关怀别人，还能看到你真正的价值！"M难道我不比任何人都更值得被爱吗？你认为我疯了吗？"}你认为没有我会更好？哈哈，原来是你疯了，一个美丽的疯狂之神，拒绝接受信徒的帮助..."M不！你只能有我一个人，我无法忍受与其他人分享你！"n求求你，你可能没注意到，我会让你的生活充满快乐，你不再需要其他任何人。"�如果他们需要你，如果他们想要你，我会代你照顾他们。他们可以为你，为我们...服务，或者离开，我们完美的生活不再需要任何人。"t毕竟，只有我能感受到这股炽烈的爱，只有我知晓你真正的本质，那份光辉与神圣！"D没错，就是这样，哈哈！一切就应该这样发展！"P整个世界都在我手手中了，我的爱人，你是我的，永远！"�亲爱的，我之前一直在和叶泽拉一起重置世界，我原本计划和她一起统治，再为我们2个打造一个天堂的。"�但现在，你是她的对立面，我也很乐意选择你而不是她，她对我来说已经毫无意义了，你是唯一重要的人。"n怎么样？你去解决掉她，确保她不会再来打扰我们吧，同时，我也会做好准备。"�我会让你拥有梦境般的生活，一个美丽、闲适的梦境，你永远都不需要醒来的梦境。而现在，继续去做你擅长的事吧。"w我有数不清的计划，我的爱人，在等等吧，请不要着急，而且...你还有些事情要处理。"2请继续吧，我不会让你停下那些。"�我需要时间来准备未来，而你需要结束这一些的源头，当变故被全部切断之后，你就不再需要任何人了。"k\PN，我会让你的生活变成一场美好的梦境，现在...你就是独属于我的神明了。"\我们将永远在一起，不...永远也只是开始，我是一个有耐心的人。"k所以继续吧，摆脱叶泽拉，摆脱其他所有人！然后回到我身边，让我拥抱你。"\不如，带上基拉祈，这是我永恒的爱和我们之间神圣连结的象征。"_我爱你，\PN，送给你一份传说中的礼物，没有什么是比这更好的了。"n拿上它吧，你将时刻感知到，你被爱着，比以往任何时刻都更多，更充盈的爱。"A你不打算带走它？\PN，你没必要把它留给我。"�如果你觉得这份礼物还不够，我将来会再补偿你的，无论你想要什么我都会给你，让我来处理这些，好吗？"J你的美，无与伦比，而且你是我的，全部都是我的。"e现在继续你的旅程吧，我们可以再分开一段时间，我每一秒都会想念你。"Y接下来我要做好一切的准备，安排时间、采购物品、处理麻烦..."\等我们再次相遇，就永远不会再分开，因为...这就是我永恒的爱！"2再见，\PN，我爱你胜过世间一切。"/这块石头散发出了强大的能量。"Q它的侧面刻有2个图像，一个红色和一个蓝色的发光球体。"5你拿出了朱红色宝珠和靛蓝色宝珠。")石头在你触摸时被激活了。")你也是来在山顶跳舞的吗？")我后悔穿成这样来这里了...",真希望兰妮能和我一起跳舞..."J你不想和我跳舞吗？好吧，或许你对派对更感兴趣。")继续去做你喜欢的事情吧。"你有什么爱好吗？"#你要离开我？为什么？"J你知道吗？我本来要创造一个属于我们的完美世界！"�叶泽拉想要一个新的世界，我不在乎她的目的，但这给了我一块完美的画布，给了我古老而神圣的土地！我可以让黄金时代永不终结！"#我会拥有她...或者你。"�我本在那里为她服务，帮助她与你战斗，偷走巨人...在重生的世界里，我也会继续为她服务，永远爱她。"�但现在你照亮了我，我再也无法回到她身边，她现在已经显得没那么美好了...所以现在没有人能得到我这份无尽的爱。"n我永远都无法为我所爱的人创造全新的世界了，我永远都无法拥有自身的神了。">呵...你会后悔的...你们所有人都会后悔的！"D你们都会孤独地死去，没有人爱，没有人记得。"e你本可以很幸福，现在火焰只剩灰烬和余温，我只希望它能把你们呛住！"你...不！"Y为什么你要给我希望，然后又将它撕碎？为什么你要这样对我？"G我那么崇敬你，那么爱你！一直、一直都是这样！"_神明降临人间，却背弃了我！难道我不配吗？我到底是哪里做错了？"A不！我是纯洁而神圣的！我的爱是最神圣的！"~既然...连你都想将我扔进黑暗，那就这样吧...如果连天堂都无法容纳我的爱，那就将我驱逐吧..."�但你无法阻止我，无法扼杀我的！你，或者是其他神明中的一个，总有一个，总有一天会是我的！"z我只需要一个永远爱我的人，一个属于我...只属于我的人！我会不停地追求，直到拥有..."G我爱你，我比谁都更爱你，但我再也见不到你了。"�也许我们会在另一个永恒中相遇，当我拥有自身的神明去爱和照顾时，到时再看看你是否会后悔吧。"G基拉祈似乎感到不安，它似乎严重地误判了情况。"k它也似乎感到很抱歉，也许它也想弥补你受到的伤害，或者保护你免受伤害。"G也许它被你坚定的希望和绝不妥协的愿望所吸引。")总之，它看起来想跟你走。"b你无论如何都想不明白，为什么斯凯勒会被传说中的愿望的象征祝福。"q基拉祈似乎非常尴尬，但也很高兴自身能弥补，其实，它更想就此忘记这件事情。"k基拉祈似乎很失望，你怀疑它到底为什么会祝福斯凯勒，总有种莫名的不安。"V不过，作为一个不朽的存在，它有足够的时间忘记这件事情。"M它随着山风离开了，也许你会在这雪山上再次见到它..."D只有日食的时候，才能解放龙属性真正的力量！";唯一的问题在于我，我辜负了我的精灵。")我将更加专注地捋清思绪。"8龙属性精灵经常栖息在这座山的山顶。">听到赞美诗的歌声是真正一生难得的经历。"下: 怪岩肠道"要谈谈？"还有别的事？"我只需要你。"有礼物？"准备一下。"好的。"...不需要吧..."你需要治疗。"下地狱吧。" 最后一条不能接受。"让我成为你的吧。"带走基拉祈。"永远拒绝基拉祈。"带走基拉祈。"永远拒绝基拉祈。;[�"wMy mom told me not to come up here, but I really wanted to see what it was like to pee off the side of a mountain.";I uh... don't need to pee anymore. For no real reason."{I felt like peeing off Makya's highest point would be great, but I'm not feeling as liberated as I thought I would be."WI'm scared of heights, but I'm more scared of growing old without making memories."4That's why I choose where I pee very carefully."^\PN! My beloved! The mountains frame your beauty in a way I can only describe as sublime."TYou look as if you could tear them down around you and build yourself a throne."-You don’t need to. All you need is me."oOf course. I always have time to talk with you. Listening to your dulcet voice makes my worries dissipate."1We can talk about anything. Anything at all."GWhy would you come here if not for me? You could’ve stayed away."sWhat draws you to me? You know what it is, I think. We both know. I’d love to show you what you really feel."oYou’re perfect. I see all my love reflected in your eyes. It’s beautiful. I want to hold you so badly."1Oh, you’re adorable. Such a pure creature."zYes, my love. Always gifts. I’ll get you anything you desire, always. You’re worth more than any material object."!...But that must come later."P\PN. I had planned to propose to you here. But then I was gifted a miracle."pMy undying, fervent wish was made real before my eyes. Our love was consecrated in the eyes of the heavens."{I knew this gift to us was to be used only one way. You are like Yezera: there’s one language you speak above all others."xI’ve been so selfish, using my words to express how wonderful you are. I should’ve been speaking your language."�Let me show you my love. Let me show you the sign I have received. Let our love be made immortal by this glorious omen, shining in the passions of combat."-Of course, my love. Make yourself ready."4I love you. Allow me to show you just how much."8...I won’t let you slip away. You’re mine, \PN."|You don’t understand what I mean yet. Let me show it to you. Let me open your eyes to the love you’ve been missing."BThis is meant to be. Witness the message the heavens gave me."�You’re making me wait. My heart is pounding. I can’t wait any longer. Will you now bear witness to this sign of our eternal love?"�Do you see it? The wish-bringer, come to grant me my wish! The light of our love shining through it! And you, like a star, like an avatar!"mI wanted Yezera, and I sought the avatars, all to lead me here. To woo a god, and make you mine forever."1Can’t you see? I will do anything for you."�I will move heaven and earth. I will love you eternally. I will smother you in compassion and affection. I will fill your life with comfort and pleasure."~I will steal for you. Kill for you. End this world for you, or remake it to be more pleasant for you. So long as you are mine."]So long as I can hold you, and love you, and know that you are mine and no one else’s."1I need help? That’s all you can say to me?"zI love you more than anyone has loved anything! Do you expect me to keep it inside, wear masks, be... civil about it?"It drives me to madness and back not embracing you here and now! As it should! Everyone else is blind not seeing your radiance!"pYou are gorgeous and brilliant and divine. What higher accomplishment could there be than to make you mine?">No one could aspire to anything better, except to be you."2I would for you. Don’t you understand that?"=Why would you reject me? I could make your life perfect!"�I would do anything for you, and you want to throw that away? Simply because I ask for your love in return? Am I not worthy of that, after everything?"RI am kind, and loving, and caring, and humble, and I can see your real worth!"VShouldn’t I be more worthy of love than anyone else? Do you think I’m insane?"You’re the mad one here if you think you’ll be better off without me. A beautiful mad god that refuses to be helped..."QNo! I will have you alone. I couldn’t stand to share you with anyone else!"cPlease, you won’t even notice. I will fill your days with joy. You won’t need anyone else."�If they ask for you, if they want you, I’ll take care of them. They can serve you – us – or they can leave. Our perfect days need no one else."~After all, I’m the only one that feels this raging love. I’m the only one that knows what you really are. Radiant. Divine."8Yes. Of course. Hah! Everything is as it should be."LThe entire world is falling into place, my love. You are mine. Forever."�Love, I’ve been working with Yezera to reset the world. I planned to rule with her, and then later I planned to make it a paradise for us two."�But now? You’re fighting Yezera, and I’ll gladly choose you over her. She’s nothing to me now. You’re the only one that matters."zHow about this? You go take care of her and make sure she never bothers us. Meanwhile, I’ll be making preparations."�I’ll make your life a dream. A beautiful, idyllic, paradisiacal dream from which you’ll never wake up. Go do what you do best."Oh, the plans I have. My love, just you wait. Please. Don’t hurry yourself. Although... you must have work to attend to."VOh, please, continue then. I wouldn’t dare take you away from what you do best."{I need time to prepare, and you need to wrap up these loose ends. Cut these threads away. You don’t need anyone else now."Y\PN, I’m going to make your life a dream. You’re a god... and now you’re mine."VWe’ll be together forever. Forever’s just beginning, and I’m a patient man."fSo go ahead. Get rid of Yezera. Get rid of everyone! And then come back to me, so I can hold you."QHere. Take Jirachi with you. A sign of my undying love, and our divine bond."OI love you, \PN. My gift to you is a god, because what else could suffice?"CTake it, and know you’re loved. Loved more than anyone else."7No? Oh, \PN, you don’t have to leave it with me."�If it isn’t good enough for you, I’ll make it up to you. Anything you desire, you’ll have. Just let me work out the details, alright?"SYou’re gorgeous. You’re perfect beyond words. And you’re mine. All mine."mSo go on. We can be apart for a little while more. I’ll be thinking of you every second you’re away."`I’ve got preparations to make. Time to set aside, items to procure, people to... obviate."[We’ll meet again. And then we’ll never meet again, because we’ll never be apart.">Goodbye, \PN. I love you more than anything in the world."The stone hums with power."TEtched into its side are two images, a pair of glowing spheres in red and blue.".You present the Red Orb and the Blue Orb."'The stone activates at your touch."9Are you also here to dance at the top of a mountain?"1I regret coming up here dressed like this..."0I wish Lainie were here to dance with me..."HYou won't dance with me? Well, I'm sure you're very fun at parties."=Go on, back to your climbing or whatever you like to do."Do you even have hobbies?"You’re leaving me? Why?"EI was going to create a perfect world for you. Do you know that?"�Yezera wants a new world. I don’t care why. It gave me the perfect canvas. An ancient, divine land. A golden age! And this time it’d never end!" I would have her... or you."�I served her whims here, helping her, fighting you, stealing the titans. And I would serve her in the reborn world, love her forever."�But now that you have shone upon me, I couldn’t ever go back to her. She pales in comparison. So now no one will receive this endless love."]I will never build a new world for my beloved. And I will never have a god to call mine."2...Fine. You’ll regret this. They all will."JThey’ll all die cold and alone, withering unloved and unremembered."dYou could’ve been happy. And now the fire smolders to embers and ash. I hope you choke on it."You – no!"QWhy would you give me hope just to rip it away? Why would you do this to me?"EI have worshiped you! I have loved you! I have always loved you!"iGods come to earth, turning their backs on me! Do I deserve this? Have I failed you in a single way?"0No! I am pure, and holy! My love is divine!"~Fine then! If you want to cast me into darkness, do so. If my love burns too brightly even for the heavens, cast me down."fYou can’t stop me. You can’t snuff me out. You’ll be mine eventually. One of the gods will."pAll I need is one to love forever. One to be mine, and mine alone. I won’t stop until I have one to keep."OI love you. I love you more than anything. And I’ll never see you again."�Maybe we’ll meet in another eternity, when I have a god of my own to love and care for. And then we’ll see if you regret this."OJirachi seems perturbed. It seems to have gravely misjudged the situation."WIt also seems apologetic. Perhaps it wants to make it up to you, or keep you safe."BMaybe it’s even attracted by your adamant hopes and wishes."7In any case, it seems willing to be caught by you."QHow Skyler was blessed by a mythical granter of wishes, you’ll never know."�Jirachi seems highly embarrassed and gladly lets itself be caught. Honestly, it seems like it just wants to forget this ever happened."nJirachi seems disappointed. You suspect it wanted to be caught and battle some more as a palate cleanser."ZAs an immortal being, though, it’s got plenty of time to forget this ever happened."\It leaves with the mountain wind. Perhaps you’ll see it again on these snowy peaks..."JThe true power of the Dragon-type is only unlocked during an Eclipse!"?The only problem here is my own. I have failed my Pokemon."FI shall return to my thoughts, and I will come back more focused."BDragon-type Pokemon often roost on the peak of this mountain."JHearing the songs of Hymnus is a true once-in-a- lifetime experience."Down: Gigalith's Guts"I want to talk."Not why I'm here."All I need is you."More gifts?"Let me prepare."Very well."...No?"You need help."Go to hell."Last bit's a dealbreaker."Yes. Let me be yours."Take Jirachi."Refuse Jirachi forever."Catch Jirachi."Release Jirachi forever.Iu;␀� [[Q"North: Sewer Junction"8North-East: Exit to Eleig Stretch Sewer Maintenance"&South: Exit to LuxTech Rec Center"5How d’ya do? Can’t beat the stench out here."USinuses ain’t stung this bad since that shot of Reuniclus liquid came back up."XAh, I don’t get paid to complain, though. This Trubbish is bein’ real stubborn."5Mind lendin’ a hand? The way folks like us do?"=I’m a trainer. Real trainer, too – I train, y’see."]Train people’s Pokémon for money. We had a scuffle back in Novo Town… which ya won."RIf ya wanna know more than that, shame. We got a business relationship, yeah?"Now give me that rematch."Tch. Cold."iWelp, I’ll just park my ass here till this sack o’ trash works up the nerve to get its feet wet."'Get that toxin pumpin’, ya know?"AYou’re one of them reliable sorts, ain’tcha? Disgusting."KAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence ‘round these parts.",Now c’mon, show me your vicious side."<Got a bin liner to train and nobody to keep me company."Mind lendin’ a hand?"IAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence 'round these parts."-Ya see that? I knew you had a mean side."XDownright sadistic. Always good to have a bit o’ your inner psychopath available."EReal ace up your sleeve kinda deal, y’see what I’m sayin’?"@Babyface like you got plenty of room to blindside somebody."<Love to see it happen, love to see ya take it to heart."'You’re a hero. Look at yourself."GBut don’t get pinned down by the role – have some fun with it."+Play the rival a bit, yeah? Be a heel."VAh, nevermind me. Maybe you’re better at playing the hero, through and through."@Me? I’m a rival. I ain’t your rival, but I was a rival."YI wasn’t ever meant for big things, ya know? But I help keep heroes on their toes."MAnd, hell, maybe I have some fun along the way. Make some friends, yeah?"BThose days are behind me, but ya can’t teach me new tricks."9Fightin’ you feels like old times. I 'preciate it."/The name’s <imp>Alessa</imp>, by the by."I'Fraid I can’t chat any longer, though. I’m off to the big city."ASome bigshot CEO’s kid needs his reserves trained up ASAP."7Speakin' of trainin', ya should have one of these."QI'm sure it'll come in handy, if ya keep roughin' it in sewers and the like."9Anywho, see ya 'round. Don’tcha keep me waitin’."CIt is always important to give back from where you have taken!"uMy friend and I have been feeding the Munchlax down here as thanks for providing us with important battle items."jWe've done our part, but perhaps you would like to join us? The Pokemon down here love Big Malasadas."dIf you could get a batch of ten from the LuxTech food vendor, we could do a little bit of good."DThat is alright Trainer, my friend and I have more than enough."LBut consider my offer! It is not about wealth, it is about reciprocity."?Fantastic! The Pokemon here will appreciate your kindness!"GI don't see enough for a batch, Trainer. Perhaps you are mistaken."`Big Malasadas are sold at the LuxTech Campus. You should be able to purchase a batch there."MIt would be foolish of me to talk about reciprocity and not reciprocate!"5Here, Trainer. It is not much, but it is a gift."KEnjoy the world, Trainer. It is there for us, and we are there for it."@These Pokemon are happy as a direct result of your actions."BNot every Pokemon will have a grand adventure with a Trainer."IIt is important to remember that those Pokemon matter just the same."aYou know, I feel a little bad about stealing all those Nuggets from the Pokemon down here..."KIt reeks down here, but the Pokemon in this place are pretty friendly."VThey're more used to human contact than most, given how these are sewers and all.",You're a LuxTech employee, aren't you?!"I'm gonna steal your TMs!".Silver Ninjask isn't going to be happy...";Now this job's gone completely sideways. Thanks a lot."bYou better watch your back when you walk away or I might snatch those TMs from you after all.",I 