q另一部分学者认为，是马凯亚地区出色的生态治理，使得更多生命可以在此繁衍。"�但根据古生物研究，早在有人类定居之前，马凯亚地区的生物种群数量就已经达到了一个很高的数值。"\与诺沃镇的道馆馆主Eko合作，诺沃学院正在开发新的精灵止痛药。"�目前市面上的状态类药物，虽也有一定的止痛效果，但一直无法解决不能由精灵自主使用的缺点。"S为了绕开自主使用的难题，本院校正在努力开发新型药膏，"w与现有药物不同，我们希望新的药品，能在疼痛出现之前便阻断神经元对痛感的反应。"t在对战中的精灵仍然会受到突然刺激型痛感的影响，但可以免除持续型痛感的影响。"�这种药物适用于职业对战精灵，如果对其滥用，导致长时间处于药物作用状态，很可能会使其患上慢性疼痛。"}化身的出现极大影响了本就不够发达的马凯亚基础设施，城际间的联络也会因此变得危险。"~为了暂时缓解这些问题，望新大学一直在为负责线路安全工作的训练师和护林员提供免费课程。"P目前有多位教授和学生，正在研究有效对付化身的技巧。"\我们呼吁社会各界有化身对战经验的训练师能够自愿参与此项目。"q我校最近开设了新的项目，人为干预哥达鸭、天秤偶和漂浮泡泡的家族基因序列。"w目前参与的学者们，还在对测试用的繁育方法进行商讨，且其具体可行性仍受到质疑。"M我们无法确定自然选择是否会干扰到人造精灵的形成。"&入学申请入口暂已关闭。"#录取通知将很快送达。"G来自光华市的学生将会在开学一周之内得到通知。",你好，我能问你几个问题吗？"/谢谢，这对我的调查很有帮助。"#一些关于化身的问题。"2当然不是，我只是在做一个调查。")我只是希望您能参与调查..."Y这样吧，我不做过多的讲述了，只是问几个最简单的问题如何？"D毕竟每一位受访者，对我来说都是宝贵的数据。"G你能告诉我在马凯亚，一共解决掉多少化身了吗？"&那至少比一般人见得多。"这么多？"8那我就根据公共数据大致估测一下吧。"k你是不是已经觉得它们没什么挑战性了？听起来你比我想象中经验更为丰富。"8那你有没有发现它们身上的什么性情？"大家都这么说。"Y一个经验丰富的战士都这么说，那这个结论的可靠程度会很高。",啊，对，我也听说过这个事。"V我一直怀疑化身和马凯亚的特有地区形态有同根同源的关系。"J或许迫使它们进化的生存压力，便来源于这些化身。"\要知道这里有些地方的气候明显不自然，尤其是那些地下洞穴中。"G想必这片土地上，还有更多人类未曾发现的秘密。"_而且...呃...抱歉。这已经不是在做调查了，只是没忍住说多了而已。"Y我必须整理好情报和推论，并将其交给教授和护林员军官看看。"]我觉得我们可以展开深度合作。你知道 <imp>夜幽市生态园</imp> 吗？"我们在那里见吧。"z不过，考虑到时间问题...或许可以等到锦标赛结束之后，这样不至于耽误你自身的事情。"5为了帮你快速取胜，这个就给你了。"#祝你好运，再见，\PN。"B这所大学虽然不算顶尖，但却有3个王牌专业。"7古生物考古，3D打印，以及电子科技。"q试想一下，如果将这三者结合起来，就会产生世界上最大的化石研究和复兴项目！"不用了，谢谢。"可以"你在偷精灵？"你在拯救精灵？"我拒绝"学科领域"科研专题"申报信息"关闭"考古学"材料科学"生物学"返回上页"疼痛研究"化身研究"人造精灵"那要看你问啥"强制性的？"我不想答"几个？"十几个"难说"数不清了"进攻性强"实力强大"会变形态;[�"=Only authorized personnel are allowed through this door."'Well, we'd probably let Lainie in."She's pretty cool."	Huh?"!Didn't my shift end already?"!Something's gone wrong here.";I was training up a new Combee, but with Dolly back..."JYou seem like a Trainer with a good heart. Would you like to have it?"TI can hang onto it for now. But my offer still stands, if you change your mind."<Wonderful! I'm sure she will have a good home with you.".Treat it well, alright? Make Dolly proud."=How long has it been since I've seen Dolly? Eight years?"CIt’s almost surreal seeing her again. So much has changed..."GAlways make sure to read what you can on open, unlocked computers."(You never know what you might find!""Like credit card information."AI do research on which types are strong against other types."LFor example, Psychic-type is strong against Steel-type, and resists it!"!Most people don't know that!"[Of course, it's intuitive once you look at how well Alakazam handles its metal spoons!"You got a key?"+Understood. Head right on in, trainer."You got a key for the lab?"!If not, we can't let you in."DGrass-types are the best. I love how pure and natural they are."DMy entire team shrugs off magical attacks like they're nothing!"2Oh, by "magical" I mean Fairy and Ghost-type."@Natural beats supernatural any day of the week, in my book."RThe Fossil Research Lab has so many fossils that we're just giving them away!"2You can pay to get your fossils revived, too."2Talk to my associate in the room to our left."4Oh, Dolly! I thought I’d never see you again!"\And you -- I can’t thank you enough for getting her back to me. How’d you find her?".Oh, uh... well, don’t worry about that."=Anyways, uh, gotta see a man about a Poochyena. Toodles!"
Umph!"It’s you! Uh..."*Well, I mean, like, technically yeah."xBut they stole them first! Team Chasm needs to pay back its dues, y’hear me? They stole those Pokémon years ago!"Yeah, you got it!"�I, like, totally can’t stand the idea of some ex-Team Chasm jerks keeping some Pokémon that prolly still wants to go back home."CI, uh, guess I maybe kinda should’ve explained that earlier."JBut, like, hey, no harm no foul, right? My name’s <imp>Candy</imp>."nAnd you’re \PN -- I know, like, everything about you. So, hey, you’re cool. You, uh, want to team up?"BYeaaah, damn straight. Finally got a friend my age. Go Candy!"KAnyways, I’ll 100% be in touch. So we can inflict some more justice."Sayonara!"Oof. Rejected hard."sWelp, that’s your loss! Hell, if you keep working with Tamarind and Andris, I might just be your next rival!"Watch your back!"GPremise 1: Ice both resists and is super-effective against Ground."EPremise 2: Rock both resists and is super-effective against Ice.";Final premise: Ground is super-effective against Rock."BConclusion: To maintain consistency, Ground must resist Rock!"4The world is just perfectly balanced, isn't it?"BNow I just need to figure out what's going on with Psychic..."0The door reads "Authorized personnel only!""Welcome to Novo College!"^Feel free to check out any of our labs and classrooms to learn what kind of place we are."iYou can also log onto the PC over there to read lots about our history, our majors, and other stuff."[Dolly here got, uh, reappropriated by Team Chasm... how long has it been? Eight years?",It’s almost surreal seeing her again."oWelcome to the Novo College Informational Site! Please select one of the following subjects to learn more!"kMakyan paleontology is in an exciting time. Recent excursions have promised field-shaking discoveries."�The avatar crisis has only existed for less than half a year, but already fossil analysis has found striking resemblances to ancient Pokemon."lSkeletons found by researchers are significantly larger than the bone structure of modern counterparts."DNovo College has an accoladed history in the material sciences."fThe Rematerializer was voted by Trainers as one of the most useful inventions in the last decade."WWe also work closely with Pokemon Centers in order to improve medicinal practices."kMakya has a stunningly biodiverse ecosystem, which has raised the mystery of how it got to that point."zOne theory is that immigration to the region has brought stowaway Pokemon, or foreign Pokemon released into the wild."QAnother theory is the Makyan environmental policy is particularly effective."�For both theories, the counterargument is that fossil records show that Makya has had this biodiversity before human settlements were even founded."zIn collaboration with Eko, Novo Town's Gym Leader, Novo College is developing new pain-relief medication for Pokemon."rWhile status-relieving medicine serves a purpose, its main flaw is that it is reactive rather than proactive."�As a response to this issue, the College has been working to develop a new ointment, which can be applied to Pokemon once a day."RUnlike existing medicines, it serves to stop status pains before they happen."zPokemon in the midst of battle will still feel the effects, long-term pain will be numbed a few minutes after combat."�Career battling Pokemon benefit most from this, as continued exposure to untreated status can result in chronic pains once the Pokemon retires from battling."�The avatar crisis has disrupted much of Makya's already strained infrastructure, as travel between settlements has become quite dangerous."}To help combat this, Novo College has been offering free courses to Trainers and Rangers who wish to keep Makyan routes safe."]Multiple professors and students work to develop new strategies to defeat these avatars."nExperienced Trainers with a history of battling avatars are encouraged to volunteer in educational roles."|One of the College's latest projects involved tracking genetic signatures in the Golett, Baltoy, and Castform families."qWhile the exact methods of reproduction elude scientists, many suspect that selection forces remain at play."�How this natural selection impacts man-made Pokemon could have remarkable insights on how other Pokemon change form over millennia."9Applications for the current school year are closed."1Acceptance letters will be sent out shortly."[LuxTech Scholars will be contacted by a representative on their first week of classes."HGreetings. I hope you’ve come prepared to answer a few questions."1Thank you. I would like a firsthand account.".Concerning the avatars and their effects."#No, but I would appreciate it."2Understandable. I require more data, however."_Upon more elaborate consideration, I decided to not have you present our findings with me."`I think you’ll be glad to hear that. I would like to hear your personal opinions, though."aCould you give me an estimate of how many avatars you have fought during your time in Makya?"JSignificantly more encounters than the average individual, certainly."That many? Noted."ZI have my own estimates based on public records and hearsay. I will default to those."nDo you take no thrill in defeating these beings? Unfortunately I fear you may be an expert in the matter."<So, have you noticed any common traits between avatars?"(As the local people have found out.";I will trust your judgment, as an experienced battler.".Ah, yes. I’ve heard of this phenomenon."tI have my suspicions that the true nature of the avatars and Makya’s unique properties share a common origin."�The unique ecological pressures that create the Makyan forms must stem from the same source as the avatars. I’m certain of it."vThis region has several pockets of blatantly unnatural climatology – its immense cave network chief among them."BThere is more to this region than I have discovered thus far."M...But, excuse me. I am not asking questions. I am talking your ear off."mI need to collect my findings to present to the local experts in regional forms and the ranger captains."YI would like to talk with you again. Do you know the <imp>menagerie in Velenz</imp>?"#I would suggest we meet there."�Though, considering the timing, it would perhaps be better to wait until after the tournament is over. That way at least one burden will be off your mind."JIn fact, if it may help you in achieving a quick victory, take these." Best of luck. Goodbye, \PN.">Our college isn't too grand, but we have three ace areas."0Paleontology, 3D printing, and electronics."`When you combine them, you get the largest fossil studies and revival program in the world!"No thanks."
