[["[Whoa, careful kid. Ain't no adventure for you past here 'less you know what'cha doin'.">Can't let'cha through 'less you got the proper clearance."AThat gate ain't opening for any ol' Trainer that wanders in."FI ain't gon' stop you since you got yerself the proper clearance."NAin't gon' like it, since you're just gonna get your behind handed to ya.",We'll I'll be darned! You took it down!"VYer good in my books kid. Ain't seen battlin' like that since my days as a grunt."YThe Svait Rescue Op owes ya one. I'm glad this crisis is a bit closer to bein' over."+Alright y'all, time to get outta here!"7You think you can best that monster? Best of luck."3Takes 3 of us to just keep it from escaping..."WWhen you challenged that Avatar, I thought you just had as much pride as a Pyroar."2But wow, you've got the skills to justify it."aIf everyone in Makya was as good as you, the Avatar Crisis would be an Avatar Inconvenience."9All I wanted was to attend the Makyan championships!"FHow'd I even get involved with the Avatar of Entei of all things?"QI go to boarding school in Paldea and Team Star ropes me into their plans...";I go to Galar and end up on a Team Yell cheer squad..."NI got to Alola and I'm working for every famous evil dude under the sun?!"5And now this?! I need to rethink how I travel...["G哇，注意安全，孩子！你知道这里是什么地方吗？"/除非你有许可，否则不能通过。"G我们不会允许冒然闯进来的训练师通过那扇门的。">既然你有通行证，那我就可以让你过去了。"D虽说我自身不愿这么做，毕竟你也只会被打败。" 我惊了！你打赢了！"Y你干得很漂亮，孩子！自我从军以来，就没见过这样的战斗了！"P霜皑救援队欠你一个人情，离结束这场危机更近一步了！"&好了各位，可以回家了！"A你觉得你能打败那个怪物？那就祝你好运吧。"E每次阻止它跑出去，都需要我们3个人合力才行..."b之前你要挑战这个化身时，我以为你只是个跟火炎狮一样自大的家伙。"/但是你证明了的确有这份实力。"e如果马凯亚能多一些像你这样优秀的人，化身带来的危机就是小问题了。"/我只是来马凯亚参加锦标赛的！"A为什么会被卷入炎帝化身的防务工作当中啊？"M我一开始在帕底亚上学，然后莫名其妙加入了天星队...">后来去了伽勒尔，又在旅店被呐喊队选中..."Y在之后去了阿罗拉，又无意之中帮某个邪恶老大干了不少脏活..."V为什么现在又是这种感觉？我是不是该改改自身的旅行习惯...;["[Whoa, careful kid. Ain't no adventure for you past here 'less you know what'cha doin'.">Can't let'cha through 'less you got the proper clearance."AThat gate ain't opening for any ol' Trainer that wanders in.