human biome?"�So what can I learn from all this? Is this what I am? An expression of humanity? Or is this a fake, too? With the untamed merely putting on a charade?"'Do you believe I’m the real one?"1Thank you. I merely wish to prove it to her."nIt would be a mercy, really – she is living a lie, quite literally. She deserves to be true to herself."
