last."4Please, you have lived with us for generations!"'What could we possibly offer now?!"JThere is not much time left for my home. I will enjoy it while I can."`I thank you for giving me an excellent parting memory. Now, it's time to go to my new home."MI am sad I cannot spend my twilight years here. That is life, I suppose."It is time for a picnic."/You would not know our devotion, outsider."6It is over. There is nothing left to do but wait."-Oh, hi! I was expecting ya from Vincent."5Uhhhhhh... Welcome! To our uhhh... humble abode?"�We used to get more guests a looooong time ago, but we don't get them much now. I guess a sinking island isn't the best place for investors..."POh well! Can't save 'em all... just uhh... enjoy it while it lasts? Haha..."mAnyways! We have a healing center! I'm qualified a nurse, actually! Just don't have the typical uniform."wWe certainly like to battle here on this island! Just like uhhh... literally every other person... So that's cool!"Anyways I'll be in that building behind me if you need me! Ummm, enjoy your stay and uhhh... talk with some of the locals!"#Leave us to our ways, Trainer."CYou had to meddle. We have lost our traditions because of you!"^Ah, a visitor. It is rare to see one nowadays. I can hardly remember the last one's face."XIt's a shame. Memory is the only thing we have, and the only tool we can work with."3Tell me Trainer, what is your greatest memory?"`A mighty accomplishment indeed. I wonder, will it be your favorite when you lose the title?"vYou possess a full heart, Trainer. I wonder, will it be your favorite after you have seen them for the last time?"iA feat of courage, and a show of strength! I wonder, will it be your favorite when your anger cools?"bIt is wise to look forward. I wonder, will it be your favorite when you only have the future?"RThis island, our home, will soon be nothing but a memory. What an awful fate."IThere is nothing that can be done other than making one last memory."]A final hurrah before the shore closes in. A battle to shatter this island's very roots."'Are you ready, Trainer, to battle?"GThere are memories to be made, Trainer. Do not leave me apathetic."(A disappointment, to say the least."SIf there is one think I know though, it is that minds can change. Change mine."<Very well, I shall be here, looking for another memory."0I suppose that's that then. A final memory."VIt was not unpleasent, Trainer. It was the best we could do in such a short time."�If you would like, this is our farewell. Soon, we will fade into each other's memory. Some time after, we will fade even further than that."nBut perhaps, there is something more. I must gather myself inside my little cove. You are free to follow."I cannot let this happen!"*There is nothing left for us to do..."fI ache Trainer! There is hole in one's self when they lose their home, it is a heart torn in two!"kThe past has always been outside of our reach. And yet, when you cannot see it, it feels even further."�And yet, I do not feel despair. I feel bittersweet. When I think of home, it is impossible to not feel a little bit of warmth inside."gHave you felt that conflict before, Trainer? A feeling of warmth and joy that lives within sorrow?"I know your pain, Trainer."pThe world is never the same after someone leaves, but we are always glad that we got to live in that world."We think of the time spent with them, doing nothing. We regret it. Yet, that time is where they became who they are to us.".One day, maybe, we can forgive ourselves."/They never look at us the same afterwards."You realize you cannot imagine them without thinking about how their expression changed when they learned of your failure."aSometimes, it is a necessary mistake to make. There is no growth if we let ourselves simmer."4Then you are blessed now and cursed to feel it."]But that is life, young one. You must realize that, as we love to say, it is what it is."<I am filled with sorrow. It is the price I pay for joy."SBut I am not helpless. I choose to pay again and again. Each time it worth it."ONow, Trainer, will you show me a little bit of the joy you feel in battle?"hThere is no joy in battle without the bitterness of frustration. Let us pay your dues to our wiles."Ahah! Take that!"bA-hem, I mean, frustration is a natural part of growth. Grow, and approach me again, Trainer."6Afriad? Or cautious? Ah, well, it doesn't matter."-I will be here. We all smile eventually."@Perhaps you have caught a glimpse of that feeling, Trainer."rIt matters not, you will feel it soon enough. It will feel wonderful and awful and all of those great things."?I will collect my feelings before I leave. I'll be inside."9If you would like to follow, you are more than free."'A guest! What a pleasant surprise!"KHave you come to challenge me? I have a bit of time to test my mettle."MAh, but before we get too far ahead of myself, I must sate my curiosity."[You seem no stranger to struggle, but tell me, have you ever been broken by challenge?"RUtterly shattered. Reduced. Something you viewed as damningly insurmountable?"jHmm, bold. It is one thing to break yourself for another. It is another for them to mock your pieces."RIt can be a moment that defines your world, and you are not in control of it."{And you certainly you gained something in the end! Of course, you know as well as any that the real danger lies afterwards."VIt is one thing to climb a mountain once. It is another to climb a hill each day."8If honesty were a virtue, you'd qualify as a saint." Not that it's a good thing."�Then there is something you must do, now! There is a wide open world out there, but you must be torn down for a new life to grow!"hBut I digress. The force of will takes man and mon far, but it cannot always overcome cold reality."?This island will be gone. There are some that refute that."pSometimes, there is value in fighting the inevitable. Sometimes. I am never sure about it until it is over."QThere are those who try to preserve this place, as foolish as that might be."TI wonder how it will end up for them. It is a good trial, and a proper funeral."mBut that is them. I should focus on myself. I am ready for challenge. Are you ready for battle, Trainer?"Excellent!"ANow is the time! Let us break and reform from our struggles!"%And you lay before me in pieces."bThere's only one direction to go from here. Regain youself, and try again. You can do better.">Very well, but do not leave me waiting. I abhor idleness."OI am looking for one last trail myself. Are you ready for battle, Trainer?"4Wonderful! It was about time for me to shatter!"lI revel in that sting you get when you know you've been outmatched! It is undeniable, how jealous I am!">But such a feeling is fleeting, for better and for worse."TIt's time for me to get ready for the next hill. I'll be inside if you need me.";These Guardians have been here since before all of us."9If there is a way forward, they will bring us there."/You have snuffed out any hope that we had."1I'm not sure that it was a good or bad deed."(We seek its power to heal our home."!Now all we can do is wait..."You must have a plan!"0Centuries of guidance cannot end like this!"VSo many here wish to give up our homeland. To what! Simple time and happenstance?"UI will depart, but I will be bitter. The spirit of our island will sink with it."LI am surrounded by fools! The sages are right! We must adapt or perish!"Leave me be, outsider."LMy Rampardos and I have a unique camaraderie. We suffer from hair loss."4I need to get a sick crown like my Rampardos..."5I must treat the little hair I have left kindly."#Mmm. Maybe I should buy a hat."eHon hon! This island has exceptional beauty! It is a shame I will be the last visitor to see it."TOh, are you also foreign to here? Well, that ruins the title of "last visitor"."1Ah, the locals here are so good at battling."/I think I'll enjoy a fine Kalosian wine..."ZLook towards the future, Trainer. You might miss how much of a mess the past becomes."2Come, my Pokemon. Let us take a final stroll."0It's a shame how the past has been tainted."IWe are old minded here. But our ways are nothing in front of nature."aWe like to forget that we are still a part of nature, no matter how high we build ourselves."Winning the Championship."Helping a friend."!Telling someone to buzz off."Letting go of my past."	Yes."Not right now."Yes, when I lost someone." Yes, when I failed someone."Yes, when I upset someone."No, I haven't felt that."Yes, to help someone."Yes, to gain something."Yes, to avoid my fears."No, I haven't.[�"门被锁上了。"A先知希望能扭转岛屿沉没的事实，真是愚蠢。"M这座岛已经无法挽救了，我能看到它奄奄一息的样子。">或许你这样的外来者，会有不一样的视角。"2这座古老小岛的灵魂已经疲惫了。"V我不知道它会去什么地方，但我不担心，我能看到它的满足。"8我曾目睹自身的生命沉入了波涛之下。")我想拯救所剩无几的事物。"J我只是在享受最后的家园，享受最后的舒缓的微风。"A拜托了，你们世世代代都与我们生活在这里！"#现在我们能做些什么？"J家乡留给我的时间不多了，我会趁现在好好享受它。"\谢谢你给了我一段美好的离别回忆，现在，我应该去我的新家了。"M我很遗憾不能在这里安享晚年，或许，这就是生活吧。"是时候去野餐了。"/外人，你不会懂我们的奉献的。"5一切都结束了，除了等待别无他法。")哦，我还以为是文森特呢。"/呃...欢迎！光临我们的...寒舍？"�很久之前这里的客人还比较多，但现在已经没有往日的辉煌了，对投资者来说这里并不是啥好地方..."P好吧，这样也挺好...只是，呃...现在好好享受吧，哈哈！"q起码，我们这里还有治疗中心！其实我也是个有执照的护士，只是没有制服罢了。"h我们岛上的人也很喜欢对战，跟其它...地方的人一样，大概...毕竟这很酷！"�总之，如果你需要我的帮助，那就到后面的房子里找我，祝你在这里玩得开心...另外，多和当地人聊聊天吧！"#别管我们了，训练师。"J就是你们在多管闲事，因为你们，我们失去了传统！"n啊，有一位访客！已经很久没人来这里了，我都快想不起上一个访客的样子了。"_真遗憾...记忆是我们唯一拥有的东西，也是我们唯一可利用的工具。"2训练师，你最美好的回忆是什么？"z这的确是一项了不起的成就，我想知道，当你失去冠军头衔后，你最喜欢的还会是它吗？"�你有一颗饱满的心，训练师。我想知道，当你最后一次与他们相见后，你最珍视的记忆，还会是这一部分吗？"q这是勇气与力量的展示！我想知道，当你的怒火平息，最怀念的还是这一部分吗？"k展望未来是明智之举，但我想知道，如果只有未来，那它还会是你的最爱吗？"e这座小岛是我们的家园，但它很快就会成为回忆，这是多么可怕的命运。";除了留下最后的记忆外，我们别无他法。"V在海岸逼近之前最后的狂欢，一场足以破坏岛屿根基的战斗。"&你准备好了吗，训练师？"P我们都有美好的回忆，训练师，不要让我对此感到遗憾。"最终，还是失望。"S我明白，思想是可以改变的，或许我应该改变自身的想法。";好的，我就在这里，等待着下一段回忆。",我想就这样吧...最后的记忆。"S这算不上愉快，训练师。但这么短的时间，也只能如此了。"�如果你愿意，这将是我们的告别，很快，我们就会淡出彼此的记忆，再过一段时间或许会完全消失。"\但是，或许还有更多东西...可以藏在我自身的小海湾里，你请便。"#我不会让这一切发生！"#我们已经无计可施了..."h我好难过，训练师！当一个人失去家园时，他的内心就会被空洞撕成两半！"\过去总在我们的视野之外，越是看不到它，越能感觉到它的遥远。"�但我并不会对此感到绝望，我只会同时感觉到痛苦与快乐。每次想到家园，内心都能感受到一丝温暖。"e你感受过这样的冲突吗，训练师？那种悲伤中掺杂着温暖和喜悦的感觉？")我能明白你的痛，训练师。"~当某个人离开后，世界也不再是之前的那个了，但我们总会庆幸自身曾经生活在那个世界当中。"�想起和他们一起的无所事事的时光，会让我们感到遗憾，但也正因为他们，我们才会成为今天的自身。"2也许有一天，我们可以原谅自身。";在那之后，他们看我们的目光就不一样了"t我们会意识到，自身无法想象他们在得知我们的失败之后，表情会发生怎样的变化。"Y有时，这是必然的错误，如果任由自身沉沦，就不会有所成长。"8所以，你很幸运，能感受到它的诅咒。"S但这就是生活，年轻人，你必须一点点去理解事情的全貌。"J我虽然心中充满悲伤，但这是我为快乐付出的代价。"M不过我并非束手无策，我每次选择的付出都是值得的。"G现在，训练师，你能向我展示下战斗中的快乐吗？"e没有挫折的苦涩，就没有胜利的喜悦，让我们用诡计来偿还你的代价吧。"哈哈，接招吧！"\我觉得，挫折是成长的自然过程，成长过后再来找我吧，训练师。"8是害怕，还是谨慎？好吧，无所谓了。"2我会在这里，我们都会得到微笑。";或许你已经触及到这种感觉了，训练师。"z没关系，很快你就能感受到，那些让你觉得美妙与可怕的事物，以及它们所蕴含的美好。"A我会收拾好心情再进去，等待离开的那一刻。"5如果你想跟上来，我也不会阻拦你。" 有客人！真是惊喜！"Y你是来挑战我的吗？我也的确有些时间来检验一下自身的实力。"D啊，不过在这之前，先满足一下我的好奇心吧。"J看起来你应该很熟悉对战吧，那你曾经被打垮过吗？"S就是被彻底打败...那种事，或者说你觉得无法克服的事情？"_嗯，很大胆。为他人牺牲是一回事，被别人嘲笑不值又是另一回事。"t这或许是一个你可以决定自身生活在一个什么样的世界的时刻，但你并不能掌控它。"h当然，你肯定会有所收获！而且你也应该清楚，真正的危险，还在那之后。"A爬山是一回事，但每天怕啥就是另一回事了。"G如果诚实是一种美德，那你就可以被称为标杆了。"&当然这也不一定是好事。"{那现在，有件你必须要做的事情，那就是铲掉眼前的这个广阔世界，并让新的生命再次生长！"h抱歉，我跑题了，意志，能使人走得更远，但它不是一定能战胜冰冷现实。"G这座小岛马上就不复存在，但有些人却对此反驳。"�有时，与不可避免之祸斗争，会付出难以想象的代价。有时，在事情结束之前，谁也不知道是否还有转机。"M有些人在试图保护这个地方，虽看看起来感觉很愚蠢。"n虽然不知道他们的结局会如何，但这是一次合适的审判，也是一场体面的葬礼。"{但那是他们的事。现在我们该关注自身，我已经准备好接受挑战了，你准备好了吗，训练师？"很好！"A现在正是时候！让我们从纠结中挣脱出来吧！"&你在我面前支离破碎了。"h从这里开始，只有一个方向，重新找回自身，再试一次，你可以做得更好。">很好，但别让我等太久，我讨厌无所事事。"A我在寻找最后的踪迹，准备好了吗，训练师？",太棒了，是时候让我崩溃了！"\我陶醉于那种不敌对手的刺痛感，不可否认，我甚至有些嫉妒你！"2但这种感觉无论好坏，稍纵即逝。"M我该为下一座山做准备了，如果你需要，我就在里面。"P这些守护者在我们来此生活之前，就已经在这座岛上了。"/如果有出路，它们会拯救我们。"#你掐灭了我们的希望。"&我不知道这到底算什么。",我们寻求它回复家园的力量。" 现在我们只能等待..." 你必须得有个计划！"2几个世纪的传承不能就这样结束！"\这里很多人都希望我们放弃家园，为什么？只是因为时间和偶然？"Y如果我离开，就会感到痛苦，我们的精神也会随着岛屿而沉没。"c周围这些人都是傻子，\先知是对的，我们要适应它，不然终将会灭亡！" 别来管我，外乡人。"S我和我的战锤龙们有一种独特的友谊，我们都有脱发问题。"/我需要一个战锤龙那样的头盖...",必须善待我所剩无几的头发。"&嗯...或许我该买顶帽子。"_吼吼，这座岛真漂亮啊！很遗憾，我将是最后一个看到它的游客了。"Y哦？你也是外乡人啊？好吧，这下“最后的游客”就不是我了。")啊，这里的人真擅长对战。"/有点想念我们卡洛斯的美酒了..."J展望未来吧，训练师，即便再怎么怀念混乱的过去。">来吧，我的精灵，让我们最后再散散步吧。"2真遗憾，过去的一切都被玷污了。"M这里的人们思想守旧，但在大自然面前，什么也不是。"h我们喜欢忘记那些，无论将房子修建得有多高，我们仍是大自然的一部分。"获得冠军"帮助朋友"让别人滚蛋"放下过去"来吧"稍等"#是，当我失去了某人时"#是，当我辜负了某人时"#是，当我惹怒了某人时" 不，我没有这种感觉"有，为了帮助某人"有，为了得到某物"有，为了战胜恐惧"还没有过;[�"!The door is securely locked."DThe sages wish to reverse the island's death. They are foolish."GThe island cannot be saved, I have already seen it among the dead.";Perhaps an outsider like you has a unique perspective."6This island is old. There spirits here are tired."KI wonder where they might go, but I am not worried. They seem content."2I have seen my own life sink below the waves."!I want to save what is left."YI am simply enjoying the last of my home. This soothing breeze will the be the last."4Please, you have lived with us for generations!"'What could we possibly offer now?!"JThere is not much time left for my home. I will enjoy it while I can."`I thank you for giving me an excellent parting memory. Now, it's time to go to my new home."MI am sad I cannot spend my twilight years here. That is life, I suppose."It is time for a picnic."/You would not know our devotion, outsider."6It is over. There is nothing left to do but wait."-Oh, hi! I was expecting ya from Vincent."5Uhhhhhh... Welcome! To our uhhh... humble abode?"�We used to get more guests a looooong time ago, but we don't get them much now. I guess a sinking island isn't the best place for investors..."POh well! Can't save 'em all... just uhh... enjoy it while it lasts? Haha..."mAnyways! We have a healing center! I'm qualified a nurse, actually! Just don't have the typical uniform."wWe certainly like to battle here on this island! Just like uhhh... literally every other person... So that's cool!"Anyways I'll be in that building behind me if you need me! Ummm, enjoy your stay and uhhh... talk with some of the locals!"#Leave us to our ways, Trainer."CYou had to meddle. We have lost our traditions because of you!"^Ah, a visitor. It is rare to see one nowadays. I can hardly remember the last one's face."XIt's a shame. Memory is the only thing we have, and the only tool we can work with."3Tell me Trainer, what is your greatest memory?"`A mighty accomplishment indeed. I wonder, will it be your favorite when you lose the title?"vYou possess a full heart, Trainer. I wonder, will it be your favorite after you have seen them for the last time?"iA feat of courage, and a show of strength! I wonder, will it be your favorite when your anger cools?"bIt is wise to look forward. I wonder, will it be your favorite when you only have the future?"RThis island, our home, will soon be nothing but a memory. What an awful fate."IThere is nothing that can be done other than making one last memory."]A final hurrah before the shore closes in. A battle to shatter this island's very roots."'Are you ready, Trainer, to battle?"GThere are memories to be made, Trainer. Do not leave me apathetic."(A disappointment, to say the least."SIf there is one think I know though, it is that minds can change. Change mine."<Very well, I shall be here, looking for another memory."0I suppose that's that then. A final memory."VIt was not unpleasent, Trainer. It was the best we could do in such a short time."�If you would like, this is our farewell. Soon, we will fade into each other's memory. Some time after, we will fade even further than that."nBut perhaps, there is something more. I must gather myself inside my little cove. You are free to follow."I cannot let this happen!"*There is nothing left for us to do..."fI ache Trainer! There is hole in one's self when they lose their home, it is a heart torn in two!"kThe past has always been outside of our reach. And yet, when you cannot see it, it feels even further."�And yet, I do not feel despair. I feel bittersweet. When I think of home, it is impossible to not feel a little bit of warmth inside."gHave you felt that conflict before, Trainer? A feeling of warmth and joy that lives within sorrow?"I know your pain, Trainer."pThe world is never the same after someone leaves, but we are always glad that we got to live in that world."We think of the time spent with them, doing nothing. We regret it. Yet, that time is where they became who they are to us.".One day, maybe, we can forgive ourselves."/They never look at us the same afterwards."You realize you 