nsional monsters at bay out of the kindness of my heart."Really."mI do want the best for this place. Hopefully once you see all the work I’ve done that’ll be obvious."KBut, um, I know I’m not really wanted right now, so I’ll be going.")You... you did the right thing, kid."Eleig Boating and Fishing""Eleig Valet, at your service."%Care to exchange business cards?"Sewage Maintenance"7LOG RIDE BATTLE! LOG RIDE BATTLE! LOG RIDE BATTLE!"eYou've mastered the ways of the log in such short time... are you some kinda log riding prodigy?"!See you later, log cowboy..."This is it!"(The great outdoors! Untamed nature!"%The great outdoors beckon again!"Off! To lands yonder!":And nature remains untamed! Uncaring to our problems!"The air here is so crisp!")Who lies before me? A former knight?".An aspiring champion! What great delight!",I too seek strength with my companions."5We've travelled far, over mountains and canyons!"/But before I focus too much on scansion...",I'll state the reward, a kit expansion!"Capisce."You OK?"Don't know about this."What's your plan?"Of course."Well..."I'm not so sure."Feel better?"Candy..."
