 has stood for over 3500 years, making it the oldest capital city on the continent.""H"The people of Prizca will prosper for as long as the city stands.""*"May it last for another 3500 years!""7"Prizca, where the future is built with the past.""GA poster for an upcoming show. A notice says it's almost sold out!"7Next to it is a calendar of other upcoming events."1Prizca Castle predates even the city itself.";Some historians say it could be almost 4000 years old!"+The cityscape here always inspires me."=The shapes, the colors, the fashion, it's all wonderful."EIt's an artist's paradise, I can see why Noel sets up shop here."2I saw a famous singer appear out of thin air."8Right in front of that clay statue near the castle."JI tried reporting it to the rangers, but they all just laughed at me."I know what I saw!"TJust because I can't remember his name doesn't mean you shouldn't believe me..."Skeevy Eevee Pub"Prizca's East Gym"Leader: Noel"Sculptor, Battler, Artist."-A lineup for an upcoming music festival."UElectrique!, Mandibles of the Land, OHKO Queen, HippowDon't... it's a long list."6Museum-quality artifacts behind shiny metal bars."%I'll take your Pokémon for a --"..."BWow, you have no idea how easy it is to slip into that habit."DI'm just here to have a smoke before I have to go back to work."=The cafe inside is pretty nice, you should check it out."!Their coffee is pretty good."Bit pricey though."("Best bang for your buck in Makya!""@I used to be Chasm, but now I work at the Capitol Building."]Got myself a nice office and everything. A pretty decent setup for being a former grunt."uI mean, mostly everyone got off alright. Helena made sure everyone at least had a job before the Team disbanded."JI wonder what my former squadmates are doing. I hope they're alright."Noel's House"5The shops on this side of town are quite quaint.">Lot of odds and ends, stuff you won't find anywhere else!"Ironclad Dojo"$Make yourself as tough as iron!"UThe West end of Prizca w