Sure."Not that simple."Pokémon would do better?"Fair enough."Maybe later."Sure, let's go.Iu;␀�#[[O"=A cap of rock is holding back a geyser of boiling water."PI was once considered a beauty, but the way of the water needed a disciple."I should dry off."_Legends say if I stay here for fourty day and nights, my inner qi will strengthen tenfold."4The way of the water is full of solice. Splash."W\PN! You made it. Took some effort to find this place but... man. It was worth it."7What? My all-grown-up companion here? Yeah. It is."\Sorry. Well, not sorry. You didn’t have to come. But you did. And I’m glad you did."dI think it’s soothing. I dunno, maybe I’m just a little more goth than I’d like to admit."|The waters here are special. Not just ice-cold and way too deep for me to be comfortable, but they’re saltwater, too."cOcean water, trapped down here. And for some reason... it makes Phione transform into Manaphy."CI don’t know why, or how. I’m not that smart. But it does."�I don’t even know if it’s really evolution. It’s – I don’t care. I don’t care how it works, or what it is scientifically."6It’s a Manaphy now. And I’m damn proud of it."(Yeah! I mean, I think so, at least."YI can’t believe it. A Pokémon of actual literal myth and legends, here beside me."Oh. Uh, yeah, thanks."�Um. I didn’t really have a lot to do with it. Phione came down here, danced around in the water here, and then it just kinda... transformed."KUnbelievable. A Manaphy. I raised a Pokémon like this, all by myself."oIt’s a Pokémon from myth. Supposedly they live at the ocean floor and can befriend anything and anyone."iThey’re not half-bad in a scrap, either. Truly just... amazing. An absolutely incredible Pokémon."vAnd it’s my best friend. It doesn’t hate me, or resent me, or fear me. It chose to be with me, of all people."mIt could’ve chosen anyone. It could’ve chosen you – you’re certainly a better trainer than I am."lAnd, yeah, thank you, sincerely, for everything. You’re great. And you’ve really helped me. Thanks.";Hmm. Yeah, not good enough. Gonna need one last favor."qI hope so! Not too many people have even seen one of these magical things. And fewer people have fought one."@Oh, we’re on the same wavelength. You know what it means."CThat’s right. One last showdown. You and me. My new Manaphy."QI’m gonna lose, I know. But I’m not going down easy, alright? You ready?"4Alright. Get ready. I want it to be a good one."<I’ve never been happier to throw down against anyone."oManaphy’s debut. I don’t care if it’s good or bad. I just want to see it in action. Let’s do this."(You good? I’m ready when you are."*Ah, wouldn’t have it any other way."IYou know, \PN, you’re a good friend. You don’t pull any punches."GI never could beat you, and I’m never going to, but that’s OK."WYou’ve made me better. Helped me out. I hope I’ve helped you too. I really do.")And, uh, yeah, I’m glad I met you."rGood. I’m – yeah, that’s all I’ve ever really wanted. Manaphy’s happy, you’re happy, I’m happy."FSorry, that’s just who I am. Big ol’ bleeding-heart, I guess."Oh!";Uh, well... I don’t know. I’ll think about it, OK?"NWe’ll see each other around. I, uh... I dunno if I see you in that way."?You know. If you’re saying what I think you’re saying."D...\PN, I really do care about you, though. You’re my friend."1And if you need me, I’ll be there, always."^Well, maybe not always. I’ve got my Pokémon to take care of. But you know what I mean."/I’ve done some stuff I’m not proud of."ZI’m gonna come clean: I’ve been working with Yezera on her plans for a while now."�Never felt like I was good enough. Didn’t feel like anyone was good enough for the love we got from our Pokémon. But maybe that was just me projecting."�Maybe I’m the asshole, y’know? And I’ve known that forever – I’m not that stupid – but it takes a wake-up call to realize it. And this was it."�So, yeah, if they want to ruin the world, they can do it without me. And you can stop them with a Phione at your side. O