Ding!"...it's empty."#You peer down the dusty grate."?You start to feel like you've dropped something important."I'm sorry."Why are you here?"You owe me."	Huh?"So do I."Avatar?Iu;␀`[["[A dusty suit, in a state of disrepair. There's signs that bug Pokémon have fed on it."9There's still some long-dried flowers in the pocket."ASo it was an avatar after all. Two, in fact! How delightful!"CSuch grace, such magnificent power, such… oh, words fail me."HBut it is a little convenient, isn’t it? The two of us come here."LI, the sensitive soul, the pilgrim, and you, the knight, the protector.";And what should we find but a Gallade and a Gardevoir."rMaybe so, maybe not. In any case, I’m glad I had you walk upstairs first, and I hope you enjoyed the brawl."}I honestly envy you. You get to see these avatars up close and truly interact with them. All I can do is view them from afar."mSo it would seem. Appearing in the same biome as their regular counterparts makes sense at first glance."`But even that – how do they choose? Do they choose? Or are they pulled here by something?"OAnd if so, where were they before they were pulled here? If only I knew…"pPerhaps I did. Not intentionally, but, well, maybe that’s how I view us. Relationship goals or something."�And somehow that called them, or created them. If so, I’m deeply sorry – I didn’t intend for you to brawl on my behalf today."hAnd thank you. If you hadn’t showed up, that Gallade might’ve decided I had one too many limbs." Oh, I can make up for this."jWell, what do I know – you probably think an opportunity to fight these things is a gift in itself."IBut in case that doesn’t count as me repaying you, have this back."VIt’s told me what I wanted to know – findings I’ll share with you sometime."MI also happened upon this by pure luck while exploring the deep marshes."0It isn’t much, but I want you to have it."LI know this wasn’t exactly what I promised, but I enjoyed it anyways."oI hope you did too, and I’ll see you around. I’ll make it back to you. I promise. Until we meet again."Coincidence."It isn't random?"Did you call them?["S一套积灰的西装，破败不堪。有虫属性精灵啃食过的痕迹。"/口袋里还有一些早已干枯的花。"E果然是化身！而且有2个！简直是太美妙不过了！"V如此优雅又宏伟的力量...如此...哦，我不知道该怎么形容了。"B不过这正合适不是吗？是我们2个来到的这里。"M我，朝圣者，敏感的灵魂，还有你，骑士，守护之人。"J而且我们找到的正好是一个艾路雷朵和一个沙奈朵。"q或许吧，谁知道呢，不管怎样，很感谢你的骑士精神，也希望你能享受这场战斗。"}我真的很羡慕你，你可以近距离看到这些化身，并与它们真正互动，而我只能从远处观看。"J看起来应该是这样的，即便有一定的生物群系影响。"�可就算如此，它们又是怎么选择的？或者说它们做出主动选择了吗？还是被什么强行安排在这里的？"e如果真是如此，那它们来到这里之前呢？又会在哪儿？如果知道就好了..."z或许我只是无意中知道了，但...嗯...或许这只是我们的视角，强行将关系绑定上去而已。"�至于说将它们召唤过来，或者说创造出来的方法，我很抱歉...我今天其实...真的没有让你为我而战的打算。"e不过还是要谢谢你，如果没有你，那只艾路雷朵或许会把我大卸八块的。")当然，我也有给你的补偿。"h好吧，或许这些不够...但你也可以将与它们战斗的机会本身视作一份礼物。"Y如果还不够的话我也没办法了，毕竟朝圣者身上的东西并不多。"\它告知了我想知道的东西，我也会在某个时刻与你分享我的发现。"&这是我在沼泽里找到的。";虽然不是很值钱，但我想将这个赠予你。"S我知道这不是一次完美的体验，但我还是很享受这次经历。";希望你也一样，我们还会再见的，保重。"巧合。"不是随机的？"你叫来的？;["[A dusty suit, in a state of disrepair. There's signs that bug Pokémon have fed on it."9There's still some long-dried flowers in the pocket."ASo it was an avatar after all. Two, in fact! How delightful!"CSuch grace, such magnificent power, such… oh, words fail me."HBut it is a little convenient, isn’t it? The two of us come here."LI, the sensitive soul, the pilgrim, and you, the knight, the protector.";And what should we find but a Gallade and a Gardevoir."rMaybe so, maybe not. In any case, I’m glad I had you walk upstairs first, and I hope you enjoyed the brawl."}I honestly envy you. You get to see these avatars up close and truly interact with them. All I can do is view them from afar."mSo it would seem. Appearing in the same biome as their regular counterparts makes sense at first glance."`But even that – how do they choose? Do they choose? Or are they pulled here by something?"OAnd if so, where were they before they were pulled here? If only I knew…"pPerhaps I did. Not intentionally, but, well, maybe that’s how I view us. Relationship goals or something."�And somehow that called them, or created them. If so, I’m deeply sorry – I didn’t intend f