et everything back to the beginning."3When the world was new… full of potential…"4I want a world free from this constant boredom."GI want a world in which the ancient power of Pokémon is set free."$I want a brand new blank slate."Yes. I am."?Incapable of relating to humans, or even speaking to them."lMy heart races when they look at me. I am insane, or at least ill. But that doesn’t mean I’m wrong."GI’d expect nothing less. You’re just like me when I was young."/Wanting to be good. So they’d love me…"$…You understand, don’t you?"$Team Chasm uncovered the Regis."hTamarind understood them because she was a scientist. I understood them because they were Pokémon."8Regidrago, when humans cowered in fear of monsters."(Regice, when they huddled in caves."7Regirock, when they built fortifications of stone."(Registeel, when they mastered iron."=Regieleki, when the world was finally theirs to control."XEach one a testament to an era, a chapter in humankind’s domination of the world."pAnd then Regigigas, a remnant of the first era, the primordial era, just after Arceus created the universe."*Arceus created, and Regigigas shaped."<Pokémon were greater, before they became domesticated."iYou’ve seen the echoes of those primordial Pokémon. Soon, that’s what all Pokémon will become."No, not hostile."oYou’re so used to Pokémon being loving and subservient that it’s shocking to see them demand respect.".They’re wild animals. Leave them alone."AWhat about Rattata? What about Boltund? What about Venipede?"WJust another species. Not privileged. Not the center of the universe. Not anymore.")Returned to nothing but white stone."eWho knows what humans will do from there? I’m sure they’ll find a way. They’re persistent.")I’m good with Pokémon. Very good."=I’ll be better off there than here, that’s for sure."KBut I’m wasting your time. I’m only good at one thing, in the end."You ready?"…Alright."6Care to enjoy the view with me? It’s beautiful."&Good. I know you won’t bore me."`Maybe now 