d me."TI’ll be the shadow behind the throne, and I’ll – I’ll finally be happy!".I’m so tired, \PN. I’m so very tired."|You can never understand it – living in a world ruled by people you’re terrified of. People you can’t comprehend."_I deserve some rest. I deserve some peace. And this is the only way I’m going to get it."LThat’s the real reason. For me. So I can have a world where I belong."Do you? Could you ever?"6I deserve a chance at happiness. I never got one.")Everyone else did. It’s only fair."Oh."8Oh… well, thank you. If only it changed anything."
