rs wanting."4Your team exceeded on all axes. Take our badge."II’d like to think our candy had something to do with your success."/When you train your Pokémon, think of us."5We – no, I – bear a peculiar responsibility."pThe company allows me to analyze challengers to improve my team, and provides candy and equipment to do so."FI provide my charismatic skills and bring challengers to the gym."[My purpose above all else in this is to test challengers to find a suitable candidate."XSpecifically, for eliminating a remnant of Team Chasm’s tampering with Regigigas."KThat candidate is you, dear. Said remnant is a beast of dire strength."^Find it south of the docks, down the ladder hidden on one of the crescent-shaped islands."Take care."LThe avatar is below the island that bounds the southwest of the harbor."=If you cannot eliminate the avatar, I will find another."6Until then, we thank you for touring our factory."It is done?"	Hah!"Hahah! Hahahah!""My long charade is at an end!"+Change is on the wind for me, darling."XI’d tell you what I’ll do, or where I’m going… but you know I’d be lying."RThese appear to be Victoire’s notes. Most of it is an extensive to-do list."F“Perfume of that smell that’s only found inside of a tank.”"-“Make fusing Pokémon a real thing.”"“Mecha-Fidough.”"'“Be the first woman in space.”"sIn space has been angrily scribbled out and, in much newer ink, ‘on the moon’ has been written beneath it."O...In small letters on the side is scrawled “haute couture spacesuit?”"XA spreedsheet program is open with dozens of tabs, and a dizzing amount of numbers."qBriefly skimming the tab names, you see "Johto Expansion", "Moomoo Milk Sourcing", and "Enigma Berry Tests.""Sorry, not yet."Hah, évidemment.[="8如果你愿意，我很乐意再次进行测试。"2让美丽、优雅和力量都展露出来。";你好，小可爱，还喜欢这趟观光旅行吗？">对我们来说，客户能够满意就是最高褒奖。"V履行好职责就是我们的快乐，而我的职责是为别人带来快乐。"k我还开创性地为公司和马凯亚提供另一项建议：给挑战者定制挑战赛的权力。"G我们的准备工作已经就绪，安全设施也已经解除。" 能请您共舞一曲吗？"没什么好担心的。"P您需要多长时间我们都可以等，激起的齿轮会一直转动。"G嗯？难道说，我们温和的态度让您感到懈怠了吗？";还请记住，柔软的手套下皆是钢铁之拳。"J