[["_This lighthouse has recently been renovated thanks to the generous donations from LuxTech!"RWe also received a history and conservation grant from the Makyan Government."8Exploring ruins is my hobby, my passion... my life."PBut I've already explored all the legal ones. And most of the illegal ones.":Maybe you could do me a favor and... make a few more?"-I come to Makya every summer from Johto."]My favorite part of the trip is looking out over the sea from the top of the lighthouse."'I'm studying under Noel right now."OHe gave me this rock, and sent me off to go find inspiration from the sea."2So... here I am. With nothing to show for it.";I think I just need some caffeine. You got any coffee?"4I guess its just me and these views of the sea."8Ahh, the artistic vigor—it's coursing through me!"7Please take this hunk of uselessness away from me."#I got my hopes up for nothing."AI hope my next piece will impress the Prizcan Artists Guild."0Welcome to the Sweetrock Harbor Lighthouse."EYou can visit the lantern room by taking the elevator behind me!"xThe light source at the top of the lighthouse is a large fragment of the meteorite whose impact created our harbor."GClefables are drawn to the shard, so we let them gather around it."I find it quite endearing."3A bookshelf full of history and science books."YYou notice a large tome named "Techniques for Mining Rock Candy" dated 60 years ago."Don't give coffee."Give coffee.["Y这座灯塔最近得到了光华市的慷慨捐赠，进行了全方位的翻新。"D我们还从马凯亚政府那里获得了历史保护基金。"G探索遗迹是我的爱好，我的热情所在...我的生命。"J但合法的遗迹我都探完了，大多数非法的也探过了。"8或许你能帮我个忙...再搞出几个新的？"5我每年夏天都会从城都来到马凯亚。"M我旅行中最喜欢的部分就是从各地的灯塔上俯瞰大海。"2我正在诺埃尔的指导下学习艺术。"A他给了我这块石头，并让我去海边寻找灵感。",所以...我来了，但灵感没来。"8或许我还差一些咖啡因，你有咖啡吗？")我想我只能和海景为伴了。"5啊，艺术活力——正流淌在我全身！"这个给你了。"我白高兴了。"M我希望我的下一件作品能让宏礼艺术家协会印象深刻。" 欢迎来到蜜岩灯塔。"A您可以乘坐我身后的电梯，前往高处的房间！"h灯塔顶部的光源是一块巨大的陨石碎片，正是它的撞击形成了我们的港口。"Y皮皮们则是被这块碎片吸引来的，所以我们让它们聚集在周围。"我觉得这很可爱。")书架上满是历史和科学书。"F你注意到一本60年前的旧书，《冰糖开采技术》。"不给咖啡"给咖啡;["_This lighthouse has recently been renovated thanks to the generous d