 begin."J“Wrack and ruin broke our ships/And plucked us from our heavens.”"UOh, my apologies! It takes a short while to get my bearings again after a fight."eI get the same way when translating – which I have to assume is why that couplet came to mind.">Let me give you your badge. You’ve more than earned it."UWe don’t have to discuss it – I won’t infantilize you with obvious praise."\Speaking of plucking from heavens, though… you ought to know what that victory means."#Shall we chat a little longer?"&…Hmph. So you… ah, nevermind."[Ignore the ramblings of my battle-jumbled brain. It’s always a pleasure to duel you."…Huh. How clever."3You won, and I have a badge to present to you."[Goodbye. …Oh, excuse me. It takes me a moment to remember my manners after a battle."LCongratulations on your victory. I’d be happy to rematch you any day."TI’ve spent most of my career carefully breaking into sealed crypts and safes."=Years ago, though, I was also hired to help create them."�The wondrous abilities of the Regis made making nigh-impenetrable doors a cinch… but I’ve broken into a lot of impenetrable doors."=There is an avatar in a cave, high above where we stand."GI’d like to entrust this key to you, so that you can destroy it.".The past belongs in the past – forever."1Hello, \PN. Any good news about that avatar?"hNo? Well, then, I’m afraid I’ll have to withhold your tea and coffee privileges until there is."	Hah!"4Sorry, but I have to have some bargaining chip."!Go destroy that avatar, now."=It hides in a cave above our heads, on the mountainside."9Ah. So it’s done. I just wish we could’ve… no."(History is history. Today is today."OAnd tomorrow is tomorrow – a tomorrow without avatars, if we’re lucky."�Thank you, \PN. I think I’ll take a short break. You’re the last challenger I expected to see before the championship anyways."8You’re always welcome to stop by my home, though!"Ceremonial iron swords."'They were dated to 1800 years ago!""A fossil of an aquatic plant."dA plaque lists a very long scientific name for it. Your eyes glaze over as you try and read it."4A simple plaque simply states "Armaldo Fossil"."MThe rest of the description plate probably hasn't been manufactured yet."4The Armaldo fossil behind me was just unpacked."1I have to protect it from ruffians like you!"(Must have misjudged your character."7Unlike me, you'd never steal a priceless artifact."
