y."LI knew she had to slip up eventually! Can’t just chug coffee forever!"What? No! No way!"0OK, wait, like, maybe that’s a good idea?"wLike, if I’ve already got everything I need to know, I can totally get her to lower her guard by giving it back.".Anyways, the main thing I actually, like,"�care about is \nthis after-action report for something called “Project Testament.” Y’know how Velenz is, like, this total ghost town?"wWell if I’m reading this right – and I had to look up a few words but I think I am – Team Chasm caused that!"�They found some way to make avatars show up and secretly made them swarm the town, ‘cause apparently Velenz was super-resistant to helping."�Then they, like, intentionally lured avatars into the caves around there to mess up the foundations, and the whole thing started to sink into the mud!""Seriously, it’s screwed-up!"sYeah! Like, this is the stuff Team Chasm did, and people are still, like, totally OK with them running around!"`Um... not completely sure, but I’m absolutely certain they did some evil stuff there, OK?"iI don’t know how they did it, or if the whole, uh, what was it called... “soil liquefication?”"`Yeah, I dunno if that was intentional or not, but the report is pretty damn happy about it!"nI mean, like, kinda? The report doesn’t really get into the hows or whys that much, but, like, c’mon!"QIf you don’t like these people, just, like, fight them? This is messed up."No!"No, no, no. No talking."�I know you’re friends with Tamarind, and, like, yeah, she did you a favor, and she’s cool. But this lady has done some evil stuff."FI’ve got a plan to confront her, and I want your help, alright?"�Once the tournament is about to start, pretty much everybody is gonna be there, so there’s gonna be way less goons just out and about."�I’ll send her an anonymous li’l letter – ooh, I can cut up the dossiers for letters and glue them together! That’s awesome!"�Anyways, yeah, send her a letter, tell her to come to the <imp>sewer main