 doing in there?"pI didn't think of you as the kind of person who'd walk around gawking instead of actually paying attention."!You're just like the others."oI didn't waste 3 months trying to crack the code to just turn around and decide that it was all pointless."I'm... sorry."NWhat a hypocrite I am. This is not the thing I should be focusing on now."9And I certainly shouldn't be getting angry with you."8I should be... grateful. For what you did in there."6For doing what I can't. Confronting The Drillers."FI... I love my Pokemon... but they could never do what yours did."(Let's focus on the problem at hand."nYou prevented The Drillers from getting their hands on the genies... but both groups are still out there."#We've got to chase after them."WI may not be able to battle, but Michi here is like a cargo plane in Pokemon form."EShe'll get us to wherever the Forces of Nature have fled off to."$It's your time to shine, Michi!")I... can understand your hesitation.".Do your preparations, then. Please hurry."XThe water here can get really deep! If I didn't have this tube, I'd probably drown!"8I must rely on myself! I must get swimming lessons!"$I trust this tube with my life."KDo you know how to swim? Why'd you have to use your board to get here?"0I don't need a ship, I'm a natural swimmer!" A natural sinker as well..."[I work on a boat because I need cash to live. If I could swim instead of eat, I would."-My biceps are beyond your comprehension."West: Canal Desert"Northwest: Split Peaks" Northeast: Sweetrock Harbor"VI come here to relax with my Pokemon. Though, a battle or two won't hurt, either.".The Skeevy Eevee needs us, I can feel it."Maybe I'll see you there!"`That was fun! You should fight my sister, too. She's all the way at the start of the river!"aGood battling! You should fight my sister, too. She's all the way at the start of the river!"It’s Michi, the Tropius."2She looks excited to fly off on an adventure!"7She came back to fly you back to the Empty Isla