Mine."?...There is nothing much to say to a dead woman, is there?"1Don’t be. It’s better to know the truth."...Imogene is dead."XI do not know if I ever did. Countless possibilities plagued me in sleepless hours."8Was this one too elegant to consider? Or too cruel?"RImogene has been dead for years. She died well before my memory on the train."KShe was a hermit and a recluse, a mystic and a witch, and now... gone."_I can feel... memories... bubbling up. They’re seeping in like blood through thin gauze."(I can’t let them in. I mustn’t!"MIf I remember who I am... I won’t be me anymore. I won’t be Imogene."...It is agonizing."{The silence, filled with the beat of my raging heart and the echoes of things I had thought left to blissful oblivion."No! You would kill me?"HIf I remember I will be – I will be undone! Unmade in an instant!"So I believed."pHah! How innocent I was, truly, never having witnessed something so horrible as to make one wish to forget."1I’m trying. I am trying with all my might!":I do not want this identity! I do not want this past!"XIf I witness this revelation it will shatter me! I know this with utmost certainty."And... so did she."�I do not know if she has already given in, but she bestowed upon me a gift before she left my presence for what I fear is the last time."Her Pokémon."?She would not entrust them to me if she planned to return."+...I am prepared. I can run no longer."eWilling or no, the truth descends upon me. I will greet it with all the fury I might yet muster.")Make your preparations, if you must."LAre you ready? I cannot do this alone. I require a mirror to gaze into."PI must dance, must ritualize this, must make into something comprehensible."bI need your support, and I know your adamant core resides within your abilities as a trainer."mMore than that, I know it is how you judge people. I would have you witness my soul, and know the truth."SDo what you must. I may wait a few moments longer... may keep the past at bay."FFor the last time, I take up this identity I have absconded with."I am Imogene."I am an oracle."I am a seeker of truth."@Bare your soul to me, wanderer! Let this be my last battle!"...So be it."I remember."oI remember the house, the old hardwood, the ticking of the grandfather clock, the smell of the river loam!"{The crushing of the drying autumn leaves, the warmth of a soft embrace, the bruising, the bleeding, the burning, the fight!"LThe love of the fight! The yearning to learn, to become something more!"_I remember her. I remember Imogene teaching us, teaching all of us... teaching us to be..."Go on ahead."9Find what has happened to my sister in this torment."RI... I will release our Pokémon, and then I will cease this long masquerade."!I will be trapped no longer."?The name on this gravestone is faded beyond recognition..."$Leave me. I must do this alone."There’s a note."�“I’ve released them. Our Pokémon go readily. I think they know. As for me... I remember. She loved Dittos. She kept dozens."SShe trained them not only in battle, but to imitate humans. To imitate... her."YI found it so curious, to see Pokémon pretending to be people. How lovely. How fun!"sShe took me in as if I was just another pink blob, and she taught me more than I can express, let alone repay."{I am not her, nor is my companion. We are but two mirrors set facing each other, endlessly reflecting a woman that is gone."hWe strayed further and further in our imitations every day. It could not last. Do not mourn for us."aThis is the truth, and it provides suffering and succor in equal measure, as it always does.">We are released from our bonds. We are Imogene no longer."<Now we are Imogene, sisters of a name, and that is all."Thank you."Goodbye."�P.S.: I have done things I should not have, in pursuit of this truth. I have endeavored to cause harm to you, to others, to the world entire."qI do not know if this was my own selfish need to know what in my heart of hearts I already saw yet denied --"Aor if, perhaps, Imogene was not the saint I remember her as."EIn either case, I will take responsibility for what I have done."�I cannot stand against you, and will gladly aid you in your coming trials. Not to aid the flow of fate, but because you are my friend."HBecause it is the right thing to do, and because it is what I want."bI cannot ask for more than a chance to make amends side by side with one such as yourself.”"@P.S.: I will gladly lend my aid to you, no matter who I am."TAsk for my assistance, and I will be there. I have plenty strength yet to give."jI do this not for you, who is of import to the flow of destiny, but for you, my friend and confidant."KBring me with you if you desire my company, or have need of my powers."?It is the least I can do... and the best I can imagine.”"...A Mew."@The infinitely-mutable Pokémon of myth, here in the flesh."3It chitters happily, swimming through the air."�Yet, somehow, there’s a macabre tinge to its movements, a slight touch of gallows humor to the way it darts around gravestones."HThere is a flash of sympathy in its eyes when it stares into yours."MIt knows what it is, and it knows what you are, and you know what it is."SIt stops and coils, floating for a moment to regard you with its vibrant eyes.")You see the conflict in its eyes –"�the desire to explore free and wide, the remembered thrill of the fight, the eagerness to repay its debt, the desire to accompany you."!It leaves the choice to you."%It winks at you as you catch it."lSometimes it will go missing, wandering on flights of fancy through landscapes and thoughtscapes alike."CSometimes in the witching hour objects will move on their own."cSometimes you find notes written in handwriting you can’t read, signed with a question mark."9You know it can leave any time it likes. It won’t."9It flips upside down, then rights itself in mid-air."\Perhaps mockery, perhaps a nod, perhaps just an idle motion of a recently-freed animal."Then, it’s gone."RA mirage that disappears with a strong breeze, dispelled like a waking dream."}If you come back, perhaps it will be here, waiting for you. They’ll say this place is haunted, but you know the truth."`It’s always liked graveyards, and it can afford to wait to make sure you won’t need it.""Now, it has nothing but time."0I BRING A WHOLE NEW MEANING TO DEATH METAL!"TNow that I think about it, what I'm doing down here is immensely disrespectful."&TAKE THE G OFF OF GRAVEYARD BABY!""BWAHHHHH BWAAAAHHHHH BWWOOOW!"Are you alright?"Which one are you?"What did you see?"Where's the other one?"..."I'm so sorry."	How?"Yeah, I'd guessed..."You have to remember."Better to know."Then don't remember."I'll prepare."Very well."Catch Imogene."Release Imogene forever.Iu;␀�.[[^"PYezera and the others are gone, I’m afraid. It’s just you… and… me.":We won. No reason for me to be here. Absolutely none."XOther than the immense enjoyment I’m about to extract from dismantling your team."EA friend of Yezera’s. Besides that, I’m masked for a reason."iI would ask who you are, but quite frankly it doesn’t matter. I’m going to find out soon enough."9There’s only so many types of people in the world.":I just told you: because humiliating you will be fun."MUnless you mean extracting Regidrago, in which case, no, I won’t tell."bHumans have this infuriatingly self-destructive need to tell secrets. I’m better than that."3Well, I see the dialogue’s broken down fast."Fine. Suffer."6But I didn’t come here to engage in small talk."iI assure you, it isn’t personal – no one has anything interesting to say. You’re no exception."WBut you are exceptionally skilled, I understand, and that’s correlated with ego."5Allow me to show you what you’re really worth."V…Ah, so be it. I doubt I could drill humility through your thick skull anyways."=You’re good at playing shallow games – good for you."1A Totem calls. I’ve seen more than enough."}They got away. They won. A few that were dressed up like ancient Makyan priests, and whoever the hell THAT was. And Yezera…"UWish I knew. That guy was a narcissist and an asshole, I can tell you that much."#The rest of them… who knows."Could be anything."jBut if they were after Regidrago specifically, and Yezera’s with them… maybe even leading them…"4…I don’t know. It doesn’t make any sense.">She should be the last person to pull this kind of stunt."XIt is. It’s your problem now, and I know you aren’t gonna like that, but it is."5This is bigger than just one legendary Pokémon."4Remember what I said about the big open secret?"oThe caves around Makya are tombs for the Regis. The weird ones I was talking about before. Ones like this."NWell, some archaeological teams went to study them a couple decades back."yAnd then they found the Regis, and the rich mineral veins, and the ruins, and they figured they could leverage that."{We got some corporate backing from Andris and Mavis, and boom: Team Chasm. I was one of those original archaeologists."n…Some of us. Helena wanted to run her own region. Andris wanted a piece of the organized crime bigtime."QMe, I study the Regis. And some people wanted me to leave well enough alone."jI had a Team and Regidrago on my side, and they didn’t, so I got to study what I damn well pleased."LSome of us. I didn’t. I had five Regis – what did I need money for?"8If I wanted lab equipment, I sent a list to Helena."GI lived in a research station and ate ramen. Best days of my life."oI just wanted to study the Regis, and with their power, nobody could tell me no. Funny how that works out.")You make it sound so pure and noble."bI was curious. Wanted answers. I got them – who could tell me no with Regidrago at my side?"YNot to mention the full might of Team Chasm, 'cause my research was VERY profitable."QI’m getting to that, but also, hey, it could come in handy some day, yeah?"5As I was saying: we found the five lesser Regis."\It took me years, but I deciphered their inscriptions and understood their true nature."JThat led us to Regigigas, and at that point we were cooking with gas."RGigas was stronger than the rest of the Regis put together, and smarter, too."|Shape the earth, revert it back to some kind of primordial clay. Create seals and wards that nothing could get through."2And, yeah, it could throw a mean Giga Impact."iIt could do… other things, too. We found a way to make it create ethereal Pokémon with its power.";They were hostile, powerful – had to be locked away."}And then by the time Yezera kicked down our door and told us to stop, she was basically just confirming what we already knew."pWe were playing with fire. If we kept using Regigigas, we ran the very real chance of destroying the world."`Or at least permanently changing it. So we put each Regi back in their tomb and went legit."iThe tombs were reinforced, of course – just about nothing can get through the minor Regi chambers."KGigas’s chamber can only be opened by the other five Regis together."_I don’t know. She agreed with us: it was too dangerous. We were criminals, not lunatics."MI know things… haven’t been great for her, but this? This is insane."[Who knows. We knew some groups were trying to get them back – they always have been."PBut succeeding? There was no way. Impossible. But… apparently Yezera can."*…Probably. They might already have."nGigas’s chamber is deep down, though, and if they haven’t broken the seal yet, it’d be for nothing."QOr if they’ve resealed it. I can try and scout it out, but… no promises."^My POINT is that if you don’t help out, you better get used to the look of white stone."]You’re gonna be seeing a whole lot more of it if someone tells Regigigas to let loose."<Listen, I don’t know. I don’t know a lot of things."sSo let me talk to Andris, our rangers, Helena, whoever else I can find. We’ll figure out how bad things are."PAnd if these thieves show their faces aboveground, you can brawl with them."~They’ve got at least one Regi, probably more, so there’s a strong temptation to wreak havoc. Trust me – I’d know."JHate to say it, but you just need to keep being your usual self, kid."JOr, no, I shouldn’t call you kid. Take this – you’ve earned it."AUsed to give these to Chasm strike teams, for cave scouting."UIt’ll get you just about anywhere in the region – nobody hides from you now."3So go get those badges and save the day, hero."Who are you?"Why are you doing this?"Shut up, edgelord."Who are they?"What do they want?"Why Yezera?"Not my problem."You wanted power?"You wanted money?"You wanted knowledge?"Why should I care?"Then why is Yezera..."How many Regis are stolen?"They're opening that door."Your point?[^"D恐怕叶泽拉和其他人都走了。只剩你...和...我。";我们赢了。我没理由在这里。完全没有。"J除了我即将从拆解你的队伍中获得的巨大乐趣之外。"G叶泽拉的朋友。除此之外，我戴面具是有原因的。"S我本想问你是谁，但坦白说这无关紧要。我很快就会知道。"&世界上只有这么几种人。"8我刚告诉过你：因为羞辱你会很有趣。"P除非你是说提取雷吉铎拉戈，那样的话，不，我不会说。"\人类有这种令人愤怒的自我毁灭式的倾诉秘密的需求。我比那强。"/好吧，看来对话很快就崩坏了。"很好。受着吧。" 但我不是来闲聊的。"h我向你保证，这不是针对个人——没人有什么有趣的话要说。你也不例外。"D但你确实技艺非凡，我明白，而这与自负相关。"/让我来向你展示你真正的价值。"e...啊，那就这样吧。反正我怀疑我无法从你那厚实的头骨里钻出谦逊来。"5你擅长玩浅薄的游戏——为你高兴。"2图腾在召唤。我已经看得够多了。"�他们逃走了。他们赢了。几个打扮得像古代马凯亚祭司的人，还有那个该死的，管他呢。还有叶泽拉..."Y希望我知道。那家伙是个自恋狂和混蛋，我只能告诉你这么多。" 其他人...谁知道呢。"可能是任何人。"w但如果他们专门冲着雷吉铎拉戈来的，而且叶泽拉和他们在一起...甚至可能领导他们...",...我不知道。这完全说不通。"5她应该是最不可能搞这种事情的人。"b是的。现在这是你的问题了，我知道你不会喜欢这样，但这就是事实。",这不只是关于一只传说精灵。"2记得我说的那个公开的大秘密吗？"e马凯亚周围的洞穴是雷吉们的陵墓。我之前说的那些奇怪的。像这样的。"8嗯，几十年前有些考古队去研究它们。"b然后他们发现了雷吉们、丰富的矿脉和遗迹，他们觉得可以利用这些。"{我们得到了安德里斯和梅维斯的企业赞助，然后砰：裂隙队。我是那些最初的考古学家之一。"�...我们中的一些人。海伦娜想经营自己的地区。安德里斯想分一杯羹，进入有组织犯罪的大 league。"D我，我研究雷吉们。有些人希望我别多管闲事。"}我有队伍和雷吉铎拉戈站在我这边，他们没有，所以我很高兴我可以研究我想研究的东西。"V我们中的一些人。我没有。我有五只雷吉——我要钱干什么？"J如果我想要实验室设备，我就给海伦娜发一份清单。"M我住在研究站里吃拉面。那是我一生中最美好的日子。"z我只想研究雷吉们，有了它们的力量，没人能对我说不。有趣的是事情就是这样发展的。")你说得好像多么纯洁高尚。"k我很好奇。想要答案。我得到了——有雷吉铎拉戈在我身边，谁能对我说不？"V更不用说裂隙队的全部力量了，因为我的研究非常有利可图。"_我正要说那个，不过话说回来，嘿，说不定哪天能派上用场，对吧？">正如我说的：我们找到了五只较小的雷吉。"_花了我多年时间，但我破译了它们的铭文，理解了它们的真正本质。"J这引导我们找到了雷吉奇卡斯，那时我们进展神速。"G奇卡斯比其他所有雷吉加起来还要强，也更聪明。"_塑造大地，将其恢复成某种原始黏土。创造无法穿透的封印和结界。";而且，是的，它能打出强力的终极冲击。"q它还能...做其他事情。我们找到了一种方法，让它用自己的力量创造无尽的精灵。"D它们充满敌意、力量强大——必须被封锁起来。"t等到叶泽拉踹开我们的门叫我们停手时，她基本上只是在确认我们已经知道的事情。"h我们在玩火。如果我们继续使用雷吉奇卡斯，我们真的有毁灭世界的风险。"h或者至少永久改变它。所以我们把每只雷吉放回它们的陵墓，然后洗白了。"V陵墓当然被加固了——几乎没有什么能穿过较小的雷吉密室。"A雷吉们的密室只能由其余五只雷吉共同开启。"_我不知道。她同意我们的看法：太危险了。我们是罪犯，不是疯子。"M我知道她的处境...一直不太好，但这个？这太疯狂了。"e谁知道呢。我们知道有些团体一直试图夺回它们——他们一直都是这样。"J但成功？不可能。绝无可能。但...显然叶泽拉可以。",...可能。他们可能已经有了。"^不过Gigas的密室在深处，而且如果他们还没打破封印，那就白费了。"\或者他们重新封印了的话。我可以试着去侦察一下，但...不保证。"S我的重点是，如果你不帮忙，你最好习惯白色石头的外观。"Y如果有人让雷吉奇卡斯放开手脚，你会看到多得多的这种景象。";听着，我不知道。很多事情我都不知道。"�所以让我跟安德里斯、我们的护林员、海伦娜，还有其他我能找到的人谈谈。我们会弄清楚情况有多糟。"J如果这些盗贼在地面上露面，你可以跟他们干一架。"q他们至少有一只雷吉，可能更多，所以有很强的破坏冲动。相信我——我最清楚。"M不想这么说，但你只需要继续做你平常的自己，小子。"M或者，不，我不该叫你小子。拿着这个——你赢得的。">以前把这些给裂隙突击队，用于洞穴侦察。"V它能让你到达这个地区的任何地方——现在没人能躲着你了。"8所以去收集徽章，拯救世界吧，英雄。"你是谁？"你为什么这么做？"闭嘴，中二病。"他们是谁？"他们想要什么？"为什么是叶泽拉？"不关我的事。"你想要力量？"你想要钱？"你想要知识？"我为什么要在意？"那为什么叶泽拉..." 多少只雷吉被偷了？" 他们在打开那扇门。"你的重点是什么？;[^"PYezera and the others are gone, I’m afraid. It’s just you… and… me.":We won. No reason for me to be here. Absolutely none."XOther than the immense enjoyment I’m about to extract from dismantling your team."EA friend of Yezera’s. Besides that, I’m masked for a reason."iI would ask who you are, but quite frankly it doesn’t matter. I’m going to find out soon enough."9There’s only so many types of people in the world.":I just told you: because humiliating you will be fun."MUnless you mean extracting Regidrago, in which case, no, I won’t tell."bHumans have this infuriatingly self-destructive need to tell secrets. I’m better than that."3Well, I see the dialogue’s broken down fast."Fine. Suffer."6But I didn’t come here to engage in small talk."iI assure you, it isn’t personal – no one has anything interesting to say. You’re no exception."WBut you are exceptionally skilled, I understand, and that’s correlated with ego."5Allow me to show you what you’re really worth."V…Ah, so be it. I doubt I could drill humility through your thick skull anyways."=You’re good at playing shallow games – good for you."1A Totem calls. I’ve seen more than enough."}They got away. They won. A few that were dressed up like ancient Makyan priests, and whoever the hell THAT was. And Yezera…"UWish I knew. That guy was a narcissist and an asshole, I can tell you that much."#The rest of them… who knows."Could be anything."jBut if they were after Regidrago specifically, and Yezera’s with them… maybe even leading them…"4…I don’t know. It doesn’t make any sense.">She should be the last person to pull this kind of stunt."XIt is. It’s your problem now, and I know you aren’t gonna like that, but it is."5This is bigger than just one legendary Pokémon."4Remember what I said about the big open secret?"oThe caves around Makya are tombs for the Regis. The weird ones I was talking about before. Ones like this."NWell, some archaeological teams went to study them a couple decades back."yAnd then they found the Regis, and the rich mineral veins, and the ruins, and they figured they could leverage that."{We got some corporate backing from Andris and Mavis, and boom: Team Chasm. I was one of those original archaeologists."n…Some of us. Helena wanted to run her own region. Andris wanted a piece of the organized crime bigtime."QMe, I study the Regis. And some people wanted me to leave well enough alone."jI had a Team and Regidrago on my side, and they didn’t, so I got to study what I damn well pleased."LSome of us. I didn’t. I had five Regis – what did I need money for?"8If I wanted lab equipment, I sent a list to Helena."GI lived in a research station and ate ramen. Best days of my life."oI just wanted to study the Regis, and with their power, nobody could tell me no. Funny how that works out.")You make it sound so pure and noble."bI was curious. Wanted answers. I got them – who could tell me no with Regidrago at my side?"YNot to mention the full might of Team Chasm, 'cause my research was VERY profitable."QI’m getting to that, but also, hey, it could come in handy some day, yeah?"5As I was saying: we found the five lesser Regis."\It took me years, but I deciphered their inscriptions and understood their true nature."JThat led us to Regigigas, and at that point we were cooking with gas."RGigas was stronger than the rest of the Regis put together, and smarter, too."|Shape the earth, revert it back to some kind of primordial clay. Create seals and wards that nothing could get through."2And, yeah, it could throw a mean Giga Impact."iIt could do… other things, too. We found a way to make it create ethereal Pokémon with its power.";They were hostile, powerful – had to be locked away."}And then by the time Yezera kicked down our door and told us to stop, she was basically just confirming what we already knew."pWe were playing with fire. If we kept using Regigigas, we ran the very real chance of destroying the world."`Or at least permanently changing it. So we put each Regi back in their tomb and went legit."iThe tombs were reinforced, of course – just about nothing can get through the minor Regi chambers."KGigas’s chamber can only be opened by the other five Regis together."_I don’t know. She agreed with us: it was too dangerous. We were criminals, not lunatics."MI know things… haven’t been great for her, but this? This is insane."[Who knows. We knew some groups were trying to get them back – they always have been."PBut succeeding? There was no way. Impossible. But… apparently Yezera can."*…Probably. They might already have."nGigas’s chamber is deep down, though, and if they haven’t broken the seal yet, it’d be for nothing."QOr if they’ve resealed it. I can try and scout it out, but… no promises."^My POINT is that if you don’t help out, you better get used to the look of white stone."]You’re gonna be seeing a whole lot more of it if someone tells Regigigas to let loose."<Listen, I don’t know. I don’t know a lot of things."sSo let me talk to Andris, our rangers, Helena, whoever else I can find. We’ll figure out how bad things are."PAnd if these thieves show their faces aboveground, you can brawl with them."~They’ve got at least one Regi, probably more, so there’s a strong temptation to wreak havoc. Trust me – I’d know."JHate to say it, but you just need to keep being your usual self, kid."JOr, no, I shouldn’t call you kid. Take this – you’ve earned it."AUsed to give these to Chasm strike teams, for cave scouting."UIt’ll get you just about anywhere in the region – nobody hides from you now."3So go get those badges and save the day, hero."Who are you?"Why are you doing this?"Shut up, edgelord."Who are they?"What do they want?"Why Yezera?"Not my problem."You wanted power?"You wanted money?"You wanted knowledge?"Why should I care?"Then why is Yezera..."How many Regis are stolen?"They're opening that door."Your point?Iu;␀2[[8")Would you like to catch this Phione?""You leave the Phione for now."MYo! Shoulda known I was gonna find you here. Um, yeah, how’s it going?"Good, good, yeah, me too."CSheesh. I get that. Things are kinda... kinda rough now, yeah."@Hey, I mean, can’t hope for much better than that, right?"6Hah! Yeah, yeah, I get that. Same here, honestly."QBut, um, you competing? I mean, obviously, but, yeah, great to see you here."MSorry, I’m rambling. I’m kind of a nervous idiot before a challenge."`I barely scraped past Samorn, honestly, and I’m not super sure how well this is gonna go."%I, uh, I hope I get to face you."VGood. I want to see you at full power, y’know? Take off those training weights."rI thought of it on the way over and was like, oh, wow, I might actually be squaring off against you properly."hHah! You really take this seriously, huh? But, nah, I wouldn’t bet on me either. I know my place."kAww. Don’t want to hurt my feelings? I mean, it’s not like you have any reason to be scared of me."MIf we do face each other, I... yeah, let’s be clear: I’m gonna lose."MBut I’m going to try my best, and if I make it close, I’ll be happy."tSometimes you just gotta say “well, I’m not the best person in the room, but that isn’t gonna stop me.”"TUm. Yeah. So, uh, I don’t know if you noticed, but… this isn’t my Phione."VYeah. So, uh, my Phione laid an egg, and that egg hatched into this li’l thing."HMy Phione’s napping right now, but this rascal is full of energy."^This one’s a bit more feisty. It’s got this, I don’t know, devil-may-care attitude."dMy Phione’s pretty chill. Maybe it’ll mellow with age? This one just hatched, so who knows."7Yeah, no worries. I didn’t really expect you to."This little rascal just hatched from an egg – my Phione’s a bit more chill, a bit more mellow. This one’s a real fighter."iNo, no, mine is napping. This is a newly-hatched Phione, complete with youthful rebellious attitude."$Which, y’know, cool, I guess.".But, uh, yeah. I’ve got a spare Phione."�I don’t know how useful the squirt will be to you, but if you want it, I’d be more than happy to give it to you. I know you’ll care for it."XI hope it helps you out somewhere, sometime. It’s looking for a fight. I know it."SNo? Alright, well, maybe you’ll get a second chance if you change your mind."]Anyways, yeah, tournament is kicking off, so bye for now. Maybe I’ll see you in there."mHope so. And then – oh, yeah, I almost forgot. My Phione’s been wanting to visit the water recently."@I just... I know it. It needs something. Somewhere special."uI’ve heard about some kind of deep spring or river or something around the <imp>base of the Eleig river</imp>."UI’m gonna try and find it after the Championship wraps up. I owe it to Phione."=So... yeah. So long, friend. Hope I’ll see you around."Take the Phione."Don't take the Phione."
