kers."0My older sisters like battlin' a whole lot."wTrainers always come through here. The lady with the Combees sometimes asks as well, so they get a lotta practice."WThey're always so cool when they're battlin'. I wanna be like them when I'm older."No"Yes["\牧场经营并不总是那么容易，但我们只能用现有的工具凑合着用。"P不过有时候你会意识到，你没有最适合这项工作的工具。";我去抓了这只飘浮泡泡来帮我应对天气。"S但当你可以用任何会水属性技能的精灵时，这就没必要了。"�我已经有了那个，所以我正在为这个小家伙寻找一个新家。我会把它给任何能补偿我3000金钱成本的人。"h我知道这个小家伙并不适合每个人。如果你改变主意，这个提议仍然有效。" 你是不是很可爱呀！"*\PN交出了3000金钱作为交换。" 替我好好照顾它们！"n哦，看起来你有点金钱不够。这个提议仍然有效，等你有了更多的钱就回来吧。"b我告诉你，我们整个七年的经营中，今年的庄稼产量将是最高的一年！"8这里的精灵们都是如此努力的工作者。")我的姐姐们都很喜欢战斗。"�这里经常会有训练师经过，有时那个带着蜜蜂精灵的女士也会在这边走，所以她们的实战经验很丰富。"M她们战斗时的样子太酷了，我以后也要成为这样的人。"不"是;["CRanching isn't always easy, but we make do with tools we have."PSometimes though you realize that you don't have the best tool for the job."AI went and caught this Castform to help me with the weather."MBut that's not needed when you can simply use any 'mon with water moves."�I've already got that, so I'm looking to give this little guy a new home. I'll give it to anyone who can reimburse my costs of $3000."dOh I know this little one ain't for everyone. If you change your mind, the offer is still open."Why aren't you a sweetie!"&\PN hands over $3000 in exchange."Take care of them for me!"pOh, it looks like you're a little short. The offer's still here, just come back when ya got some more cash."gI'll tell you what, we're gonna have our highest crop yield in our whole seven years of operation!"*The 'mons here are such hard workers."0My older sisters like battlin' a whole lot."wTrainers always come through here. The lady with the Combees sometimes asks as well, so they get a lotta practice."WThey're always so cool when they're battlin'. I wanna be like them when I'm older."No"Yes0Iu;␀f[["KThe venom I could spit about the Corviknight that abandoned me here..."TThat damnable raven! I've gone dizzy turning here and there through the hedges.":What a battle! A testament to your skill as a slayer."\The gap between our skills is quite large. I'm not sure I'll ever be able to bridge it."NStill, how droll! A little bit of happy chaos to liven up this awful day."AAt this rate, I'll arrive in Sweetrock Harbor by next May...",There truly is no justice in the world."CPerhaps that one Corviknight just has a chip on it's shoulder."fI always give my judgement on their coloration, but none before have mustered any sort of answer."4I must have chosen the sole bad guy among them."GAnd all because I listened to the advice of that man in Novo Town."?A beautifully carved statue of the legendary king Calyrex."3Oh? There's something hanging from the statue!"EBud's the name and hedges are my game! Both plant and financial!"SNow if you'll excuse me, I have some bushes to trim and some stocks to option."7Bud's the name, but battling sure ain't my game..."]I'm the 28th Bud Hill, a long lineage of gardeners that have maintained the Floral Maze."eIt may not look like much, but this is one of the longest maintained structures in all of Makya."XI've been wandering for hours. If I don't find the exit soon, my skin will dry out!",I feel very Croagunk-esque right now..."4I must have some moisturizer on me somewhere..."*A map would have been nice to have...["M我无法抑制心中对那个将我扔在这里的钢铠鸦的怨恨..."S那只可恶的乌鸦，害我在这里面转来转去，头都要转晕了。"D好一场战斗！这证明了你作为杀手的高超技艺。"M我们所掌握的技巧差距很大，我不确定什么能够弥补。"k不过，这还是挺有趣的！一点混乱中的快乐，让这糟糕的一天变得生动多了。"A照这个速度，等明年五月我就能回蜜岩港了...")世界上果真没有公平可言。"2也许只是那个钢铠鸦有什么不满。"z我经常通过它们的肤色来判断，它们到底哪个更靠谱一些，但是并没有一个准确的答案。">或许我只是恰巧选到了那唯一一个坏家伙。"5就因为我轻信了那个望新镇的家伙。"&一尊精美的蕾冠王雕像。"&雕像上挂的是什么东西！"\我的名字是小蕾，树丛与篱笆就是我的游戏，既是植物也是财务！"V恕我失陪了，我还有些树枝需要修剪，还有些股票需要购买。"D我的名字是小蕾，但我的战力可不像一个花蕾..."I我是第28任“峰之花蕾”，是守护鲜花迷宫的园丁！"e虽然看起来不怎么起眼，但这里是整个马凯亚存留时间最久的人类造物。"e我已经转了好几个小时了，如果不能尽快找到出口，我的皮肤会枯萎的！",我感觉自身要变成不良蛙了..."#身上还有一点保湿露..." 如果有地图就好了...;["KThe venom I could spit about the Corviknight that abandoned me here..."TThat damnable raven! I've gone dizzy turning here and there through the hedges.":What a battle! A testament to your skill as a slayer.