s in damage if the user has no item when the move starts."[The user confounds the foe with speed, then slashes. Can't miss and skips protections."bThe user attacks with air that slices even the sky. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."fThe user heats up its beak before attacking. If hit by a foe's physical move, burns the attacker."VThe user attacks foes with savagely cold winds. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."aThe user tucks in its wings and strikes from a low altitude. The user also takes 33% recoil."cThe user attacks using a sound wave based on words it has learned. It also dizzies the target."yThe user whips up a wind to blow away protective screens on the opponent's side. Also removes hazards on both sides."ZA corkscrewing attack with the sharp beak acting as a drill. Can random critical hit."PThe user slams the target with its wings. The target is hit twice in a row."eThe user covers the target's body with a mass of down that lowers its Attack stat by five steps."SThe user soars, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes on the second turn.";The user whips up a gust of wind to attack the target."\The user absorbs its target's HP. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."WThe target is jabbed with a sharply pointed beak or horn. Can random critical hit."hThe user pecks the target. If the target is holding a Berry, the user eats it and gains its effect."WThe user heals itself by half of its max HP. The user loses Flying-type this turn."eThe user whips up a turbulent whirlwind that ups the Speed of all party Pokémon for four turns."ZThe foe is attacked with a spray of harsh acid. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."nThe user spits fluid that works to melt the target. This reduces the target's Sp. Def stat by four steps."uThe user lets out a damaging belch at the target. Deals double damage if the user has eaten a berry this battle."bThe user attacks with a cloud of white smoke. This resets the target's positive stat changes."dThe user coils up and concentrates. This raises its Attack, Defense, and Accuracy by two steps."GA slashing attack with a poisonous blade. Can random critical hit."<The user shoots filthy garbage at the target to attack."LThe user bites the target with toxic fangs with a 50% chance to poison."NA cloud of poison gas is sprayed in the face of the target, poisoning it."dThe target is stabbed with a tentacle or arm seeped with poison. It has a 10% chance to poison."YThe user stabs the target with a poisonous stinger. This has a 30% chance to poison."EThe user hits the target with its tail. Can random critical hit."rThe user heals the target's non-volatile status condition. If so, it also heals itself by half of its max HP."lInflicts physical or special damage, whichever will be more effective. This has a 30% chance to poison."NUnsanitary sludge is hurled at the target. It has a 30% chance to poison."JIt swamps the area around the user with a giant wave of toxic sludge."\The target is attacked with an emission of filthy gases. It has a 30% chance to poison."mThe user shoots poisonous threads to poison the target and lowers the target's Speed stat by four steps."WNearby poisoned foes have their Attack, Sp. Atk, and Speed lowered by three steps."jThe user drenches the foe in a special poisonous liquid. Its power doubles if the target is poisoned."aThe user throws the bone it holds. The bone loops to hit the target twice, coming and going."fThe user strikes everything around it by stomping on the ground. It reduces hit Pokémon's Speed."UThe user burrows, charging and becoming hidden, then attacks on the second turn."dThe user crashes into its target while rotating its body like a drill. Can random critical hit."dThe user makes the ground under the foe erupt with power. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."[The user sets off an earthquake that strikes every Pokémon around it and underground."zGravity is intensified for five turns, grounding all Pokémon, doubling their weight, and doubling all move Accuracy."oThe user attacks by shooting a beam of mud at the target. It also reduces the target's Speed by two steps."`The user attacks its foes by manifesting the power of the land in fearsome blades of stone."]The user wraps foes in fierce winds and searingly hot sand. It has a 30% chance to burn."PThrows scorching sand at the target to attack. It has a 10% chance to burn."FThe user heals itself by half of its max HP, or 66% in sandstorm."zThe user lays a hazard layer of Spikes on the foe's side. Foes that switch into battle are hurt a bit for each layer."UThe user attacks driven by frustration. Power increases if previous move failed."eThis move also hits Pokémon that are in the air. Those Pokémon are knocked down to the ground."ZThe user attacks with a wave that crawls along the ground. Those it hits are trapped."QThe user smashes into the target at high speed. This move always goes first."WThe user attacks with a prehistoric power. It has a 20% chance to raise all stats."[The user whips up a storm of diamonds to damage foes, raising its Defense and Sp. Def."oCharges with space power and boosts its Sp. Atk by two steps on one turn, then attacks on the second turn."XThe user attacks with a ray of light that sparkles as if it were made of gemstones."hThe user shoots powerful lasers using the power of a prism. The user is exhausted on the next turn."lThe user hurls hard rocks at the target. The target is multi-hit two to five times in quick succession."PThe user polishes its body to reduce drag, raising its Speed by four steps."GThe user picks up and throws a small rock at the target to attack."WBoulders are hurled at the target. It also lowers the target's Speed by two steps."fThe user launches a huge boulder at the target to attack. The user is exhausted on the next turn."WSummons sandstorm for six turns. Damages non-Rock, non-Ground Pokémon every turn."\The user lays a levitating hazard around the foe. It deals Rock-typed 1/10th HP damage."fThe user swings its stone axes. This leaves a levitating stone hazard floating around the target."=The user stabs the foe with sharpened stones from below."bPours sticky tar over the target, lowering its Speed by six steps and making it weak to Fire."lThe user and its allies are protected from spread moves for a turn. Always fails if used in succession."hThe user bites the target. If the target is holding a Berry, the user eats it and gains its effect."eThe user vibrates its wings to make a damaging sound wave. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."qThe user calls its underlings to shield it, raising its Defense and Sp. Def by two steps. Always goes first."bWhen the user knocks out a target with this move, the user's Attack stat rises by five steps."UOnly works on the first turn the user is in battle. This move always goes first."^The user calls out its underlings to heal it. The user heals itself by 60% of its max HP."XThe user summons bugs to swarm the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."^The user drains the target's blood. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt."fThe user makes a lunge at the target, attacking with full force. This lowers the target's Attack."VUsing its tough and impressive horn, the user rams into the target with no letup."_Sharp spikes are shot at the target in rapid succession. They multi-hit two to five times."PFires an exploding pollen puff at enemies, or a HP-restoring one at allies."SThe user raises their Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps, and Speed by one step."IThe user attacks with a beam of light. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."cThe foe is attacked with powdery scales blown by wind. It has a 20% chance to raise all stats."eThe user rolls over its foes, crushing them. It has a 30% chance to reduce the target's Defense."tWeaves a sticky net around the opposing team, a hazard which lowers their Speed by two steps upon switching in."xAll nearby foes are bound with silk blown from the user's mouth. This silk lowers the targets' Speed by four steps."eWhile resisting, the user attacks all nearby foes. The targets' Sp. Atk is lowered by two steps."bThe user stares at flashing lights to focus its mind, raising its Sp. Atk stat by five steps."eAfter making its attack, the user rushes back to switch places with a party Pokémon in waiting."[The user slashes at the foe by crossing its scythes or claws. Can random critical hit."fThe user attacks the target while shouting in a startling fashion. It has a 40% chance to flinch."YThe user attacks by sending a frightful amount of small ghosts at opposing Pokémon."IThe target is exposed to a sinister ray, causing it to become dizzy."bWhen this move is used, if the user faints, the foe that landed the knockout hit also faints."TFor five turns, this move prevents the target from using the move it last used."{The user hexes the target with evil magic. This deals double damage if the target has a non-volatile status condition."ZThe target is licked with a long tongue, causing damage. It has a 30% chance to numb."dThe user emits a sinister ray. This move can be used on the target regardless of its Abilities."fThe user blasts the target with a gust of repulsive wind. It has a 20% chance to raise all stats."bThe user adds its HP to the target's HP, then equally shares the combined HP with the target."_Any Pokémon that hears this song faints in three turns, unless it switches out of battle."\The user frightens the target with a scary face to reduce its Speed stat by four steps."WThe user hurls a shadowy blob at the target. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."iThe user beats the target with a bone containing a spirit. This lowers their Defense by three steps."SThe user slashes with a sharp claw made from shadows. Can random critical hit."|The user disappears, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes on the second turn. It hits even if the foe protects itself."BThe user throws a punch from the shadows. Lands without fail."aThe user extends its shadow and attacks the target from behind. This move always goes first."`The user moves into the target's shadow, steals the target's stat boosts, and then attacks."XThe user attacks while also stitching the target's shadow to the ground to trap it."\The user takes the target trick-or-treating. This adds Ghost type to the target's type."TThe user shoots a sinister, bluish-white flame at the target to inflict a burn."^The user sheds part of its body to make itself lighter and raise its Speed by four steps."BThe user becomes a gigantic shield and slams into the target.";The user becomes a gigantic sword and cuts the target."dThe user strikes the target with tough punches as fast as bullets. This move always goes first."jThe user foretells doom. Two turns later, the targeted spot is hit with a concentrated beam of light."{The user rotates, centering the hex nut in its chest, and then strikes twice. Each hit has a 30% chance to cause flinching."iThe user gathers all its light energy and releases it at once. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."LThe user attacks by grinding two of its steel gears against the target."eThe user tackles the target with a high-speed spin. The slower the user, the greater the damage."mThe user slams into the opposing side with its heavy body. The heavier the user, the greater the damage."[The user hardens its body's surface like iron, raising its Defense stat by four steps."fThe foe slams the target with its steel-hard head. It has a 40% chance to make the target flinch."kProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Attack of physical attackers by two steps."hThe user focuses intensely. For the next three turns, its attacks will be guaranteed critical hits."VA retaliation move that counters any attack, inflicting 150% of the damage taken."OThe target is raked with steel claws. It has a 20% chance to raise Attack."ZA horrible sound like scraping metal reduces the target's Sp. Def stat by four steps."bThe target is hit with a hard punch 