get's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. Then, the user switches out."MIf the user moves after the target, this attack's power will be doubled."NThe user attacks with a pillar of dark light. This ignores their ability.">Inflicts double damage on a target that is switching out."?The user suppresses the target and makes its move go last."dThe user yells as if it is ranting about something, lowering the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."gThis turn, the user steals the effects of healing, buffing, or protective screen moves a foe uses."kThis move enables the user to attack first. It fails if the target is not readying an attack, however."OThe user trades held items with the target faster than the eye can follow."eThe target is taunted into a rage that prevents it from using status moves for three more turns."pThe user attacks and steals the foe's held item simultaneously. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."aThe user attacks the target's throat. The target cannot use sound-based moves for two turns."kAll stat step changes affecting the target turn topsy-turvy and become the opposite of what they were."fThe user torments and enrages the foe, making it incapable of using the same move twice in a row."^The user strikes with a fierce blow of Dark Mastery. It always results in a critical hit."mThe user raises the Defense and Sp. Def stats of an ally Pokémon by two steps using a mysterious aroma."vThe user stares with its baby-doll eyes, which lowers the target's Attack stat by three steps. Always goes first."[The user gazes charmingly at the target. The target's Attack is lowered by four steps."WThe user protects itself and its allies from status moves with a mysterious power."TThe user emits a powerful damaging flash. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Atk."TThe user does emotional damage to the target. Can't miss and skips protections."gThe user steals the target's HP with a kiss. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."CThe user stirs up a fairy wind and strikes the target with it."TThe user unleashes a strong beam. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."\The user charges with energy and raises all of its stats by two steps on the next turn."bFires a powerful beam of light drawn from the Eternal Flower. The user also takes 50% recoil."_The user attacks by borrowing the power of the moon. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Atk."XThe user hits the target with the force of nature. It cuts the target's HP to half."^The user plays rough with the target and attacks it. It has a 20% chance to lower Attack."XAttacks the target and breaks its spirit. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."dThe user attacks foes with love and hate. It has a 30% chance to lower both Attack and Sp. Atk."WThe user kisses the target with a sweet, angelic cuteness that dizzies the target."6The user attacks the target by dancing very hard."XAn attack empowered by the might of a lazy king. It skips and destroys protections."RThe user steadies its eyes, mind, and body in order to maximize its Accuracy."_The user exposes its teeth in a menacing way, reducing the target's Defense by four steps."wThe user and the target both fall asleep, fully restoring their HP and healing any non-volatile status conditions."_The user dances and shows off their many lights at the target, dizzying and damaging them."The user engages the target in a head-to-head fight. The damage is based on the target's Attack rather than their Defense."^The user concentrates to stabilize its mood. It raises the user's Sp. Def by three steps."HThe user attacks with the full force of The Market. Scatters coins."jThe user thrashes while infused with elements. It has a 15% chance each to poison, waterlog or leech."\The user stimulates its brain by planning. It raises the user's Sp. Atk by three steps."sThe user chooses between the three most recent moves used by the opposing team, and uses that move themselves."WThe user curls up to conceal weak spots and raise both of its Defense and Sp. Def."TThe user dazzles nearby foes with light. Their Sp. Atk is lowered by two steps."=The user shoots a pulse of diffuse energy at the target."rThe user calls its team to a farm-fresh meal, sacrificing 25% HP to heal each of its party members by 25% HP."oThis attack inflicts double damage on a waterlogged foe. It also cures the target's waterlogging, however."oThe user chooses between Searing Crunch, Glacial Crunch, Aquatic Crunch, and Volt Crunch to use this turn."`The user chooses between Fire Fang, Ice Fang, Hydro Fang, or Thunder Fang to use this turn."{The user performs a spirited dance for its allies and itself, raising their Speed and raising their Accuracy by four steps."�The user foretells your choice of Fire, Electric, or Ice-type. One turn later, the targeted spot explodes with energy of that type."fChanneling fear, the user bites the target. Deals double damage if the user is below half health."VThe user channels ancient energy to grant a nearby ally an extra turn this round."XDeals more damage the less HP the user has. After attacking, the user switches out."mThe user's eyes glow with divine judgement, numbing the target and reducing both its Attack and Sp. Atk."OThe user focuses its aim to raise its Sp. Atk and Accuracy by three steps."CThe user slashes broadly, cleanly slicing all nearby battlers."_The user cleans the target aggressively with soapy water. It has a 50% chance to waterlog."XThe user spins the target with a cleansing vortex. It has a 30% chance to waterlog."iThe user lounges around with decadent laziness, restoring its HP by 66%. This move always goes last."oA lullaby is sung in a calming voice that puts the target with half its HP or less left into a deep sleep."hThe target is struck by a pulse of negative energy. This resets the target's positive stat changes."`The target is cut by a piercing slash. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."@The user shoots a pulse of neutral particles at the target."The user suddenly falls asleep for one turn, making enemies drop their guard, lowering their Defense and Sp. Def by four steps."aThe user pranks the target, surprising it and reducing its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."kThe user expresses a mystical potential. Changes type to match the user's Gem, Plate, or Crystal Veil."WThe user pulverizes the target with both its fists. This raises the user's Attack."oThe user warms up by treating the target as a punching bag, damaging them and raising Attack by two steps."{The user adorns itself or the target with precious stones, changing it to your choice of Fairy, Dragon, or Steel-type."\The user performs a long-forgotten song and dance. This is both a Sound and Dance move."LThe user switches out to a party Pokémon in waiting. Always goes last."eThe user attacks the target with stored power. Has 10 more base power for each raised stat step."rThe user brings down a ruinous power on the target. This has a 20% chance of lowering all the target's stats."{A blessed wall of light protects the user's side from critical hits for five turns, and slightly reduces move damage taken."dThe user strikes while inviting the power of seasons. The user changes form to the next season."KThe user shouts with force at the target. This move always hits first."FThe user charges, then puts the target to sleep on the next turn."\The user smirks with confidence. The Sp. Def of nearby enemies is lowered by two steps."|A barrage of star-shaped rays are shot at the target, to multi-hit two to five times. Can't miss and skips protections."TThe user emits a deep, rumbling snore. This move can only be used while asleep."fThe user attacks and steals items from all near foes. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."lThe user flings the dirty oil on its fur. It transfers any non-volatile status condition to the target."gThe user strikes the target, then slinks into the water. The user takes 33% less damage this turn."rThe user causes the air around the target to explode. The move's type is changed based on the active weather."�The user throws away up to 1000 scattered coins to bless its side, blocking random added effects and healing for 1/16th HP each turn. Lasts one turn per 100 coins."[Alters the reality of the area to damage a foe. Puzzle Room is created for five turns."bThe user conjures up the past, transforming the target into their previous evolutionary form."aThe user forms their excitement into a lash with a 20% chance of raising the user's Sp. Atk."{Enables random critical hits for the user, doubles its critical hit chance, and raises its Attack and Defense by two steps."cThe user contorts the target's chi with an energy pulse, damaging it and lowering its Sp. Def."dAura deep within the user's body is spurred to pulse outward. Can't miss and skips protections."{This Pokémon charges up for a turn, then releases a powerful beam of aura. This does more damage the less HP the user has."cThe target is barred by rules which prevent it from using off-type moves for three more turns."QThe user hugs the target intensely, trapping and binding it for three turns."OThe user improvises a dance, raising its two weakest stats by three steps."kThe user flexes its rocky skin, raising its Attack and Defense by two steps and gaining the Rock-type."gThe user and its allies take 50% less attack damage this turn. Always fails if used in succession."dCombining dance and martial art, the user strikes the target and raises its Speed by two steps."HPins the target with building materials. The target becomes barred."PThe user fires a small shockwave. This has a 30% chance to numb the target."vEnables random critical hits for the user, quadruples its critical hit chance, and raises its Speed by two steps."uThe user attacks freed from earthly attachments. Doubles in damage if the user has no item when the move starts."LThe user drops onto the target with a kick, dealing 25% recoil to self."lThe user endures attacks with 1 HP. If so, raises its Attack by two steps. Fails if used in succession."[The user raises all of their stats by two steps. Fails unless a foe fainted last turn."HThe user strikes the target with a basic frontal kicking technique."TThe user strikes the target's pressure points with precise punches, numbing it."hA kick that can also eliminate trapping and hazards afflicting your side. Also raises user's Speed."aThe user grabs the target, slamming both of them into the ground. The user takes 20% recoil."\The user attacks with a burst of inner energy. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."`The user mimics Kung Fu techniques while sleeping. This move can only be used while asleep."PThe user attacks with a strong punch. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."fThe user holds fast with its teammates, raise its Defense by three steps, and its allies' by one."_The user shoots three arrows made of Aura with extreme precision. Can random critical hit."sAn attack that hits first and makes the target flinch. It fails if the target is not readying a priority move."dThe user manifests a bolt of pure courage. This has a 20% chance of raising the user's Sp. Atk."sThe user relentlessly rampages with its whip-like hands for two turns. Each hit will always be a critical hit."wThe user kicks while rotating at high speed, dashing across the battlefield to deal damage to all nearby battlers."LA reckless rushing attack from the air. The user also takes 25% recoil."�The user compresses air around the target to impossible density. If the move is super- or hyper-effective, damage is increased by 30%."mThe user takes an aerial look at the field. This raises its Sp. Atk, Defense, and Accuracy by two steps."bThe user fires a stormy gust at the target. This also raises the user's Sp. Atk by two steps."`The user whips up a cold north wind to attack the target. It has a 20% chance to frostbite."nAn apple falls from high up to strike the foe. Always goes first. Deals double damage in intense Gravity."XThe user propels a gale-force wind at the target. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."tThe opponent is shredded by talons. This attack always results in a critical hit, but applies jinx to the user."YThe user sends a chilly wind towards the target. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."~A high pitched screech lowers all nearby foes' Defense, Sp. Def, and Evasion by three steps. Can't miss and skips protections."[The target is jabbed repeatedly with a horn or beak that multi-hits two to five times."UThe user hops high up to land on the target's head. It has a 10% chance to numb."fThe user chases the target and strikes it from above. It does more damage the faster the user is."cThe user whips up a lingering tailwind that ups the Speed of all party Pokémon for six turns."eThe user takes off at sonic speeds, raising its Speed by four steps and gaining the Flying type."_The user launches a pulse in the form of a shock wave. It has a 20% chance to raise Speed."tThe user falls from up high, crushing the target beneath. This move does 30% more damage if the user is asleep."]The user quickly jumps high up, then falls onto the target. It has a 10% chance to numb."uThe user quickly increases the air pressure to damage the target. This attack always goes before any other move."�Clears hazards on the opponent's side of the field, moves hazards on the user's side to the opponent's, then forces the targets to switch."QAttacks while clearing weather. This move fails in the absence of a weather."}The user swoops into battle with a piercing shriek, flinching the target. It only works the first turn the user is in battle."[The user assists an ally by boosting the power and Accuracy of its next attack by 50%."^The user strikes the target with a dart of air. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."BThe user attacks the target while dashing skillfully past it."7Chaotic winds push the target around, dizzying it."gThe user shoots out a pulse of driving energy. Building up more power, it raises the user's Speed."QHits once for each party Pokémon. Deals more damage based on their Sp. Atk."KWind rapidly spins the target in place to multi-hit two to five times."UThe target is struck with large, imposing wings. The user also takes 20% recoil."RThe user lobs harsh acid at the target. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."`The user and target bathe in acid. This lowers the user's Defense and Sp. Def by two steps."tThe user lashes the target with its corroded tail. This hits Steel-types for neutral damage and lowers Defense."WThe user infects the target with a touch and also destroys any Herbs it's holding."JThe user strikes with an acidic punch that destroys Gems and Berries."JThe user partially dissolves, raising its Sp. Def stat by five steps."fThe user steals blood. If the target is knocked out, raises the user's Attack stat by five steps."aA Grey Mist covers the battlefield. For five turns, stats are reset at the end of each turn."FThe user attacks while slathered in grime. This poisons the user."dThe user uses venom that turns the target's body against it. Super effective vs Fighting-types."PThe user envelops the target in a foul wind. It has a 30% chance to poison."ZThe user stabs the opponent with a toxin-infused limb. It has a 10% chance to poison."XThe user shoots the target with a dart made of poison. This move always goes first."{The user lays a hazard layer of poison spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers poisons."NThe user attacks with sticky slime, rendering the target's item unusable."\Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get poisoned."[The user gives off a terrible stench towards the target. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."fThe foe is forced to switch out by a stinky cloud, then the user also switches. Always goes last."_The user chomps with venomous teeth. The user's HP is restored by 33% of the damage dealt."EThe target is given a Black Sludge, replacing their item if any."]Halves attack 