, trapping and binding it for three turns."LProtects the user from attacks. Special attackers take 1/8th HP damage."YThe user attacks the target with a sword. If the target faints, scatters many coins."�The user creates a high quality area for eight turns in which super-effective deals 25% more, and not very effective deals 25% less."aThe user creates an explosion from powdered metal, inflicting damage to all nearby battlers."4The user strikes with a full-force hammer blow."bThe user shoots a massive metal object at the target. The user is exhausted on the next turn."UThe user economizes half of its weight, healing itself based on the weight lost."WThe user launches a fist with extreme force. This attack is popular with children."|The user lines up shards before attacking. If hit by a foe's special move, lays a hazard layer of Spikes at their feet."jThe user crushes the target in its metallic vises, breaking any screens protecting the target's side."dThe user looses a flash of energy from its polished body. It has a 30% chance to lower Sp. Def."kProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Sp. Atk of special attackers by two steps."/The user hurls a metal ball at the target."^The user shoots shards of its own body at the target. The user loses 1/8th of its max HP."jThe user shreds off bits of its own body to launch at the target. The user loses 1/8th of its max HP."OThe user sprays mining waste at the target. It has a 30% chance to poison."\The user slashes at the target with a steel blade. Super effective versus Dragon-types."aThe user heals itself by half of their max HP. This extends the current weather by one turn."WThe user enters a protective stance, raising its Sp. Atk and Defense by two steps."ZThe user prepares its dual cannons. Until switch out, each special attack hits twice."[The user drags the target into the water with a heavy anchor. They become waterlogged."fWelds heavy steel onto the target, giving it the Steel type and reducing its 