The user burns the target, then welcomes in sunshine for eight turns."TThe user warms up its body and attacks the target. It has a 10% chance to burn."wThe user launches up high, charging and becoming hidden, then explodes down on the second turn, taking 25% recoil."pThe user roars with the force of a volcano, raising the Attack of itself by three steps and allies' by one."kThe user attacks with fire that can be seen in multiple places, then summons sunshine for eight turns."{A lance of fire pierces the target from above, lowering their Sp. Atk. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."dThe user explodes itself into the target. The target is harmed, but also their Speed is raised."[Halves attack damage taken this turn. Burns any attackers. Fails if used successively."yThe user chomps down with burning fangs. It has a 20% chance to burn and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."nThe user attacks with heat, creating an obscuring wall of haze. The user takes 33% less damage this turn."QCloaked in flames, the user dances wildly, raising its Sp. Atk by two steps."�The user sends up to two barrages of fire, each hitting two to five times. If two barrages were sent, the user is exhausted on the next turn."ZSummons sunshine for six turns, boosting Fire-type attacks and hindering most others."vThe user launches volcanic debris, dealing damage and setting a hazard layer of burning spikes around the target."aThe user surrounds the target with fire which also destroys any clothing items it's holding."gA distinguished attack that motivates nearby allies to follow, letting them act immediately after."cThe user launches a concentrated ball of searing, bright white flame. Can random critical hit."}The user creates a storm using its flaming body, damaging everything around it and melting away hazards from both sides."oThe user rapidly changes water pressure, creating a pulsing shockwave. The user loses 1/8th of its max HP."vThe user bites with watery fangs. It has a 20% chance to waterlog and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."jCharges by summoning rainstorm for five turns, then overwhelms the foe with water on the second turn."oThe user shoots purified water, also healing the non-volatile status conditions of all the party Pokémon."SThe user jumps out of the water to attack. Has a 20% chance to reduce Defense."cThe user creates numerous bubbles to explode against the target. Multi-hits two to five times."�The user creates a bubble to shield their ally. The next time they're hit, 50% of the move damage is instead dealt back as recoil."dA blast of bubbles is shot at the target. It has a 20% chance to lower the target's Speed stat."A water vacuum is induced and rapidly collapsed, generating an intense pulsing water blast. The user loses 1/8th of its max HP."fThe user pulls the target under the waves with crushing force. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."TThe user douses the target, healing itself by 33% of its max HP in the process."aThe user spews alkaline bubbles that melt the target, lowering their Defense by three steps."_Halves attack damage taken this turn. Waterlogs any attackers. Fails if used successively."\The user struggles in the water, splashing it onto the target. They become waterlogged."dThe user gains an instinctual knowledge of battle, raising its Attack and Sp. Def by two steps."UThe user crashes into the target with its quills. It leaves the target poisoned."oThe user propels a geyser of water at the target. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."ZThe user dives down with its beak wide open. Transforms into Gulping or Gorging form."UThe user crashes into the target like a tsunami. The user also takes 33% recoil."HThe target is immersed in water. This has a 30% chance to waterlog."OThe user waterlogs the target, then welcomes in rainstorm for eight turns."wThe user opens a spring to blast the target, also forming an Aqua Ring around themselves, healing 10% HP per turn."qAttack