 with blades formed by psychic power. Can random critical hit."oUsing its psychic power of suggestion, the user transfers its non-volatile status condition to the target."PThe user hypnotizes itself into copying any stat change made by the target."pCloaking itself in psychic energy, the user slams into the target, raising the user's Defense by two steps."`A wondrous wall of light is put up to suppress damage from physical attacks for five turns."bThe user goes to sleep to fully restore their HP and heal any non-volatile status conditions."QThe user mimics the target completely, copying the target's natural Ability."NThe user employs its psychic power to exchange Abilities with the target."sThe user focuses its willpower to its head and attacks the foe. It has a 40% chance to make the target flinch."XThe target is hit with a rainbow-colored beam. It has a 30% chance to lower Attack."qThe user puts up a rainbow-colored veil to reduce move damage for five turns. This can only be used in hail."\A blizzard strikes all near foes. Can't miss in hail. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."^The user blows a cold breath on the target. This attack always results in a critical hit."VThe user attacks by hurling a blizzard-cloaked icicle lance at opposing Pokémon."MSummons hail for six turns. Damages non-Ice, non-Ghost-types every turn."\The target is struck with an icy-cold beam of energy. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."}The user bites with cold-infused fangs. It has a 20% chance to frostbite and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."eThe user swings and hits with its strong, heavy fist. This lowers the user's Speed by two steps."NThe target is punched with an icy fist. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."dThe user flash freezes chunks of ice and hurls them at the target. This move always goes first."TThe user launches sharp icicles at the target. It multi-hits two to five times."fThe user attacks with a gust of chilled air. It also lowers the targets' Speed stat by two steps