ing random added effects and healing for 1/16th HP each turn. Lasts one turn per 100 coins."[Alters the reality of the area to damage a foe. Puzzle Room is created for five turns."bThe user conjures up the past, transforming the target into their previous evolutionary form."aThe user forms their excitement into a lash with a 20% chance of raising the user's Sp. Atk."{Enables random critical hits for the user, doubles its critical hit chance, and raises its Attack and Defense by two steps."cThe user contorts the target's chi with an energy pulse, damaging it and lowering its Sp. Def."dAura deep within the user's body is spurred to pulse outward. Can't miss and skips protections."{This Pokémon charges up for a turn, then releases a powerful beam of aura. This does more damage the less HP the user has."cThe target is barred by rules which prevent it from using off-type moves for three more turns."QThe user hugs the target intensely, trapping and binding it for three turns."OThe user improvises a dance, raising its two weakest stats by three steps."kThe user flexes its rocky skin, raising its Attack and Defense by two steps and gaining the Rock-type."gThe user and its allies take 50% less attack damage this turn. Always fails if used in succession."dCombining dance and martial art, the user strikes the target and raises its Speed by two steps."HPins the target with building materials. The target becomes barred."PThe user fires a small shockwave. This has a 30% chance to numb the target."vEnables random critical hits for the user, quadruples its critical hit chance, and raises its Speed by two steps."uThe user attacks freed from earthly attachments. Doubles in damage if the user has no item when the move starts."LThe user drops onto the target with a kick, dealing 25% recoil to self."lThe user endures attacks with 1 HP. If so, raises its Attack by two steps. Fails if used in succession."[The user raises all of their stats by two steps. Fails unless a foe fainted last t