 target is put to sleep via a deep freeze. The user is exhausted on the next turn."qThe user covers the field with an fog of ice crystals, summoning hail and creating Grey Mist for five turns."pThe user summons a wind that drains vitality from all nearby foes. This has a 20% chance to frostbite them."_Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get frostbitten."XThe user jabs the target with a sharp icicle. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."PThe target is overwhelmed by cold energy. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."~The user lays a hazard layer of frozen spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers frostbites."The user chomps down with icy cold fangs. It has a 20% chance to frostbite and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."KRams the target with frigid force. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."hThe user attacks the target with a frontal cold wind. It reduces the target's Speed by three steps."VThe user absorbs the target's heat, frostbiting it and adding the Ice-type to it."aThe user freezes the target in place, dealing damage and minimizing their Speed and Evasion."AFor the rest of the round, the target's healing is reversed."lThe user picks up an iceberg and slams it into the target. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."]The user slashes the target with ice like a sword. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."`Halves attack damage taken this turn. Frostbites any attackers. Fails if used successively."aThe user targets the target's coldest spots. Its power doubles if the target is frostbitten."WThe user pins the target down with icy spikes, applying frostbite and trapping it."\Injects supercold liquid into the target, damaging them and halving all future healing."WThe user inures themselves to a harsh environment, shedding their type weaknesses."KThe user frostbites the target, then welcomes in hail for eight turns."aThe user foretells imminent winter. Two turns later, extreme cold attacks the targeted spot."bThe user throws an exploding package at enemies, or one filled with healing treats at allies."~The user sheds excess covering. This raises the user's Sp. Atk and Speed by three steps, but lowers Sp. Def by two steps."RThe user raises their Attack and Defense by two steps, and Speed by one step."gThe user flips, flaps, fumbles, then flounders. It becomes more powerful the less HP the user has.":The user rolls into the target while covered in snow."rThe user makes the target to trip into a huge pile of snow, damaging them and summoning hail for eight turns."pThe user incants a snowy hex, dealing damage and setting a hazard layer of frozen spikes around the target.">To inflict massive damage, the user uses up its Ice-type."MThe user saps all the target's heat with a frigid touch, frostbiting it."XDrains the heat from the target. The user's HP is restored by 50% the damage dealt."[Invokes the aspects of many dragons, striking with a physical move and a special move."PThe user attacks fueled by ire. Deals double damage if it's a critical hit."]The user slashes the foe while menacing. During eclipse, the target also becomes burned."nThe user rips and tears its way across the battlefield, damaging all near Pokémon and taking 50% recoil."gThe user bites to drain the target's energy. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt."GThe user harnesses inner battle instincts to strike at the target."~The user crushes the target with evil intent. This deals double damage if the target has a non-volatile status condition."fExhales magical fumes with a 30% chance to burn or frostbite the target depending on their stats."WSends hindering waves of energy forward, lowering hit foes' Evasion by four steps."`Doubles target ally's Attack and Speed. However, if the user faints, so too does that ally."^The user inspires a sudden dread in the target, damaging it. This move always goes first."xThe user launches four Dreepies, which spread out equally to hit near foes. But, they avoid targets they can't hit."GThe user spits venom at the target. It has a 30% chance to poison."]The user shakes the target with a deep, rumbling roar. This attack does physical damage."rProtects the user from attacks. If an eclipse is active, extends it by one turn. Fails if used in succession."~The target is harmed by a malevolent sound. This has a 20% chance to reduce the higher of the target's Attack or Sp. Atk."�The user flies high up into the air at supersonic speed, charging and becoming hidden. It greatly increases in power the faster the user is."aThe user looms over the target with awful menace, lowering their highest stat by four steps."VAttacks all foes with dormant draconic energy. Power increases by 50% in eclipse."�The user sprays the target with a shrinking liquid. For the next three turns, the target's highest stat will be reduced by two steps."`The user makes an offering, then multi-hits two to five times. Scatters coins for each hit."`The user whips up a tornado to tear at the target. It has a 40% chance to make them flinch."-The user attacks with a flurry of claws."bThe user lets out a thunderous noise while sleeping. This move can only be used while asleep."eThe user charges up insane amounts of energy the first turn, then transforms on the second turn."rThe user strikes with a simultaneous three-beam attack. It has a 20% chance each to numb, burn, or frostbite."pThe user throws a royal fit to rampage for two turns. Raises Speed if a target is knocked out by this move."xThe Pokémon blots out the sky, summoning eclipse for eight turns and lowering each opponent's Attack by two steps."pThe user roots itself, then strikes at the target with serpentine strength. This has a 30% chance to leech."eDarkness rolls over the field, damaging all other Pokémon and setting Grey Mist for five turns."�The user insults the target using a compliment. Their Attack and Sp. Atk are raised by three steps, but they hurt themselves in confusion."UThe user maximizes its Sp. Atk stat in exchange for HP equal to half its max HP."sBites a hole in reality, creating a black hole to damage all near foes. Gravity is intensified for five turns."`The user removes the energy and light around the target. Super effective vs Electric-types."ZThis attack deals 50% more damage if the target has any raised or lowered stat steps."{The user sacrifices their ally to cover all near foes in total darkness, making them drowsy. Fails if the user has no ally."UDeftly sets a hazard layer of damaging Spikes around the foe, then switches out."ZIf the target is the last able member of their party, this attack's power is doubled."qThe user tries to pick off a weak target. After damage, if the target is below 25% HP, they instantly faint."oThe user burrows into the target's subconscious with emotional manipulation. It has a 10% chance to leech."`The user disarms the target's blade. The target cannot use slice-based moves for two turns."GThe target is forced underwater for a brief time, waterlogging it."XThe user pushes the target violently into water. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."cWhen the user knocks out a target with this move, the user's Sp. Atk stat rises by five steps."nThe user indulges its love of battle by striking a foe. Both of the user's Attack and Sp. Atk are raised."^The user raises all of their stats by two steps. Fails unless a foe is below half health."cThe user attacks with dark illusions. This also lowers the target's Defense stat by two steps."mThe target is attacked with a pulse of negative feelings. It has a 40% chance to make the target flinch."cA punch that inflicts double the damage if the user has been hurt by the foe in the same turn."PFor the rest of the round, the healing of all damaged Pokémon is reversed."ZThe user prepares a precise cut. Always a critical hit. This lowers the user's Speed."VThe target is dragged viciously through water. This has a 30% chance to waterlog."^The user hides stealthily, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes on the second turn."gThe user emits a wave of anxious feelings which overwhelms all nearby Pokémon, taking 50% recoil."PSummons moonglow for eight turns and raises the user's Attack by two steps."LLowers the target's Sp. Atk, then heals itself by the target's Sp. Atk."hThe user chomps hard, cutting the target's HP by 50%, and the user's HP is restored by 50% of that."dDamages the target's life force directly. During moonglow, the target also becomes frostbitten."dThe user tries to surprise-attack the target. Cannot miss in moonglow. Can random critical hit."_The user attacks and steals the foe's held item. It can't steal if the user holds an item."JThe user entangles the target's mind with dark thoughts, leeching it."?The user invades deep into the target's mind, leeching it."�The user demands tribute from the target. Scatters coins. Damage and coins are doubled if the target has a non-volatile status condition."KThe user steals the target's stat boosts, and then attacks. Goes last."pThe user slashes all around them, creating deep scars on all nearby foes. This lowers each target's Attack."tThe user schemes to raise its Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. During moonglow, also raises Speed by two steps."OThe user hacks at the target with great violence. Can random critical hit."oThe user attacks and steals the foe's held item simultaneously. You then choose a party member to hold it."zExplodes, dealing an extra 30 base power to all nearby for each Spikes hazard layer underneath them. The user faints."rThe user darkly follows the target before striking. Inflicts double damage on a target that is switching out."jStares harshly, dealing double damage if they hurt the user this turn. Only usable on the first turn."EThe user heals itself by half of its max HP, or 66% in moonglow."XThe user bullies the target, causing mental damage. This has a 20% chance to leech."kThe user swings aggressively while suffering from nightmares. This move can only be used while asleep."yThe user transforms into a cloud of vermin, charging and becoming hidden. On the second turn it ambushes the target."oThe user submerges the target in water, then bludgeons them repeatedly. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."gThe user sings with reckless abandon, annoying the target. There's a 30% chance they become dizzy."tThe user smacks the target and steals its item while it is stunned. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."HThe target is lulled to sleep. Can only be used during a Full Moon."]The target is pranked with a huge bucket of water. This has a 30% chance to waterlog it."�The target is hit with a generous donation. Consumes up to 1000 scattered coins. Base power is boosted by 10 for every 100 consumed."�Healing coral forms on the foe's side. For the next four turns, attacks on foes heal the user for 33% of the damage dealt. This can overheal."<Leeches the target by kissing them with its thin mouth."ZThe user dances in tune with a dreamlike energy, raising their Sp. Atk by four steps."lThe user goes to sleep and enters a dreamscape. This sets Sanctuary on the user's side for eight turns."aThe user tickles the target excessively, damaging it. This has a 20% chance to lower Attack."QThe target's mind is overloaded with emotion. Applies Torment to the target."gThe user shoots a magical arrow which seeks out the target's weak points. Can random critical hit."<An enchanting outcry. Can't miss and skips protections."yThe user dances vigorously, raising all its stats by three steps. The user’s stat steps are reset two turns later."}A patch of medicinal flowers sprouts across the battlefield. This heals every Pokémon for 1/8th HP each turn for five turns."TThe user makes a fool out of the target. This has a 50% chance of jinxing them."aThe user plays with the target with unneccessary force. It has a 50% chance to lower Attack."{The user draws the Crystal Caliburn, which empowers light and slice moves by 50% and transforms the holder into Royal form."WThe user flashes colorful light to damage the target. This move always goes first."GThe user chucks a party favor which explodes in the target's face."oMakes everyone's hearts beat together. Others can join in the Round and make the attack do greater damage."�The user uses honey to fully restore its HP. However, this lures swarming insects, trapping and binding the user for three turns."dThe user attempts to humble the target, guaranteeing a critical hit on foes with boosted stats."fThe user hopes for bad luck, jinxing the target. Attacks against them crit and pierce protection."lThe user wields an exaggerated power to strike the target. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."yThe target is taunted by a deceptive look. It can't use status moves this or next turn. This move always goes first."LThe user leeches the target, then welcomes in moonglow for eight turns."|Enables random critical hits for the user, doubles its critical hit chance, and raises its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."]The user causes an accident, damaging the target. This has a 30% chance of jinxing them."XThe user causes the target to trip and fall. This has a 50% chance of jinxing them."TAttacks nearby foes with a misty explosion. The user loses half its current HP."�The user disappears in a cloud of mist, charging and becoming hidden. On the next turn, the target becomes jinxed and frostbitten."]Summons moonglow for six turns, boosting Fairy-type attacks and heralding the Full Moon."EThe user invokes forbidden celestial powers to smite the target."FThe user throws a tricky punch. Can't miss and skips protections."`The user bites with playful abandon. This deals double damage on the user's first turn out."tThe user creates a puzzling area for eight turns in which Pokémon's unmodified Attack and Sp. Atk are swapped."iThe user foretells a terrible fate. Two turns later, the targeted spot is damaged by fated disaster."jThe user spins sugar into a ball launched at the target. The slower the user, the greater the damage."cThe user causes nearby objects to fall onto the target. This has a 30% chance of jinxing them."PA spirited wind blesses the user, raising its Sp. Atk, Speed, and Accuracy."GThe user goes on a wild tantrum, going on a rampage for two turns."wThe user swaps the target's held item with its own. It also switches its unmodified Speed with the target's Speed."LThe user uses fae magic to invoke the target's true name, jinxing them."VThe user attacks with its wards, dealing damage based on the user's Sp. Def stat."PStrikes the target with lunar light, then summons moonglow for eight turns."rThe user mutates its genetic code, transforming into any of its 3 other forms. Only useable as Deoxys Normal."[The user makes a risky, difficult attack. If it misses, the user's Accuracy is raised."^The user hides, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes the target on the second turn."OThe user makes a foolhardy, roundabout attack. It misses much of the time."/The target is multi-hit two to five times."iThe user foretells an attack. Two turns later, the targeted spot is struck by a well-planned attack."KThe user attacks with simple determination and rampages for two turns."MThe target is attacked with a slash of claws or blades, always critting."uThe user gleams with light. This lowers each foe's Sp. Atk by two steps and raises its own Sp. Atk by two steps."`The user prepares to defend itself. It'll survive the next three hits which would faint it."qThe user growls fiercely. This lowers each foe's Attack by two steps and raises its own Attack by two steps."=The user copies and gains the first ability of each foe."NThe user is roused, giving it the ability to use an extra move each turn."bThe user yawns, making all near foes drowsy. They'll fall asleep at the end of the next turn."mThe user attacks with a swift chop, destroying barriers. This lowers the target's Defense by five steps."lThe user raises its Attack and Defense by two steps, gains a lot of weight. User becomes Fighting-type."oThe user raises its Speed by two steps and quadruples its critical hit chance. User becomes Fighting-type."SThe user takes 50% less attack damage for 3 turns. User becomes Fighting-type."The user summons an allied Tyrogue. This raises its Defense by three steps, and its allies' by one. User becomes Fighting-type."aThe user tucks in its wings and charges from a low altitude. The user also takes 33% recoil."vThe user sets a powerful tailwind for 6 turns, which also increases move damage by 30%. User becomes Flying-type."FAll near foes are forced to switch out. User becomes Flying-type."dA move that only the avatar of Rayquaza can use. All enemies struck lose their flinch immunity."sThe user slashes all near foes with with poisonous blades or edges. Will be critical against poisoned targets."\It swamps the area around the user with a giant sludge wave, poisoning everyone struck."|The user raises its Attack, Defense, and Accuracy by two steps. This summons an allied Ekans. User becomes Poison-type."gThe user sets Grey Mist for 8 turns and gives themselves a Black Sludge. User becomes Poison-type."cA cloud of poison gas is sprayed at all nearby foes, poisoning them. User becomes Poison-type."bThe user lays two hazard layers of poison spikes on the foe's side. User becomes Poison-type."}The user intensifies Gravity for five turns and damages all enemies for 1/4th of their max HP. User becomes Ground-type."�The user restores 1/8th of its HP. Raises its offensive-, but lowers defensive stats at the end of each turn. User becomes Ground-type."]The user lays three hazard layers of Spikes on the foe's side. User becomes Ground-type."gA move that only the avatar of Groudon can use. Gravity is intensified for the rest of the battle."JThe user attacks with a prehistoric power which raises all its stats."IThe user attacks with a sparkling gem-like ray, dizzying the target."oBoulders are hurled at all near enemies, preventing their movement. This lowers their Speed by four steps."YThe user raises its Speed by six steps and gains a Rock Gem. User becomes Rock-type."kThe user summons sandstorm for six turns. This raises its Defense and Sp. Def. User becomes Rock-type."[The user restores 1/8th of its HP and summons an allied Combee. User becomes Bug-type."YThe user raises its Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Speed by two steps. User becomes Bug-type."vNearby foes are bound with silk. This lowers their Attack, Sp. Atk and Speed by two steps. User becomes Bug-type."SThe user applies a damaging curse to all nearby foes. User becomes Ghost-type."bAttackers against the user suffer recoil for the rest of the battle. User becomes Ghost-type."^The user strikes the target with three punches like bullets. This move always goes first."^The target is raked with steel claws twice. This raises the user's Attack after each hit."`The target is obliterated by a meteoric strike. This raises the user's Attack by two steps."eThe user raises its Defense by four steps and gains the ability Filter. User becomes Steel-type."]The user focuses intently, making every future attack critical. User becomes Steel-type."fThe user raises its Sp. Def by two steps and gains the ability Feedback. User becomes Steel-type."uThe user creates a Polarized Room for eight turns. This raises its Defense and Sp. Def. User becomes Steel-type."zA frenetic dance to uplift the fighting spirit. This raises the user's Attack by four steps. User becomes Steel-type."gThe user cloaks itself in fire and charges at the foe, burning it. The user also takes 33% recoil."fThe user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire. This lowers the target's Sp. Atk by six steps."aThe user lays two hazard layers of burning spikes on the foe's side. User becomes Fire-type."HThe user inflicts burns on all nearby foes. User becomes Fire-type."iThe user summons sunshine for six turns. This raises its Attack and Sp. Atk. User becomes Fire-type."iA spray of bubbles is forcefully ejected at all nearby foes. This lowers their Speed by three steps."WIt swamps the area with a giant wave, hitting every battler nearby and underwater."�The user enters a state of total focus, prevents stat steps from being lowered, raises Attack and Sp. Def, and becomes Water-type."kThe user summons rainstorm for six turns and surrounds itself with Aqua Ring. User becomes Water-type."LThe user inflicts waterlog on all nearby foes. User becomes Water-type."xA move that only the avatar of Kyogre can use. The user commands a Luvdisc avatar and a Remoraid avatar to join it."[The user forcefully shoots six seeds in rapid succession, spread among nearby enemies."aA nutrient-draining attack. The user's HP is restored by all the damage taken by the target."WThe user charges by gathering light, then blasts all near foes on the second turn."�The user heals all non-volatile status conditions on their side, gains the ability Stability, heals itself for 25% HP and becomes Grass-type."IThe user inflicts leech on all nearby foes. User becomes Grass-type."hThe user raises its Defense by two steps and gains the ability Iron Barbs. User becomes Grass-type."]The user scatters bursts of spores to induce sleep on all foes. User becomes Grass-type."The user summons an allied Gossifleur. This raises its Sp. Def by three steps, and its allies' by one. User becomes Grass-type."FA powerful electric blast is let loose on the target, numbing it."TThe user raises its Sp. Atk and Speed by two steps. User becomes Electric-type."KThe user inflicts numb on all nearby foes. User becomes Electric-type."TTwo turns after this move is used, a hunk of psychic energy attacks the target."hThe user raises its Sp. Def by four steps and gains the ability Unaware. User becomes Psychic-type."pThe user raises its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps and maximizes its Accuracy. User becomes Psychic-type."kThe user summons eclipse for six turns. This raises its Attack and Sp. Atk. User becomes Psychic-type."SBounces back status moves for the next three turns. User becomes Psychic-type."{The user summons an allied Abra. This raises its Sp. Atk by three steps, and its allies' by one. User becomes Psychic-type."dThe user creates an Odd Room for eight turns. This raises its Speed. User becomes Psychic-type."}The user employs hypnotic suggestion to make all nearby statused foes fall into a deep sleep. User becomes Psychic-type."OThe target is struck with an absolute zero beam of energy, frostbiting it."NThe user inflicts frostbite on all nearby foes. User becomes an Ice-type."_The user lays two hazard layers of frozen spikes on the foe's side. User becomes Ice-type."lThe user summons hail for six turns. This lowers every foe's Speed by two steps. User becomes Ice-type."XThe user raises its Attack, Defense, and Speed by two steps. User becomes Ice-type."The user crushes all near foes with evil intent. This deals double damage to targets with a non-volatile status condition."NThe user exhales a mighty gust that inflicts damage and numbs the target."sA move that only the avatar of Zekrom can use. All battlers gain Steel-type and have their stat changes reset."QThe user raises its Attack and Speed by two steps. User becomes Dragon-type."ZThe user lowers each near foe's highest stat by four steps. User becomes Dragon-type."oA move that only the avatar of Reshiram can use. All battlers have all of their stats raised by two steps."|The user summons an allied Poochyena. This raises its Attack by three steps, and its allies' by one. User becomes Dark-type."cThe user torments all near foes, preventing them from repeating moves. User becomes Dark-type."gThe user blasts all nearby foes with the moon's full power, lowering their Sp. Atk by three steps."HThe user raises its Sp. Atk by four steps. User becomes Fairy-type."yThe user summons moonglow for six turns. This raises the Defense and Sp. Def of all allies. User becomes Fairy-type."qThe user creates a Puzzle Room for 