STORY"#<c3=404040,B0B0B0>{1} {2}, {3}"g<c3=404040,B0B0B0>A mysterious Pokémon Egg received from <c3=F83820,E09890>{1}<c3=404040,B0B0B0>."1<c3=404040,B0B0B0>A mysterious Pokémon Egg."&<c3=404040,B0B0B0>"The Egg Watch"";It looks like this Egg will take a long time to hatch."BWhat will hatch from this? It doesn't seem close to hatching."BIt appears to move occasionally. It may be close to hatching."@Sounds can be heard coming from inside! It will hatch soon!"0<c3=E09890,F83820>Traits:<c3=F8F8F8,686868>"<c3=F8F8F8{2},686868>{1}"H<c3=E09890,F83820>Title:<c3=F8F8F8,686868> <c3=F8F8F8{2},686868>{1}"/<c3=E09890,F83820>Likes:<c3=F8F8F8,686868>"2<c3=E09890,F83820>Dislikes:<c3=F8F8F8,686868>"0<c3=F83820,E09890>Traits:<c3=404040,B0B0B0>"<c3=404040{2},B0B0B0>{1}"H<c3=F83820,E09890>Title:<c3=404040,B0B0B0> <c3=404040{2},B0B0B0>{1}"/<c3=F83820,E09890>Likes:<c3=404040,B0B0B0>"2<c3=F83820,E09890>Dislikes:<c3=404040,B0B0B0>"Met at Lv. {1}."Egg received."Traded at Lv. {1}."(Had a fateful encounter at Lv. {1}."#<c3=404040,B0B0B0>Egg hatched."Sp. Atk"Sp. Def"Main Ability is disabled."#{1} doesn't have Main Ability."{1} (USE: Check more)"{1} (USE)"Mark {1}"OK"/Do you want to check {1} in the MasterDex?"No items were given."(Unimplemented)"Item: {1}"(This Item has not been implemented."%HM moves can't be forgotten now."You must choose a move!"({1:s}
