andies."0Want to escape from here and return to {1}?"5It has no effect on Pokémon other than Shaymin."0This can't be used on the fainted Pokémon."{1} changed Forme!"XIt has no effect on Pokémon other than Tornadus, Thundurus, Landorus, or Enamorus."3It has no effect on Pokémon other than Hoopa."+You cannot use this item in this menu."4It has no effect on Pokémon other than Kyurem."Fuse with which Pokémon?"$It cannot be fused with itself."$It cannot be fused with an Egg."3It cannot be fused with that fainted Pokémon."+It cannot be fused with that Pokémon."/You have no room to separate the Pokémon."6It has no effect on Pokémon other than Necrozma."5It has no effect on Pokémon other than Calyrex."6It has no effect on Pokémon other than Giratina."4It has no effect on Pokémon other than Palkia."4It has no effect on Pokémon other than Dialga."Disperse the Gleam Powder?"#You disperse the Gleam Powder."FThe scent of the Gleam Powder pulls a shiny Pokémon towards you!"J... \wt[10]... \wt[10]... \wt[10]...\wt[10]Nope! There's no response."4The {1}'s indicating something right underfoot!" Huh? The {1}'s responding!"(There's an item buried around here!"{1} became healthy."Using item..."&{1} really enjoyed the chocolate!"Coins: {1}""The Exp Share was turned off."!The Exp Share was turned on."Harsh Noise"Soothing Sounds".Place the Noise Machine on which setting?""The Noise Machine is now off.";The Noise Machine begins playing a high-pitched noise."$Wild Pokémon are now repelled!"6The Noise Machine begins playing soothing sounds."(Wild Pokémon are now drawn to you!"=\i[OMINOUSEGG]...you hear whispers from the Ominous Egg.""\i[OMINOUSEGG]...sacrifice...",\i[OMINOUSEGG]...strength in avarice...")\i[OMINOUSEGG]...urge to dominate...".\i[OMINOUSEGG]...to stand above others..."2\i[OMINOUSEGG]...nothing can hide from you..."0\i[OMINOUSEGG]...the next stage requires..."%\i[OMINOUSEGG]...{1} feedings..."/\i[OMINOUSEGG]...metamorphosis complete..."%There is no room left in the PC!"2It's impossible to aim without being focused!"LIt's no good! It's impossible to aim at a Pokémon that's not in sight!"FIt's no good! It's impossible to aim when there are two Pokémon!"PIt's no good! It's impossible to aim when there are more than one Pokémon!"6There's no one near by to use the Poké X-Ray on!"(You point the Poké X-Ray at {1}..."6Victoire notices you glancing at the Poké X-Ray.";She smiles slightly and gives you an inscrutable look."/Using my own technology against us, I see."%I suppose I should be flattered."Y\db[Items/POKEMONLURE_inactive]The Pokémon Lure stops emitting fragrance.\wtnp[{1}]"X\db[Items/POKEMONLURE]The Pokémon Lure emits a sweet-smelling fragrance.\wtnp[{1}]"_Looking inside the journal, you see that the only page that hasn't fallen out is page {1}."7\i[RAGGEDJOURNAL]You've found page {1} of the {2}!"<You slot the page into its proper place in the journal."Read it now?"Page {1}"�Ah, to be on solid ground again. Away from Galar's suffocating industrial sprawl. Stable. Connected. Tranquil. No cold steel shifting and rocking beneath my feet. No stench of smoke and oil to burn my lungs."&Just me, my companion, and Makya."May 22nd"�I wonder if it's just me. So sentimental and wistful over little things I thought I knew. Is nostalgia tainting my perceptions? Or is the world truly as broken as it looks?"}My new friend makes me expect the latter. A sad story. But... inspiring nonetheless. Maybe I'll meet them again someday."May 26th"�Life. Not just Life as life – Life as creation. Life as energy. Life as imagination, and falsehood, and memory, and motion. Over six days in Makya, this is the one place that seems to be governed by Life... and not its negation."]The world is dead. And Makya stands as little more than a polished mirror. What a shame."May 29th"tI left last night when the earth began to rumble. I only returned for my companion, despite my... reservations."dA great pit separates me from yesterday's memories. A dozen blackened eyes study my every step."What's done is done."June 4th"�At every turn, a set of eyes. On every perch, a silver scout. But... surely they cannot see everywhere? My friend at the Monument seemed to imply as much."�But with every step I take, I find a new reason to check over my shoulder. Whether it's guilt or fear that guides me to that great tower... well. I'd rather not dwell on that yet."June 6th"9This was a mistake. This was <i>all</i> a mistake..."�A set of silver eyes rests atop Carnation Tower today. I couldn't shake the feeling that it expected me... He must know I stole His reign. Nothing makes sense if He doesn't."�To anyone reading this, I urge you: Speak to my friend at the Monument. As long as He stands without rule, we can act without fear."June 11th"I can't afford to speak."I can't afford to trust."'I can barely afford to write this."�A woman with hollow eyes and an uncanny smile approached me today. She asked about my history. She asked about Makya. She asked... about Him."1Tomorrow. All of this ends tomorrow morning."June 13th"!This can't be a coincidence."SMy best hope of escaping His grasp... but I can tell we're not moving anymore."uNobody seems to believe me. We can't even see the waves! And I've heard four hooves circling my bed for hours..."He won."June 15th"—Oriel"'Which page would you like to read?"9But a repellent's effect still lingers from earlier.";You shake the Rusted Compass, but it remains stagnant."+Error loading data on the current map."8You get a sense of a piece of loot hidden nearby..."6You receive a vision of a piece of nearby loot..."hidden loot"The {1} is very far away!"The {1} is far away!"%The {1} is at a medium distance!"The {1} is close by!"The {1} is very close by!"<The {1} is EXTREMELY close! You're nearly on top of it!"\i[{1}]{2}"The inscription reads:"J<i>Judgement awaits. Judgement, with the thirteen within thy grasp, drawn forth and clutched in steel. The student, the twin wyrms, the guardia