tenth"eleventh"ROdds are displayed for the {1} round matches, gathered from a spectator poll.">{1} percent of respondents expect you to win against {2}."9You a big shot, huh? Well, we're here to supply you."Get your supplies here!".Hello, and welcome to the Starters Store!"+I'm the {1}-type starters salesperson!"PYou can buy a {1}-type starter Pokémon from me if you have ${2} and a {3}."GYou can buy a {1}-type starter Pokémon from me if you have a {2}."FI'm sorry, but it seems as though you don't have that much money."<I'm sorry, but it seems as though you don't have a {1}."?Which {1}-type starter Pokémon would you like to look at?"`Understood, please come back if there's a {1}-type starter Pokémon you'd like to purchase!"Buy Pokémon"0\PN handed over ${1} and a {2} in exchange."'\PN handed over a {1} in exchange."7Thank you for shopping here at the Starters Store!"DMy apologies, I don't know what to do with this type of fossil."2A new discovery, you say? Let me take a look."'Well, hmm... I have some bad news."=There's not a lot of genetic data left in this fossil..."*It would not be ethical to revive it."IAs an aside, my grad student across the table isn't so fastidious..."VPlease make sure he doesn't get his hands on any sub-par specimens like this one."?Error! Could not determine how to revive the given fossil."&\PN hands over the {1} and $3000."3The procedure has started, now just to wait..."4It's done! Here is your newly revived Pokémon!"=What!? You want me to make a combo fossil? Not a chance."MMaybe someone else is interested in creative torture, but I sure am not."WI uh... can't actually revive this. Haven't completed the relevant coursework yet."0Go talk to my supervisor. She can help you."&\PN hands over the {1} and $2000."MIs that...? Very intriguing. There's not a lot to work with here, but..."SIt feels... familiar. This reminds me of something I played a long time ago..."HIf I just add this here... maybe I can cobble something together..."8Oh, another one of these? Asset re-use. How boring."$I suppose it'll still be fun..."*Yes! It's aliiiiiiive! Muahahahahaha!"ZNot that it's any of your concern, but I took a DNA sample from the revived creature."mMy wonderful creation should not be alone in this world. I'll have to find a way to make more of them...":Okay, now go away. I won't suffer any more EXP waste."#The fossils can't be the same!"@Error! Could not determine how to revive the given fossils."-What style would you like me to give it?"/What pattern would you like me to give it?"8I do not spy any Origin Ore among your possessions.":Ah, I was looking forward to flexing my skills today."#Now just to work my magicks..."8Poof! And so the impossible has been made possible!"LMy hopes go with you. Be respectful of this relic which you now posess."PDon't try to trick me with some knock-off, you don't have any Gleam Powder!"No suitable canvases?"QI'm surprised, you look like you'd have more money, but you can't afford me.".\PN hands over the {1}, $30,000, and {2}."And so my work begins!"7Now, bask in the beautiful glow of your shiny {1}!"6No need to thank me, its beauty is reward enough.""The money isn't bad either..."<Ah, no suitable Pokémon exists within your collection?"7Return to me if you encounter any in your travels."+My hopes go with you. Live the legend!"Care to buy some?"$You see their value, don't you?"0Maybe you'll be the one to bring them back?"EOhoh! I'm honored that you would pay my store a visit, champion."7One-Stop Tech Shop, for all your electronic needs."Hurry and buy some."-I'm sure you'll appreciate one of these."0I've got the tools. Just don't tell anyone."Any interest in buying?"0Trust me, nobody needs these more than you."7Nature's Gallery, your gateway to nature's beauty."AWelcome to Emma's Empolorium! What're you looking for today?":I've got the lion's share of powerful items. Buy now!"CWelcome to Diego's Wares! Please, come look through our goods."=Yo, I'm Adam, the gem guy. Gonna buy some gems, or what?"8Poké Balls of all sorts stocked here. Take a look!":Welcome to the Poké Ball Depot! How may I serve you?"FCustom Pokéballs, made to order! You won't find these in a mart!",All the Pokéballs you could ever need.".How can we help to empower your Pokémon?"1Care to buy some of our extra berry harvest?">Some of these are illegal to import. Don't get me caught."<Welcome to Sweetrock Candy Outlet! How may I serve you?"(Name's Herbert. Care for any herbs?"What're ya buyin'?"%Take a look, it's all delicious!"What can I get you?"#Farm food, fresh for feastin'."(Grab a Tulumba, a Makyan specialty!"It's a vending machine."Eleig Boating Dock"Guardian Island"Eventide Isle"Isle of Dragons"Tri Island"Spirit Atoll"=Dock ID {1} has no unlock_switch defined. Cannot unlock!"7You can now travel to <imp>{1}</imp> on your boat!"#\wm{1}\me[Slots win]\wtnp[80]"%All boating spots were unlocked."1There are no other places you can travel to."Invalid Achievement {1}.">Achievement {1} is already unlocked! Cannot unlock again."QAchievement {1} is blocked from being completed, since randomizer is active."Unlocking achievement {1}."Invalid Achievement {1}"#Achievement Unlocked:
